<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="LUK" style="id">- Macedonian Arli Romani</book>
  <para style="h">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc1">O evangelije e Lukaskoro</para>
  <para style="toc2">Luka</para>
  <para style="toc3">Lk</para>
  <para style="mt1">O Evangelije e Lukaskoro</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="LUK 1" />
  <para style="s1">Voved</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 1:1" />Cenimeja Teofile, but džene počminge te pišinen bašo adava so ulo maškar amende. <verse eid="LUK 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 1:2" />Ola pišinge agjar sar so vakerge amenge okola so taro početok sine svedokija hem sine sluge bašo lafi e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 1:3" />Agjar me tuke pišinava sa redoja, adaleske so sa taro početok proveringjum, <verse eid="LUK 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 1:4" />te šaj oveja sigurno deka čače tano sa adava so sijan sikavdo.<verse eid="LUK 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O angeli vakerela bašo bijanibe e Jovane Krstiteleskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 1:5" />Ko vreme koga o Irod sine caro ki Judeja, sine nesavo svešteniko so vikinela pe sine Zaharija taro redo e Avijaskoro. E Zaharijaskiri romni i Elisaveta isto agjar sine taro seme e Aroneskoro. <verse eid="LUK 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 1:6" />O Zaharija hem i Elisaveta sine pravedna anglo Devel, adaleske so živinge palo sa o zapovedija hem o zakonja e Gospodareskere. <verse eid="LUK 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 1:7" />Ama len na sine len čhave soske i Elisaveta našti sine te ačhol khamni, a solduj džene više sine phure.<verse eid="LUK 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 1:8" />Jekh dive koga o Zaharijaskiri grupa taro sveštenikija thargja temjan, togaš o Zaharija da kerela sine pi buti sar svešteniko anglo Devel. <verse eid="LUK 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 1:9" />Ov palo adeti e sveštenikongoro, ždrepkaja sine birimo te khuvel ko Hrami e Gospodareskoro hem te tharel temjan. <verse eid="LUK 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 1:10" />Dži kote o Zaharija tharela sine o temjan ko Hrami, sa o manuša molinena pe sine avrik.<verse eid="LUK 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 1:11" />Togaš e Zaharijaske pojavisalilo angeli e Gospodareskoro, so terdilo ki desno strana taro oltari kote so tharela pe sine o temjan. <verse eid="LUK 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 1:12" />Koga dikhla le o Zaharija, bunisalilo hem uklingja le dar.<verse eid="LUK 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 1:13" />A o angeli vakergja leske: “Ma dara, Zaharija! O Devel šungja ti molitva. Ti romni i Elisaveta ka bijanel tuke čhavo, i ka de le o anav Jovan. <verse eid="LUK 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 1:14" />Ka ove but radosno baši leske hem but džene ka radujnen pe bašo leskoro bijanibe. <verse eid="LUK 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 1:15" />Adaleske so ka ovel baro manuš anglo Gospodari hem nikat nane te pijel mol hem jako pijbe.<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1:15 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">jako pijbe. </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akava znažinela bašo alkohol</char></note> Ov ka ovel pherdo e Sveti Duhoja panda pred te bijangjovel. <verse eid="LUK 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 1:16" />Ov ka iranel bute Izraelcon anglo Gospodari, lengoro Devel. <verse eid="LUK 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 1:17" />Ka džal anglo Gospodari sar glasniko ko duho hem ki sila e prorokoskiri e Ilijaskiri. Ka smirinel e daden lengere čhavencar hem okolen so na šunena ka iranel len prema i mudrost e pravednikongiri. Ka spreminel e narodo te oven spremna bašo e Gospodareskoro ajbe.”<verse eid="LUK 1:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 1:18" />I o Zaharija pučlja e angele: “Sar me ka džanav deka čače ka ovel adava so phengjan? Me sijum phuro hem mi romni da ko berša.”<verse eid="LUK 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 1:19" />A o angeli odgovoringja leske: “Me sijum o Gabrijel, o angeli so tergjola anglo Devel. Ov bičhalgja man te kerav tuja lafi hem te vakerav tuke akava šukar lafi. <verse eid="LUK 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 1:20" />I akana ka ove laloro hem ka našti te kere lafi dži ko adava dive koga ka ovel, soske na verujngjan me lafende, so ka phergjoven ko pravo vreme.”<verse eid="LUK 1:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 1:21" />Ko adava momenti o narodo adžikerela sine e Zaharija hem čudingja pe so doborom ačhilo ko Hrami. <verse eid="LUK 1:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 1:22" />A koga iklilo o Zaharija, našti sine te kerel lafi. I ola svatinge deka sine le vizija ko Hrami, adaleske so kerela lenge sine vastencar, ama našti kerela sine lafi.<verse eid="LUK 1:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 1:23" />Koga završinge o dive tari leskiri služba ko Hrami, o Zaharija irangja pe khere. <verse eid="LUK 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 1:24" />Palo adava leskiri romni i Elisaveta ačhili khamni hem pandž masek phandla pe ko kher hem vakergja: <verse eid="LUK 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 1:25" />“O Gospodari kergja te ačhovav khamni. Akana sikavgja mange pi milost hem cidingja mi ladž maškar o manuša.”<verse eid="LUK 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O angeli vakerela bašo bijanibe e Isuseskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 1:26" />Koga i Elisaveta sine šofto masek khamni, o Devel bičhalgja e angele e Gabrijele ko Galilejsko gradi, Nazaret, <verse eid="LUK 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 1:27" />ki Marija so sine čhaj hem sine manglardi e Josifeske, so sine taro seme e caroskoro e Davideskoro.<verse eid="LUK 1:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 1:28" />Koga alo o angeli, phengja e Marijake: “Radujn tut! O Gospodari tano tuja! Ov tano but milostlivo prema tute!”<verse eid="LUK 1:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 1:29" />A i Marija but voznemiringja pe taro leskere lafija, i pučlja pe so značinela akava pozdrav.<verse eid="LUK 1:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 1:30" />A o angeli phengja lake: “Ma dara, Marije! Adaleske so arakhlan milost anglo Devel. <verse eid="LUK 1:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 1:31" />Tu ka ačhove khamni hem ka bijane čhavo, i ka de le o anav Isus. <verse eid="LUK 1:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 1:32" />Ov ka ovel baro hem ka vikinel pe Čhavo e Najbare Devleskoro. O Devel o Gospodari ka del le o troni leskere parapaposkoro e Davideskoro. <verse eid="LUK 1:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 1:33" />Hem ov ka carujnel upro pleme e Jakoveskoro zasekogaš hem leskoro carstvo nane te ovel le kraj.”<verse eid="LUK 1:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 1:34" />Togaš i Marija pučlja e angele: “Sar šaj te ovel adava koga me sijum čhaj?”<verse eid="LUK 1:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 1:35" />A o angeli odgovoringja lake: “O Sveti Duh ka hulel upra tute hem i sila e Najbare Devleskiri ka avel upri tute. Adaleske adava čhavo, so ka bijane, ka ovel sveto hem ka vikinel pe Čhavo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 1:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 1:36" />Akje, ti familija i Elisaveta da ko phure berša ačhili khamni hem ka bijanel murš. A oj tani adaja kaske so vakerena sine deka našti te ačhol khamni, a akana i šov masek khamni. <verse eid="LUK 1:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 1:37" />Adaleske so o Devel šaj te kerel sa so vakerela!”<verse eid="LUK 1:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 1:38" />Togaš i Marija phengja: “Akje me i sluginka e Gospodareskiri, neka ovel spored leskiri vojla.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:38">I o angeli gelo peske latar.<verse eid="LUK 1:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I Marija džala te dikhel e Elisaveta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 1:39" />Adala dive i Marija spremingja pe hem sigjargja te džal ko ridsko than, ko jekh gradi tari Judeja. <verse eid="LUK 1:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 1:40" />Koga resla adathe, khugja ko kher e Zaharijaskoro hem pozdravingja pe e Elisavetaja.<verse eid="LUK 1:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 1:41" />Koga i Elisaveta šungja e Marijakoro pozdrav, mrdingja o čhavo lake ko vogi hem i Elisaveta pherdili e Sveti Duhoja. <verse eid="LUK 1:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 1:42" />Hem vikingja sa pe glasoja: “Najblagoslovimi sijan tu, Marije, maškar o džuvla hem blagoslovimo o čhavo ko to vogi! <verse eid="LUK 1:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 1:43" />Ama kotar mange akaja čest so tu i daj me Gospodareskiri alan ki mande? <verse eid="LUK 1:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 1:44" />Adaleske so, koga šungjum to pozdrav, o čhavo tari radost mrdingja mange ko vogi. <verse eid="LUK 1:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 1:45" />Blagoslovimi sijan tu, Marije, so verujngjan deka ka phergjol adava so phengja o Gospodari.”<verse eid="LUK 1:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I Marija slavinela e Devle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 1:46" />Togaš i Marija phengja:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 1:46" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:46">“Mi duša slavinela e Gospodare,<verse eid="LUK 1:46" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 1:47" />hem mo duho radujnela pe ko Devel, mo Spasiteli,<verse eid="LUK 1:47" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 1:48" />so ulo milostlivo upri pi ponizno sluginka.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:48">I taro akava dive sa o generacije ka phenen deka sijum blagoslovimi džuvli,<verse eid="LUK 1:48" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 1:49" />adaleske so baro šukaripe kergja mange o Zoralo Devel.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:49">Sveto tano leskoro anav.<verse eid="LUK 1:49" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 1:50" />Ov tano milostlivo e manušenge tari generacija ki generacija</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:50">so darana lestar.<verse eid="LUK 1:50" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 1:51" />Pe silno vasteja kergja bare bukja;</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:51">rasturingja okolen so kerena pe bare ko pumare srcija.<verse eid="LUK 1:51" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 1:52" />Peravgja e vladitelen taro lengoro tronija,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:52">a vazdingja e poniznon.<verse eid="LUK 1:52" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 1:53" />Čajlargja e bokhalen šukar bukjencar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:53">a e barvalen mukhla len čuče vastencar.<verse eid="LUK 1:53" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 1:54" />Pomožingja e Izraelconge, pe slugenge.</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:54">Na bistergja te ovel milostlivo,<verse eid="LUK 1:54" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 1:55" />e Avraameske hem leskere semeske zasekogaš,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:55">sar so vetingja amare parapaponge.”<verse eid="LUK 1:55" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 1:56" />I Marija ačhili ki Elisaveta trin masek, a palo adava irangja pe khere.<verse eid="LUK 1:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O bijanibe e Jovaneskoro e Krstiteleskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 1:57" />Koga alo o vreme te bijanel i Elisaveta, bijangja murš. <verse eid="LUK 1:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 1:58" />Lakiri familija hem o komšije šunge deka o Gospodari sikavgja lake bari milost hem ola da radujnge pe laja.<verse eid="LUK 1:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 1:59" />A koga e čhave sine le ofto dive, ko Zaharija khedinge pe o manuša te obrezinen e čhave, i mangle te den le leskere dadeskoro anav – Zaharija. <verse eid="LUK 1:59" /><verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 1:60" />Ama i Elisaveta phengja: “Na! Leskoro anav ka ovel Jovan!”<verse eid="LUK 1:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 1:61" />A ola phenge lake: “Nikoj tari ti familija na vikinela pe agjar.”<verse eid="LUK 1:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 1:62" />I vastencar pučle e Zaharija savo anav mangela te del pe e čhaveske.<verse eid="LUK 1:62" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 1:63" />Togaš o Zaharija rodingja te den le jekh tikni phal bašo pišiba hem pišingja: “Leskoro anav tano Jovan.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 1:63">I sarinen čudinge pe.<verse eid="LUK 1:63" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 1:64" />Hem taro jekh puti e Zaharijaskoro muj phravdilo hem šaj sine palem te kerel lafi, i počmingja te slavinel e Devle.<verse eid="LUK 1:64" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 1:65" />Hem uklingja dar sa komšijen. A ko celo ridsko than e Judejakoro kergja pe lafi adalestar so ulo. <verse eid="LUK 1:65" /><verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 1:66" />Sarinen so šunge adava, pučena pe sine: “So ka ovel akale čhavestar?” Adaleske so o vas e Gospodareskoro sine leja.<verse eid="LUK 1:66" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Zaharija prorokujnela e Spasitelestar hem e Jovanestar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 1:67" />A o Zaharija, e Jovaneskoro dad, pherdilo e Sveti Duhoja hem prorokujngja:<verse eid="LUK 1:67" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 1:68" />“Slava e Gospodareske e Izraeleskere Devleske,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:68">soske alo hem otkupingja pe narodo.<verse eid="LUK 1:68" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 1:69" />Vazdingja amenge zoralo Spasiteli,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:69">taro seme e caroskoro e Davideskoro, pe slugaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 1:69" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 1:70" />Sar so vakergja panda angleder,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:70">preku pe sveta prorokija,<verse eid="LUK 1:70" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 1:71" />vazdingja amenge zoralo Spasiteli te spasinel amen taro amare dušmajna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:71">hem sa e manušengere vastendar so mrzinena amen.<verse eid="LUK 1:71" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="72" style="v" sid="LUK 1:72" />Sikavgja pi milost amare parapaponge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:72">hem phergja po sveto zavet,<verse eid="LUK 1:72" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="73" style="v" sid="LUK 1:73" />i sovli so dengja e Avraameske amare parapaposke:<verse eid="LUK 1:73" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="74" style="v" sid="LUK 1:74" />te ikalel amen amare dušmanengere vastendar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:74">te šaj služinaja leske bizi dar,<verse eid="LUK 1:74" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="75" style="v" sid="LUK 1:75" />ko svetost hem ki pravednost anglo leste sa dži kote sijem dživde.<verse eid="LUK 1:75" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="76" style="v" sid="LUK 1:76" />A tu Jovan, mo čhavo, ka ove vikimo proroko e Najbareskoro,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:76">adaleske so ka dža anglo Gospodari te spremine leske o drumo.<verse eid="LUK 1:76" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="77" style="v" sid="LUK 1:77" />Ka sikave leskere narodon sar te pendžaren o spasenije</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:77">preku o oprostiba taro lengere grevija.<verse eid="LUK 1:77" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="78" style="v" sid="LUK 1:78" />Adaleske so e Devleskoro srce tano milostlivo,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:78">preku so o kham ka avel ki amende taro nebo<verse eid="LUK 1:78" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="79" style="v" sid="LUK 1:79" />te šaj te svetinel okolenge so živinena ki temnina</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 1:79">hem ki senka e meribaskiri,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 1:79">te vodinel amen ko drumo e mireskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 1:79" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="80" style="v" sid="LUK 1:80" />A o čhavo o Jovan bajrola sine hem ovela sine silno ko duho. Koga barilo, živinela sine ki pustina sa dži kote na iklilo anglo Izraelcija te propovedinel.<verse eid="LUK 1:80" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="LUK 2" />
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro bijanibe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 2:1" />Ko adava vreme, o Rimsko caro o Avgust dengja naredba te kerel pe popis sa e manušenge ko carstvo. <verse eid="LUK 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 2:2" />Adava sine prvo popis kerdo dži kote o Kvirinij sine upravniko ki Sirija. <verse eid="LUK 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 2:3" />I sekoj gelo ko po gradi te potpišinel pe. <verse eid="LUK 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 2:4" />Agjar o Josif gelo taro gradi Nazaret ki Galileja, ki Judeja, ko Vitleem, ko gradi e Davideskoro, adaleske so sine tari familija hem taro seme e Davideskoro. <verse eid="LUK 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 2:5" />O Josif gelo adathe te potpišinel pe, ple verenicaja e Marijaja, so sine khamni. <verse eid="LUK 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 2:6" />Dži kote sine adathe ko Vitleem, alo o vreme e Marijake te bijanel e čhave. <verse eid="LUK 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 2:7" />Koga bijangja pe prvo čhave, pakjargja le ko pherne hem čhigja le ko pus, soske na sine gostinsko soba baši lenge.<verse eid="LUK 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O angejla vakerena e pastirenge deka bijandilo o Spasiteli</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 2:8" />Ko adava than, adaja rat sine paše nesave pastijra so arakhena sine pumare bakhren ki niva. <verse eid="LUK 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 2:9" />I taro jekh puti pojavisalilo lenge o angeli e Gospodareskoro hem i slava e Gospodareskiri osvetlingja len, a ola but darandile.<verse eid="LUK 2:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 2:10" />Ama o angeli phengja lenge: “Ma daran! Akje anava tumenge šukar haberi, so ka anel bari radost sa e manušenge! <verse eid="LUK 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 2:11" />Avdive ko gradi e Davideskoro bijandilo tumenge o Spasiteli, soj tano o Hristos o Gospodari. <verse eid="LUK 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 2:12" />Akava ka ovel tumenge o znako: ka arakhen e čhave pakjardo ko pherne hem pašlola ko pus.”<verse eid="LUK 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 2:13" />Taro jekh puti, e angeleja pojavisalili bari vojska angejla so falindor e Devle vakerge:<verse eid="LUK 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 2:14" />“Slava e Devleske ko učipe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:14">a ki phuv mir e manušencar, so lencar o Devel tano zadovolno!”<verse eid="LUK 2:14" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 2:15" />Koga o angejla irange pe ko nebo, o pastijra phenge maškar peste: “Ajde te dža ko Vitleem hem te dikha adava so phengja amenge o Gospodari.”<verse eid="LUK 2:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 2:16" />I gele sigate, hem arakhle e Marija hem e Josife hem e čhave sar pašlola sine ko pus. <verse eid="LUK 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 2:17" />Koga dikhle e čhave, vakerge javerenge sa so sine phendo e čhavestar. <verse eid="LUK 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 2:18" />Hem sarine so šunge adava taro pastijra sine začudime. <verse eid="LUK 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 2:19" />Ama i Marija garavela sine sa akala bukja ko po srce hem razmislinela sine. <verse eid="LUK 2:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 2:20" />O pastijra gele peske, slavindor hem falindor e Devle bašo sa so šunge hem so dikhle, agjar sar so sine phendo lenge.<verse eid="LUK 2:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 2:21" />A ko oftoto dive koga trebela sine te obrezinen e čhave, denge le o anav Isus, sar so phengja sine o angeli angleder te ačhol i Marija khamni.<verse eid="LUK 2:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse anena ko Hrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 2:22" />Koga alo o vreme bašo adeti i daj te čistinel pe palo e Mojseskoro Zakoni, o Josif hem i Marija legarge e čhave ko Erusalim te anen le anglo Gospodari <verse eid="LUK 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 2:23" />(sar so sine pišimo ko Zakoni e Gospodareskoro: “Sekova prvo bijamo murš trebela te posvetinel pe e Gospodareske”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 13:2">Iz 13:2</ref>,<ref loc="EXO 13:12">12</ref>.</char></note>) <verse eid="LUK 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 2:24" />hem te den žrtva (sar soj phendo ko Zakoni e Gospodareskoro: “duj tikne gulubija ili duj terne gulubija.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:24 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 12:8">Lev 12:8</ref>.</char></note>”)<verse eid="LUK 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 2:25" />A ko Erusalim sine jekh manuš so vikinela pe Simeon. Ov sine pravedno hem pobožno. Adžikerela sine te avel o Mesija te spasinel e Izraelcon, hem o Sveti Duh sine upro leste. <verse eid="LUK 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 2:26" />Leske sine phendo taro Sveti Duh deka nane te merel sa dži kote angleder na dikhela e Gospodareskere Mesija<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2:26 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Mesija </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akaja Evrejsko forma ko Grčko lafi Christos značinela pomazaniko, so ko javera biblije bešela sar Hristos.</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 2:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 2:27" />O Sveti Duh vakergja leske te džal ko Hrami, i ov gelo. Togaš dikhla e Josife hem e Marija so ange e čhave e Isuse ko Hrami te keren adava so sine o adeti taro Zakoni. <verse eid="LUK 2:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 2:28" />O Simeon lela e čhave ko pe vasta hem blagodaringja pe e Devleske vakerindor:<verse eid="LUK 2:28" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 2:29" />“Gospode, akana me to sluga šaj te merav ko mir,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:29">sar so phengja mange.<verse eid="LUK 2:29" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 2:30" />Soske me jakha dikhle to spasenije,<verse eid="LUK 2:30" /></para>
  <para style="q2">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 2:31" />so spremingjan le anglo jakha sa e nacijenge.<verse eid="LUK 2:31" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 2:32" />Ka ovel svetlina so ka svetinel okolenge so na džanena tut,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 2:32">hem ka anel slava te narodoske e Izraelconge<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2:32 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Izraelconge </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 42:6">Isa 42:6</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 49:6">49:6</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 13:47">Del 13:47</ref>; <ref loc="ACT 26:23">26:23</ref>.</char></note>.”<verse eid="LUK 2:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 2:33" />E Isuseskoro dad hem i daj čudisalile adalestar so o Simeon phengja baši leske.<verse eid="LUK 2:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 2:34" />Togaš o Simeon blagoslovingja len hem phengja e Marijake e Isuseskere dajake: “Akava čhavo i birimo buten te peravel hem te vazdel ko Izrael. Ov tano birimo te ovel e Devleskoro znako, ama but džene ka otfrlinen le. <verse eid="LUK 2:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 2:35" />Ka sikaven pe butengere garavde misle, ama i čhurik ka posavel ti duša.”<verse eid="LUK 2:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I Ana blagodarinela e Devleske bašo Mesija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 2:36" />Adathe sine i proročka i Ana, i čhaj e Fanuileskiri taro pleme e Ašireskoro. Oj sine ko phure berša, a pe romeja živingja efta berša. <verse eid="LUK 2:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 2:37" />Palo adava sine udovica dži ko oftovardešu štar berš. Oj nikat na mukhla o Hrami, nego služinela sine dive rat, molindor hem postindor. <verse eid="LUK 2:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 2:38" />Ko adava momenti, ali uza lende, blagodaringja e Devleske bašo čhavo, hem lela te vakerel bašo čhavo sarinenge so adžikerena spasenije e Erusalimeske.<verse eid="LUK 2:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 2:39" />Koga o Josif hem i Marija kerge sa so sine pišimo ko Zakoni e Gospodareskoro, irange pe ko pumaro gradi ko Nazaret ki Galileja. <verse eid="LUK 2:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 2:40" />A o čhavo bajrola sine hem zorajlola, pherindor mudrost hem i blagodat e Devleskiri sine upro leste.<verse eid="LUK 2:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O čhavo o Isus ko Hrami</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 2:41" />Sekova berš o dad hem i daj e Isuseskere džana sine ko Erusalim bašo prazniko Pasha. <verse eid="LUK 2:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 2:42" />Koga e Isuse sine le dešuduj berš, palo adeti, ola gele adari te slavinen o prazniko. <verse eid="LUK 2:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 2:43" />Koga nakhla o prazniko, dži kote iranena pe sine khere o Josif hem i Marija na primetinge deka lengoro čhavo o Isus ačhilo ko Erusalim. <verse eid="LUK 2:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 2:44" />Mislindor deka o Isus tano maškar o manuša so džana peske sine lencar, gele jekh dive phirindor. A poslem počminge te roden le maškar pumari familija hem ko amala. <verse eid="LUK 2:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 2:45" />Koga našti arakhle le, irange pe ko Erusalim te roden le. <verse eid="LUK 2:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 2:46" />I palo trin dive arakhle le ko Hrami, sar bešela maškar o učitejla, sar šunela len hem pučela len. <verse eid="LUK 2:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 2:47" />Sarine so šunena le sine, začudime sine taro leskoro džandipe hem taro leskere odgovojra.<verse eid="LUK 2:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 2:48" />Koga dikhle le leskoro dad hem i daj but čudisalile. Leskiri daj phengja leske: “Mo čhavo, soske kergjan amenge akava? To dad hem me but darandilem hem rodingjem tut!”<verse eid="LUK 2:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 2:49" />A o Isus pučlja len: “Soske rodena man? Na džanena li deka mora te ovav me Dadeske ko kher?”<verse eid="LUK 2:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 2:50" />Ama i Marija hem o Josif na svatinge so o Isus mangla te phenel lenge adaleja.<verse eid="LUK 2:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 2:51" />Palo adava, o Isus gelo lencar ko Nazaret hem sine lenge poslušno. A i daj leskiri sa akala bukja garavela len sine ko po srce. <verse eid="LUK 2:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 2:52" />A o Isus bajrola sine ki mudrost, ko telo hem ki blagodat anglo Devel hem anglo manuša.<verse eid="LUK 2:52" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="LUK 3" />
  <para style="s1">O Jovan Krstitel spreminela o drumo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 3:1" />Koga o caro o Tiberija vladingja upro e Rimeskoro carstvo dešupandž berš, o Pontij Pilat vladingja ki Judeja, o Irod vladingja ki Galileja, a leskoro phral o Filip vladingja ki Itureja hem ko Trahonitida, o Lisanija vladingja ki Avilinija, <verse eid="LUK 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 3:2" />hem koga o Ana hem o Kajafa sine bare sveštenikija, e Devleskoro lafi alo e Zaharijaskere čhaveske e Jovaneske ki pustina. <verse eid="LUK 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 3:3" />I o Jovan gelo ko sa o thana tari reka Jordan te propovedinel e manušenge deka trebela te iranen pe ko Devel hem te oven krstime, te šaj o Devel te oprostinel lengere grevija. <verse eid="LUK 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 3:4" />Sar soj pišimo ko prorok Isaija:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 3:4" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">“Ov tano o glaso so vikinela ki pustina:</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:4">‘Spreminen o drumo e Gospodareskoro!</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:4">Ramnonen o drumija leskere!<verse eid="LUK 3:4" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 3:5" />Sekoja dolina te phergjol,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">a sekoja planina hem rido te peren!</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 3:5">O bange drumija te oven ispravime</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 3:5">a o neramna drumija te oven ramnome!<verse eid="LUK 3:5" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 3:6" />I sa o manuša ka dikhen e Devleskoro spasenije<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">3:6 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Spasenije </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 40:3-5">Isa 40:3-5</ref>.</char></note>.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 3:7" />A o Jovan vakergja bute manušenge so iklile te krstinel len: “Tumen e sapeskere čhave! Koj vakergja tumenge te našen tari e Devleskiri holi so avela? <verse eid="LUK 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 3:8" />Sikaven tumare životoja deka čače pokajngjen tumen hem ma mislinen deka i dovolno te phene ki tumende: ‘O Avraam tano amaro parapapo.’ Adaleske vakerava tumenge o Devel šaj akale barendar te vazdel čhave e Avraameske. <verse eid="LUK 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 3:9" />Akje o tover taro sudo e Devleskoro više tano ko koreno e kašteske, hem sekova kaš so na dela šukar plodi ka ovel čhindo hem frdimo ki jag.”<verse eid="LUK 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 3:10" />A o narodo pučlja le: “So trebela te kera?”<verse eid="LUK 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 3:11" />A o Jovan odgovoringja lenge: “Kas isi duj gada, neka del okole kas so nane, a kas isi hajbaske, neka del okole kas so nane.”<verse eid="LUK 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 3:12" />Nesave danočnikija da ale te oven krstime hem pučle e Jovane: “Učitele, so te kera amen?”<verse eid="LUK 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 3:13" />Ov odgovoringja lenge: “Ma roden poviše danok taro adava so o zakoni phenela tumenge te roden.”<verse eid="LUK 3:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 3:14" />Togaš nesave vojnikija da pučle e Jovane: “A amen so te kera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 3:14">A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Nikastar ma len pare silaja hem nikas ma tužinen hovavno, i oven zadovolna tumare plataja.”<verse eid="LUK 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 3:15" />A o narodo adžikerela sine e Mesija i sarinen pučle pe ki peste nane li o Jovan adava. <verse eid="LUK 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 3:16" />Adaleske o Jovan odgovoringja sarinenge: “Me krstinava tumen pajneja, ama avela pobaro mandar, kaske so na sijum dostojno leskere sandale te phravav. Ov ka krstinel tumen e Sveti Duhoja hem e jagaja. <verse eid="LUK 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 3:17" />Ko leskere vasta tani i lopata, hem ka odvinel o giv taro lušpe, ka khedel po giv ki štala, hem ka tharel o lušpe jagaja so na ačhola.” <verse eid="LUK 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 3:18" />Hem bute javere lafencar o Jovan vakergja lenge o evangelije.<verse eid="LUK 3:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 3:19" />A o Jovan opomeningja e vladitele e Irode, adaleske so lela romnake pe phraleskere romna e Irodijada hem bašo but javera lošna bukja so kergja. <verse eid="LUK 3:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 3:20" />Togaš o Irod kergja javer lošnipe: čhigja e Jovane ko zatvor.<verse eid="LUK 3:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Jovan krstinela e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 3:21" />Koga sa o manuša krstinge pe, krstingja pe o Isus da. I togaš dži kote o Isus molinela pe sine, phravdilo o nebo, <verse eid="LUK 3:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 3:22" />hem o Sveti Duh hulilo upro leste ko oblik gulubeskoro. Togaš šundilo glaso taro nebo: “Tu sijan mo manglo Čhavo so tute tani mi vojla.”<verse eid="LUK 3:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskere predcija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 3:23" />O Isus počmingja pi služba anglo narodo koga sine le trijanda berš. A o narodo mislinge deka o Isus tano čhavo e Josifeskoro.</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:23">O Josif sine čhavo e Ilijaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:23" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 3:24" />O Ilija sine čhavo e Matateskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">o Matat sine čhavo e Levijaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">o Levija sine čhavo e Melhijaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">o Melhi sine čhavo e Janajeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:24">o Janaj sine čhavo e Josifeskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:24" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 3:25" />O Josif sine čhavo e Matatijeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">o Matatij sine čhavo e Amoseskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">o Amos sine čhavo e Naumeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">o Naum sine čhavo e Eslijaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:25">o Eslij sine čhavo e Nangejeskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:25" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 3:26" />O Nangej sine čhavo e Maateskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">o Maat sine čhavo e Matatijeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">o Matatij sine čhavo e Semeineskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">o Semein sine čhavo e Josiheskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:26">o Josih sine čhavo e Jodaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:26" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 3:27" />O Joda sine čhavo e Joananeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">o Joanan sine čhavo e Risaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">o Risa sine čhavo e Zorovaveleskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">o Zorovavel sine čhavo e Salatieleskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:27">o Salatiel sine čhavo e Niriskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:27" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 3:28" />O Niri sine čhavo e Melhijaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">o Melhi sine čhavo e Adiskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">o Adi sine čhavo e Kosameskoro</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">o Kosam sine čhavo e Elmadameskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:28">o Elmadam sine čhavo e Ireskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:28" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 3:29" />O Ir sine čhavo e Isuseskoro<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">3:29 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">Isuseskoro </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Isus Navin</char></note></para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">o Isus sine čhavo e Eliezereskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">o Eliezer sine čhavo e Jorimeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">o Jorim sine čhavo e Matateskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:29">o Matat sine čhavo e Levijaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:29" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 3:30" />O Levij sine čhavo e Simeoneskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">o Simeon sine čhavo e Judaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">o Juda sine čhavo e Josifeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">o Josif sine čhavo e Jonameskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:30">o Jonam sine čhavo e Elijakimeskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:30" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 3:31" />O Elijakim sine čhavo e Melejaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">o Meleja sine čhavo e Menaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">o Mena sine čhavo e Matataskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">o Matata sine čhavo e Nataneskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:31">o Natan sine čhavo e Davideskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:31" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 3:32" />O David sine čhavo e Jesejeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">o Jesej sine čhavo e Ovideskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">o Ovid sine čhavo e Voozeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">o Vooz sine čhavo e Salmoneskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:32">o Salmon sine čhavo e Naasoneskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:32" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 3:33" />O Naason sine čhavo e Aminadaveskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">o Aminadav sine čhavo e Admineskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">o Admin sine čhavo e Arnieskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">o Arni sine čhavo e Esromeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">o Esrom sine čhavo e Fareseskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:33">o Fares sine čhavo e Judaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:33" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 3:34" />O Juda sine čhavo e Jakoveskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">o Jakov sine čhavo e Isakoskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">o Isak sine čhavo e Avraameskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">o Avraam sine čhavo e Taraskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:34">o Tara sine čhavo e Nahoreskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:34" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 3:35" />O Nahor sine čhavo e Seruheskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">o Seruh sine čhavo e Ragaveskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">o Ragav sine čhavo e Falekeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">o Falek sine čhavo e Evereskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:35">o Ever sine čhavo e Salaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:35" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 3:36" />O Sala sine čhavo e Kainaneskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">o Kainan sine čhavo e Arfaksadeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">o Arfaksad sine čhavo e Simeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">o Sim sine čhavo e Noeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:36">o Noe sine čhavo e Lameheskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:36" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 3:37" />O Lameh sine čhavo e Matusalaskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">o Matusala sine čhavo e Enoheskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">o Enoh sine čhavo e Jaredeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">o Jared sine čhavo e Malaleileskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:37">o Malaleil sine čhavo e Kainaneskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:37" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 3:38" />O Kainan sine čhavo e Enoseskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">o Enos sine čhavo e Siteskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">o Sit sine čhavo e Adameskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 3:38">o Adam sine čhavo e Devleskoro.<verse eid="LUK 3:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="LUK 4" />
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro iskušenie</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 4:1" />A o Isus, pherdo e Sveti Duhoja, irangja pe tari reka Jordan, i taro Duho sine legardo ki pustina, <verse eid="LUK 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 4:2" />kote so sine saranda dive iskušimo taro Beng. Ko adala dive na hala ništo, a koga nakhle adala dive, ov bokhalilo.<verse eid="LUK 4:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 4:3" />Togaš o Beng phengja leske: “Ako sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro, vaker akale bareske te ovel maro.”<verse eid="LUK 4:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 4:4" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Pišimo i: ‘O manuš nane te živinel samo taro maro.’ ”<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">maro </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Nesave rakopisija čhivena akava: “nego taro sekova lafi e Devleskoro”</char></note><note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:4 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 8:3">PZ 8:3</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 4:5" />Togaš o Beng legargja le ko jekh učo than i taro jekh puti sikavgja leske sa o carstvija e svetoskere, <verse eid="LUK 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 4:6" />hem phengja leske: “Ka dav tut sa akaja vlast hem i slava lengiri, adaleske soj mange dendi, i šaj te dav la kaske so me mangava. <verse eid="LUK 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 4:7" />Ako pokloningjan tut mange, sa akava ka ovel tlo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 4:8" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Pišimo tano: ‘Poklonin tut e Gospodareske, te Devleske, hem samo leske služin.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 4:9" />Palo adava o Beng legargja le ko Erusalim hem čhigja le ko najučo than e Hrameskoro hem phengja leske: “Te sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro, frde tut akatar tele! <verse eid="LUK 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 4:10" />Soske pišimo tano:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 4:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:10">‘Ka zapovedinel pe angelenge te arakhen tut,<verse eid="LUK 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 4:11" />te ikeren tut ko vasta te na khuve to pro ko bar.’ ”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:11 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">bar </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 91:11-12">Ps 91:11-12</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 4:6">Mt 4:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 4:12" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Pišimo tano: ‘Ma iskušin e Gospodare, te Devle.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 4:13" />Koga završingja sekova iskušenie, o Beng cidingja pe lestar dži ki javer šanca.<verse eid="LUK 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela ki Galileja</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 4:14" />O Isus irangja pe ki Galileja ki sila e Duhoskiri, a baši leske šundilo ko celo adava than. <verse eid="LUK 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 4:15" />A ov sikavela sine e manušen ko lengere sinagoge, hem sarinen falinena le sine.<verse eid="LUK 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus nane prifatimo ko Nazaret</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 4:16" />I o Isus alo ko Nazaret kote so barilo hem, palo po adeti ki sabota, khugja ki sinagoga hem uštilo te čitinel. <verse eid="LUK 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 4:17" />I sine leske dendo o lil taro prorok Isaija. Ov phravgja o lil, hem arakhla o than kote so sine pišimo:<verse eid="LUK 4:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 4:18" />“O Duho e Gospodareskoro tano upro mande,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">soske pomazingja man,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">te objavinav o šukar haberi e čorolenge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 4:18">Bičhalgja man te propovedinav i sloboda e phandlenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">hem e korolenge deka ka iranel pe lengoro dikhibe,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 4:18">e mučimenge deka ka mukhel len ki sloboda,<verse eid="LUK 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 4:19" />te objavinel o berš tari e Gospodareskiri milost.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4:19 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 61:1-2">Isa 61:1-2</ref>; <ref loc="ISA 58:6">Isa 58:6</ref>. </char></note><verse eid="LUK 4:19" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 4:20" />Togaš phandla o lil, irangja le e slugaske, hem bešla te sikavel. A o jakha sarinengere ki sinagoga sine upro leste. <verse eid="LUK 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 4:21" />O Isus počmingja te vakerel lenge: “Avdive pherdile akala lafija so šungjen len tumare kanencar.”<verse eid="LUK 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 4:22" />I sarine šukar vakerge lestar hem sine čudime taro šukar lafija so iklona sine leskere mostar, i vakerge: “Nane li akava e Josifeskoro čhavo?”<verse eid="LUK 4:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 4:23" />A ov phengja lenge: “Sigurno ka vakeren mange akaja izreka: ‘Doktore, sasljar korkori tut!’ Adava so šungjem so ulo ko Kapernaum ker le hem akate ko to than kote so barilan.”<verse eid="LUK 4:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 4:24" />I phengja: “Čače vakerava tumenge, nijekh proroko nane poštojmo ko than kote so barilo. <verse eid="LUK 4:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 4:25" />Čače vakerava tumenge, ko vreme e Ilijaske, sine but udovice ko Izrael, koga na pelo bršim trin tekvaš berš hem sine ki celo phuv baro bokhalipe. <verse eid="LUK 4:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 4:26" />I nijekheste na sine bičhavdo o Ilija, samo ki jekh udovica ko jabandžisko gradi Sarepta uza ko Sidon. <verse eid="LUK 4:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 4:27" />I sine but leprozna ko Izrael ko vreme e prorokoskoro e Elisejeskoro, ama nijekh lendar na sine sasljardo, osven o Neeman o Sirijco.”<verse eid="LUK 4:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 4:28" />Koga sa o manuša ki sinagoga šunge akava holange but. <verse eid="LUK 4:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 4:29" />I uštile hem ikalge le taro gradi hem legarge le ko brego kote so sine kerdo lengoro gradi, te šaj te frden le upraldan. <verse eid="LUK 4:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 4:30" />Ama o Isus nakhla maškar lende hem gelo peske.<verse eid="LUK 4:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela demonen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 4:31" />Togaš o Isus hulilo ko Kapernaum, ko gradi e Galilejakoro, hem sikavela sine e manušen ki sabota. <verse eid="LUK 4:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 4:32" />Ola sine čudime taro leskoro učibe, adaleske so leskere lafija sine len avtoriteti.<verse eid="LUK 4:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 4:33" />A ki sinagoga sine jekh manuš so sine opsednimo taro demonsko lošno duho, so vikingja sa pe glasoja: <verse eid="LUK 4:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 4:34" />“Ej, so mangeja tu amendar, Isuse taro Nazaret? Alan li te uništine amen? Džanava koj sijan tu: Tu sijan o Svetco e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="LUK 4:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 4:35" />Togaš o Isus zaptingja le vakerindor: “Phan to muj hem iklov lestar!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:35">I o demoni frdingja le ki phuv anglo sarine hem iklilo lestar bizo te povredinel le.<verse eid="LUK 4:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 4:36" />Sa o manuša sine čudime hem vakerge maškar peste: “Savo tane akala lafija! Vlasteja hem silaja naredinela e lošno duhonge hem ola iklona!”<verse eid="LUK 4:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 4:37" />Hem šundilo baši o Isus ko sa o pašutne thana.<verse eid="LUK 4:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela bute manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 4:38" />O Isus iklilo tari sinagoga hem gelo ko kher e Simoneskoro. A e Simoneskiri sasuj sine la bari treska. I zamolinge e Isuse te sasljarel la. <verse eid="LUK 4:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 4:39" />O Isus alo uza late, zapovedingja e treskake, hem i treska mukhla la. I oj odma uštili hem počmingja te služinel len.<verse eid="LUK 4:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 4:40" />Koga pelo o kham, sarine so sine len nasvale manuša taro razno nasvalipe ange len ko Isus. A ov upro sekova jekh čhigja pe vasta hem sasljargja len.<verse eid="LUK 4:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 4:41" />A bute manušendar iklona sine demojna vikindor: “Tu sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 4:41">O Isus zaptinela len sine hem na mukhela len sine te keren lafi, soske ola džange deka ov tano o Hristos.<verse eid="LUK 4:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 4:42" />Koga phravdilo o dive, o Isus gelo ko jekh čučo than. A o manuša rodena le sine hem koga resle adathe kaj so sine o Isus, na mukhena le sine te džal peske lendar.<verse eid="LUK 4:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 4:43" />A ov phengja lenge: “I ko javera da gradija mora te propovedinav o evangelije bašo carstvo e Devleskoro, soske bašo adava sijum bičhavdo.”<verse eid="LUK 4:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 4:44" />Hem prodolžingja te propovedinel ko Judejska sinagoge.<verse eid="LUK 4:44" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="LUK 5" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus vikinela e prvo učenikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 5:1" />Jekh dive dži kote o Isus tergjola sine uza ko Galilejsko ezero, i gužva gurinena pe sine uza leste hem šunena sine o lafi e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 5:2" />Ov dikhla duj čamcija uza ko ezero, so o ribajra mukhle len adathe, soske thovena sine pumare mreže. <verse eid="LUK 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 5:3" />I khugja ko jekh čamco, so sine e Simoneskoro, i zamolingja le te cidel pe hari taro kopno. Palo adava bešla ko čamco hem sikavela sine e manušen.<verse eid="LUK 5:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 5:4" />Koga završingja vakerindor, phengja e Simoneske: “Dža e čamcoja ko hor hem frden tumare mreže te astaren mačhe.”<verse eid="LUK 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 5:5" />A o Simon odgovoringja leske: “Gospodare, celo rat mučingjem amen hem ništo na astargjem, ama ako tu pheneja, ka frdav o mreže.”<verse eid="LUK 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 5:6" />Koga kerge adava, astarge sa doborom mačhe so o mreže počminge te pharavgjoven. <verse eid="LUK 5:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 5:7" />I vastencar vikinge pumare amalen, so sine ko javer čamco, te aven te pomožinen len. I ola ale hem pherge o solduj čamcija doborom so počminge te batinen ko pani.<verse eid="LUK 5:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 5:8" />A koga dikhla adava o Simon o Petar, pelo ko kočaka anglo Isus hem phengja leske: “Dža tuke mandar, Gospode, me sijum grešno manuš!” <verse eid="LUK 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 5:9" />Adaleske so uklingja le dar, le hem sarinen so sine leja bašo o baro astariba e mačhengoro. <verse eid="LUK 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 5:10" />A isto agjar uklingja len dar e Jakove hem e Jovane, e Zavedejeskere čhaven so sine e Simoneskere amala.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:10">Togaš o Isus phengja e Simoneske: “Ma dara! Taro akava dive nane te astare mačhe, nego manušen.”<verse eid="LUK 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 5:11" />I koga cidinge o čamcija ko kopno, mukhle sa hem gele palo Isus.<verse eid="LUK 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela leprozno manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 5:12" />Dži kote o Isus sine ko jekh gradi, alo jekh manuš so sine le lepra ko celo telo. Koga dikhla e Isuse, pelo anglo leste mujeja dži ki phuv hem molingja le vakerindor: “Gospode, te manglan tu šaj te sasljare man.”<verse eid="LUK 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 5:13" />O Isus pružingja po vas, pipingja le hem vakergja: “Mangava! Saslov!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 5:13">I odma i lepra našavdili lestar.<verse eid="LUK 5:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 5:14" />Togaš o Isus zapovedingja leske: “Ma vaker nikaske akava, samo dža hem sikav e sveštenikoske deka sijan sasto, hem de žrtva baši to očistiba, sar so o Mojsej naredingja, te šaj te ovel svedoštvo lenge.”<verse eid="LUK 5:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 5:15" />A e Isuseske šungjola sine sa poviše, agjar so but džene avena sine te šunen le hem te oven sasljarde taro pumaro nasvalipe. <verse eid="LUK 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 5:16" />A ov cidela pe sine ko čuče thana hem molinela pe sine.<verse eid="LUK 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus isi le vlast te oprostinel grevija hem te sasljarel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 5:17" />Jekh dive dži kote o Isus sikavela sine ko jekh kher, o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere so ale taro sa o gava e Galilejakere e Judejakere hem taro Erusalim, bešle adathe. A i sila e Gospodareskiri sine e Isuseja te sasljarel e nasvalen. <verse eid="LUK 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 5:18" />I nesave manuša legarena sine jekhe sakate manuše, pašlo ki postela. Ola mangle te anen le andre hem te čhiven le anglo Isus, <verse eid="LUK 5:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 5:19" />i adaleske so našti sine taro narodo te arakhen kotar te khuven, uklinge upro kher, phrage o krovi hem mukhle le sa e postelaja anglo Isus.<verse eid="LUK 5:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 5:20" />Koga o Isus dikhla lengiri vera, vakergja: “Manušeja, oprostime tane te grevija!”<verse eid="LUK 5:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 5:21" />A o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere pučle pe ki peste: “Koj tano akava so hulinela? Koj šaj te oprostinela o grevija, osven o Devel?”<verse eid="LUK 5:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 5:22" />A o Isus džangja so mislinena i pučlja len: “Soske agjar mislinena ko tumare srcija? <verse eid="LUK 5:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 5:23" />Soj polokhe te vakerel pe: ‘Oprostime tane te grevija’, ili te vakerel pe: ‘Ušti hem phir’? <verse eid="LUK 5:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 5:24" />Ama ka dokažinav tumenge deka o Čhavo Manušeskoro isi le vlast ki phuv te oprostinel o grevija.” Togaš phengja e sakateske: “Ušti! Le ti postela hem dža tuke khere.”<verse eid="LUK 5:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 5:25" />I o manuš odma uštilo anglo lende, lela pi postela hem gelo khere slavindor e Devle. <verse eid="LUK 5:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 5:26" />Sarinen čudinge pe hem slavinge e Devle. Pherdile dar hem vakerge: “Avdive dikhlem bare čudija!”<verse eid="LUK 5:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vikinela e Levija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 5:27" />Palo adava, o Isus iklilo adathar hem dikhla e danočniko so vikinela pe Levija, sar bešela ko than kote so khedela pe danok hem phengja leske: “Ava pala mande!”<verse eid="LUK 5:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 5:28" />Ov uštilo, mukhla sa hem gelo pala leste.<verse eid="LUK 5:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 5:29" />Togaš o Levij spremingja ko po kher baro hajbe pijbe e Isuseske hem adathe sine but danočnikija hem javera so bešle lencar ki sofra.<verse eid="LUK 5:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 5:30" />Ama o fariseja hem lengere učitejla e Zakoneskere počminge te buninen pe vakerindor e Isuseskere učenikonge: “Soske hana hem pijena e danočnikoncar hem javere grešnikoncar?”<verse eid="LUK 5:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 5:31" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “E sastenge na trebela doktori, nego e nasvalenge. <verse eid="LUK 5:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 5:32" />Me na alum e pravednikon te vikinav, nego e grešnikon.”<verse eid="LUK 5:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse pučena bašo posti</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 5:33" />O fariseja hem lengere učitejla e Zakoneskere phenge leske: “E Jovane Krstiteleskere učenikija but postinena, agjar hem e farisejengere učenikija, ama te učenikija hana hem pijena.”<verse eid="LUK 5:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 5:34" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Sar šaj te čhiven e džamutreskere amalen te postinen koga lencar tano o džamutro? <verse eid="LUK 5:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 5:35" />Ama ka avel dive, koga ka ovel lelo o džamutro lendar, i togaš ko adala dive ola da ka postinen.”<verse eid="LUK 5:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 5:36" />I vakergja lenge akaja parabola: “Nikoj na čhivela kotor taro nevo gad te šaj te phandel i dupka ko purano gad, soske o nevo ka pharavgjovel, a o nevo nane te odgovorinel e puraneja. <verse eid="LUK 5:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 5:37" />I nikoj na čhorela nevi mol ko purane mevija<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">5:37 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">mevija </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Mevovi sine kerde tari zivotinegiri koža kote so koristinena sine sar fučija.</char></note>; ako kerge adava, koga i mol ka reslol o mevija ka phajron; i mol ka čhorgol, hem o mevija ka rumingjoven. <verse eid="LUK 5:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 5:38" />Nego o nevo mol mora te čhivel pe ko neve mevija. <verse eid="LUK 5:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 5:39" />I nijekh so pila i purani mol, na mangela i nevi, adaleske so vakerela: ‘I purani mol tani pošukar.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 5:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="LUK 6" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus tano Gospodari e sabotakoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 6:1" />Ko jekh sabotno dive o Isus pe učenikoncar nakhle maškar o nive. I leskere učenikija počminge te phagen klasija giv, lušpinge len pe vastencar hem hale len.<verse eid="LUK 6:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 6:2" />A nesave taro fariseja pučle e Isuse: “Soske kerena adava so nane dozvolimo ko sabotno dive taro Zakoni?”<verse eid="LUK 6:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 6:3" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Na čitingjen li so o David kergja, koga sine bokhale ov hem o manuša so sine leja? <verse eid="LUK 6:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 6:4" />Khugja ko kher e Devleskoro, lela hem hala o maro so sine posvetimo, so nasminela sine nikoj te hal le osven o sveštenikija. I o David dengja okolenge da so sine leja.”<verse eid="LUK 6:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 6:5" />I phengja lenge: “O Čhavo Manušeskoro tano Gospodari e sabotakoro.”<verse eid="LUK 6:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela ki sabota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 6:6" />Ki javer sabota, khugja palem o Isus ki sinagoga hem sikavela sine, a adathe sine jekh manuš so leskoro desno vas šukilo hem našti sine te koristinel le. <verse eid="LUK 6:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 6:7" />Togaš o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o fariseja adžikerena sine te dikhen dali o Isus ka sasljarel e manuše ki sabota, te šaj te tužinen le.<verse eid="LUK 6:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 6:8" />Ama o Isus džangja lengere misle i phengja e manušeske so sine leskoro vas šuko: “Ušti hem tergjov maškaral!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:8">Ov uštilo hem terdilo.<verse eid="LUK 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 6:9" />Togaš vakergja lenge: “Te pučav tumen: soj dozvolimo te kerel pe ki sabota: šukaripe ili lošnipe? Te spasinel pe životo ili te mudarel pe?”<verse eid="LUK 6:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 6:10" />I o Isus dikhla sarinende, hem phengja e manušeske: “Pružin to vas!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 6:10">Ov pružingja po vas hem leskoro vas saslilo. <verse eid="LUK 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 6:11" />A o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o fariseja pherdile bari holi hem phenge maškar peste so šaj te keren e Isuseske.<verse eid="LUK 6:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus birinela dešudujen apostolen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 6:12" />Ko adala dive, o Isus gelo ki jekh gora te molinel pe hem nakhagja i rat molindor e Devle. <verse eid="LUK 6:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 6:13" />A koga phravdilo o sabaj, vikingja pe učenikon te aven ki leste hem lendar biringja dešudujen, so vikingja len apostojla:<verse eid="LUK 6:13" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 6:14" />Simon so dengja le anav Petar,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">hem leskoro phral Andrej,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">o Jakov</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">hem o Jovan,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">o Filip</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:14">hem o Vartelomej,<verse eid="LUK 6:14" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 6:15" />o Matej</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">hem o Toma,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">o Jakov, o čhavo e Alfejeskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:15">hem o Simon, soj vikimo Zilot,<verse eid="LUK 6:15" /></para>
  <para style="li1">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 6:16" />o Juda, o čhavo e Jakoveskoro,</para>
  <para style="li1" vid="LUK 6:16">hem o Juda Iskariot, so ulo predavniko.<verse eid="LUK 6:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O blagoslovija hem o pharipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 6:17" />O Isus hulilo lencar ko ramno than. A adathe sine khedime but taro leskere učenikija, hem but manuša tari celo Judeja hem Erusalim, hem taro Tirska hem Sidonska thana soj uza ko more. <verse eid="LUK 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 6:18" />Ola ale te šunen hem te oven sasljarde taro pumaro nasvalipe. A okola so sine mučime taro lošna duhija sine sasljarde. <verse eid="LUK 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 6:19" />I sa o manuša rodena sine te pipinen le, adaleske so lestar iklola sine sila hem sasljona sine sarinen.<verse eid="LUK 6:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 6:20" />O Isus dikhla ko pe učenikija, hem vakergja:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 6:20" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:20">“Blagoslovime sijen tumen o čorole,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:20">soske tumaro tano o carstvo e Devleskoro.<verse eid="LUK 6:20" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 6:21" />Blagoslovime sijen tumen akana so sijen bokhale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">soske ka čajloven.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:21">Blagoslovime sijen tumen akana so rovena,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:21">soske ka asan.<verse eid="LUK 6:21" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 6:22" />Blagoslovime sijen koga o manuša mrzinena tumen,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">koga otfrlinena tumen hem uvredžinena tumen</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:22">hem ladžakerena tumen deka sijen lošna,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:22">soske verujnena ko Čhavo Manušeskoro.<verse eid="LUK 6:22" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 6:23" />Radujnen tumen hem rupinen tari radost, soske bari tani tumari nagrada ko nebo! Adaleske so agjar kerge sine lengere parapapija e prorokonge.<verse eid="LUK 6:23" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 6:24" />Ama pharo tumenge e barvalenge,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:24">soske više dobingjen tumari uteha.<verse eid="LUK 6:24" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 6:25" />Pharo tumenge so akana sijen čale,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">soske ka oven bokhale.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 6:25">Pharo tumenge so asana akana,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:25">soske ka tugujnen hem ka roven.<verse eid="LUK 6:25" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 6:26" />Pharo tumenge so akana sa o manuša vakeren šukar tumendar,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 6:26">adaleske so lengere parapapija agjar vakerena sine e hovavne prorokonge.”<verse eid="LUK 6:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Mangen tumare dušmanen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 6:27" />“Ama, tumen so šunena vakerava tumenge: Mangen tumare dušmanen! Keren šukaripe okolenge so mrzinena tumen! <verse eid="LUK 6:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 6:28" />Blagoslovinen okolen so dena tumen armanja! Molinen tumen okolenge so kerena tumenge lošnipe. <verse eid="LUK 6:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 6:29" />Ako nekoj khugja tut šamarka ki čham, iran leske okoja da čham. Ako nekoj lela to mantili, de le to gad da. <verse eid="LUK 6:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 6:30" />De sekaske so ka rodela tutar nešto, hem ako nekoj lela nešto soj tano tlo, ma rode adava palal. <verse eid="LUK 6:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 6:31" />Keren tumen adava so mangena te keren tumenge javera.<verse eid="LUK 6:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 6:32" />Ako mangena samo okolen so mangena tumen, savi nagrada ka dobinen? Soske o grešnikija da mangena okolen so mangena len. <verse eid="LUK 6:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 6:33" />Ako kerena šukaripe okolenge soj tane šukar tumencar, savi nagrada ka dobinen? Soske o grešnikija da kerena adava. <verse eid="LUK 6:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 6:34" />Ako dena ko zaem okolenge kastar so adžikereja te iranen tumenge, savi nagrada ka dobinen? O grešnikija da dena zaem e grešnikonge hem adžikerena te iranel pe lenge isto.<verse eid="LUK 6:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 6:35" />Nego mangen tumare dušmanen, keren šukaripe hem den zaem bizo te adžikeren te iranel pe tumenge adava. Togaš tumari nagrada ka ovel bari, hem ka oven čhave e Najbare Devleskere, soske ov tano milostlivo prema o neblagodarna hem o lošna. <verse eid="LUK 6:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 6:36" />Oven milostliva sar soj tumaro Dad milostlivo.”<verse eid="LUK 6:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma sudinen javeren</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 6:37" />“Ma sudinen hem nane te sudinel pe tumenge! Ma osudinen hem nane te oven osudime! Oprostinen hem ka oprostinel pe tumenge! <verse eid="LUK 6:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 6:38" />Den hem ka del pe tumenge. Merka šukar nabimi, tresimi hem pherdi ka čhivel pe tumenge ki angali. Adaleske so, save merkaja merinena asavke merkaja ka merinel pe tumenge.”<verse eid="LUK 6:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 6:39" />I phengja lenge akaja parabola: “Šaj li o korolo te phiravel e korole? Nane li te peren o solduj ki dupka? <verse eid="LUK 6:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 6:40" />O učeniko nane upreder po učiteli, nego sekoj soj sikavdo sa, ka ovel sar po učiteli.<verse eid="LUK 6:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 6:41" />Soske dikheja i delanka te phraleske ki jakh, a i greda ki ti jakh na dikheja? <verse eid="LUK 6:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 6:42" />Sar šaj te vakere te phraleske: ‘Mo phral, ač te ikalav i delanka tari ti jakh,’ a koga korkori na dikheja i greda ki ti jakh? Dujmujaleja! Prvo ikal i greda tari ti jakh, a poslem ka dikhe šukar sar te ikale i delanka tari jakh te phraleskiri.”<verse eid="LUK 6:42" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O šukar hem o lošna plodija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 6:43" />“Nijekh šukar kaš na dela lošna plodija, hem nijekh lošno kaš na dela šukar plodija. <verse eid="LUK 6:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 6:44" />Adaleske so sekova kaš pendžarela pe taro leskere plodija. Sar so o manuša na khedena smokve taro kare, ni drakha taro bocke. <verse eid="LUK 6:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 6:45" />O šukar manuš ikalela šukar bukja adaleske so isi le šukaripe ko po srce, a o lošno manuš ikalela o lošna bukja. Adaleske so e manušeskoro muj vakerela adava soleja pherdo leskoro srce.”<verse eid="LUK 6:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O pametno hem o našavdo manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 6:46" />“Soske vikinena man: ‘Gospode, Gospode!’, a na kerena okova so vakerava? <verse eid="LUK 6:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 6:47" />Sekoj so avela ki mande hem šunela me lafija hem so pherela len, ka vakerav tumenge savo tano: <verse eid="LUK 6:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 6:48" />Ov tano sar manuš so kergja po kher, agjar so randla hor hem čhigja pe temejla ki karpa. I koga ale poplave hem o reke khuge ko adava kher, ama o kher na pelo, soske sine šukar kerdo.<verse eid="LUK 6:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 6:49" />Ama sekoj so šunela me lafija hem na pherela len, ov tano sar manuš so kergja po kher ki phuv bizo temejla. I koga ale o reke ko adava kher, odma o kher rušisalilo!”<verse eid="LUK 6:49" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="LUK 7" />
  <para style="s1">E Rimsko kapetaneskiri vera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 7:1" />Koga o Isus završingja pe lafencar anglo manuša, khugja ko gradi Kapernaum. <verse eid="LUK 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 7:2" />A jekh Rimsko kapetani sine le sluga, so but poštojnela le sine, a o sluga sine meribaja jekh. <verse eid="LUK 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 7:3" />I koga o kapetani šungja bašo Isus, bičhalgja ki leste nesave Evrejska starešinen te molinen le te avel te sasljarel leskere sluga.<verse eid="LUK 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 7:4" />Koga ale ko Isus but molinge le vakerindor: “Ov zaslužinela te kere leske adava, <verse eid="LUK 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 7:5" />adaleske so ov mangela amare narodo hem kergja amenge i sinagoga.”<verse eid="LUK 7:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 7:6" />I o Isus gelo lencar.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:6">Koga sine paše uza ko kher, o kapetani bičhalgja leske pe amalen vakerindor: “Gospode, ma mučin tut, soske na zaslužinava te ave me khereste. <verse eid="LUK 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 7:7" />Adaleske so me na dikhava man dostojno te avav dži ki tute. Nego vaker samo jekh lafi hem mo sluga ka sasljol. <verse eid="LUK 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 7:8" />Soske me da sijum manuš telo avtoriteti, hem isi man vojnikija teli mande. Koga phenava jekheske: ‘Dža’ – ov džala, a javereske: ‘Ava’ – ov avela. Hem koga vakerava me slugaske: ‘Ker akava’ – ov kerela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 7:9" />Koga šungja adava o Isus, čudingja pe, irangja pe ko narodo so džana sine pala leste hem phengja: “Vakerava tumenge, na arakhlum nikas ko Izrael, te ovel le doborom vera.”<verse eid="LUK 7:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 7:10" />Togaš o manuša so sine bičhavde, irange pe ko kher hem arakhle e sluga sasto.<verse eid="LUK 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vazdela taro mule e udovicakere čhave</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 7:11" />Palo adava, o Isus gelo ko gradi so vikinela pe sine Nain, a leja džana sine leskere učenikija hem but narodo. <verse eid="LUK 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 7:12" />I koga alo paše uza ko udar e gradeskoro, nesave manuša legarena sine jekhe terne čhave, so sine mulo. Ov sine jekh pe dajake, a oj sine udovica. But džene džana sine laja te parunen e čhave.<verse eid="LUK 7:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 7:13" />Koga dikhla la o Gospodari o Isus, pelo leske žal baši lake hem phengja lake: “Ma rov!”<verse eid="LUK 7:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 7:14" />Togaš alo paše hem pipingja i nosilka kote so sine o čhavo, i okola so phiravena le sine ačhile.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:14">O Isus phengja: “Terneja, tuke vakerava ušti!”<verse eid="LUK 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 7:15" />I o mulo čhavo uštilo ki bul hem počmingja te kerel lafi hem o Isus dengja le leskere dajake.<verse eid="LUK 7:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 7:16" />Togaš sarinen darandile hem slavinge e Devle vakerindor: “Baro proroko pojavingja pe maškar amende!” hem: “O Devel alo te pomožinel pe narodo!”<verse eid="LUK 7:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 7:17" />I adava šundilo bašo Isus ki celo phuv e Evrejengiri hem ko sa o pašutne thana.<verse eid="LUK 7:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Jovan Krstitel</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 7:18" />O učenikija e Jovane Krstiteleskere vakerge leske sa adava so ulo. Togaš o Jovan vikingja ki peste pe duje učenikon, <verse eid="LUK 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 7:19" />hem bičhalgja len ko Gospodari o Isus vakerindor: “Tu li sijan adava so trebela te avel ili te adžikera javere?”<verse eid="LUK 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 7:20" />Koga ale ko Isus o manuša vakerge: “O Jovan Krstitel bičhalgja amen ki tute te puča tut: ‘Tu li sijan adava so trebela te avel ili te adžikera javere?’ ”<verse eid="LUK 7:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 7:21" />A ko adava momenti o Isus sasljargja buten taro nasvalipe, taro muke hem taro lošna duhija, hem bute korolen dengja te dikhen.<verse eid="LUK 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 7:22" />Togaš o Isus odgovoringja e Jovaneskere učenikonge: “Džan hem vakeren e Jovaneske so dikhlen hem so šungjen: o korole dikhena, o bange phirena, okolen so isi len lepra sasljona, o kašuke šunena, o mule uštena, hem o evangelije propovedinela pe e čorolenge. <verse eid="LUK 7:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 7:23" />Hem blagoslovimo tano sekoj so na našavela pi vera ki mande.”<verse eid="LUK 7:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 7:24" />A koga gele peske e Jovaneskere učenikija, o Isus počmingja te vakerel e manušenge bašo Jovan: “So iklilen te dikhen ki pustina? I trska li so phudela la i bavlal? <verse eid="LUK 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 7:25" />Ako na, so iklilen te dikhen? Manuš uravdo ko šuže šeja? Na, okola so phiravena skupa šeja hem so živinena ko luksuz tane ko carska palate. <verse eid="LUK 7:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 7:26" />Ili so iklilen te dikhen? E proroko li? Oja, vakerava tumenge, ov tano poviše taro proroko. <verse eid="LUK 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 7:27" />Ov tano akava baši kaske sine pišimo:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:27" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:27">‘Akje, me bičhavava me glasniko angla tute,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:27">so ka spreminel to drumo angla tute<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">7:27 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">tute </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="MAL 3:1">Mal 3:1</ref>; <ref loc="MAT 11:10">Mt 11:10</ref>; <ref loc="MRK 1:2">Mk 1:2</ref>.</char></note>.’<verse eid="LUK 7:27" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 7:28" />Vakerava tumenge, maškar sa o manuša soj bijame nijekh nane pobaro taro Jovan Krstitel, ama sekoj soj najtikno ko carstvo e Devleskoro tano pobaro lestar.”<verse eid="LUK 7:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 7:29" />Koga šunge o lafija e Isuseskere sa o manuša dži o danočnikija, priznajnenge deka e Devleskoro drumo tano čačutno, adaleske so sine krstime e Jovanestar. <verse eid="LUK 7:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 7:30" />Ama o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere odbinge e Devleskoro plani baši pumenge, adaleske so na sine krstime taro Jovan.<verse eid="LUK 7:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 7:31" />I o Isus phengja: “Togaš soleja te sporedinav akaja generacija? Soleja tani slično? <verse eid="LUK 7:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 7:32" />Ola tane sar čhave so bešena ko pazajra hem vakerena jekh jekheske:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 7:32" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">‘Bašalgjem tumenge ki flejta,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">a na khelgjen.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 7:32">Gilagjem tumenge tažna gijla,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 7:32">a na rungjen.’<verse eid="LUK 7:32" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 7:33" />Soske koga alo o Jovan Krstitel, ni hala ni pila sar javera, a tumen vakerena: ‘Isi le demoni.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 7:34" />Alo o Čhavo Manušeskoro, hala hem pijela, a tumen vakerena: ‘Akje o bokhalo hem o pijanica, amal e danočnikongoro hem e javere grešnikongoro.’ <verse eid="LUK 7:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 7:35" />Ama i mudrost dokažinela pe taro lakere čhave.”<verse eid="LUK 7:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I grešnica pomazinela e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 7:36" />Jekh taro fariseja so sine leskoro anav Simon vikingja e Isuse te avel te hal ki leste. Ov khugja ko kher e farisejeske hem alo uza ko astali. <verse eid="LUK 7:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 7:37" />I akje ko adava gradi sine jekh džuvli so džanela pe deka sine grešnica. Koga šungja deka o Isus hala ko kher e farisejeskoro, ali hem angja šiši kerdo taro mermeri, a andre ki leste sine mirizlivo ujle. <verse eid="LUK 7:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 7:38" />I terdindor uza leskere pre, rungja hem počmingja te sapankerel leskere pre pe asvencar hem kosla len pe balencar. Palo adava čumingja leskere pre hem makhla len e ujleja.<verse eid="LUK 7:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 7:39" />Koga dikhla adava o farisejco so vikingja le, vakergja ki peste: “Ako akava manuš tano proroko, ka džanel sine koj hem savi tani akaja džuvli so pipinela le – deka tani grešnica.”<verse eid="LUK 7:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 7:40" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Simone, isi man nešto te phenav tuke.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:40">A ov phengja leske: “Vaker učitele.”<verse eid="LUK 7:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 7:41" />I o Isus phengja leske: “Duj džene dužinena sine pare jekhe manušeske so dela sine pare ko zaem. Jekh dužinela leske sine panšel Rimska dinajra<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">panšel Rimska dinajra </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Adava sine panšel dive te kere buti</char></note>, a o dujto pinda<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">7:41 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">pinda </char><char style="ft" closed="false">Akava sine pinda dive te kere buti</char></note>. <verse eid="LUK 7:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 7:42" />Adaleske so o solduj na sine len te iranen leske, ov oprostingja lenge sa o dugo. Koj lendar ka mangel le poviše?”<verse eid="LUK 7:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 7:43" />O Simon odgovoringja: “Mislinava deka okoleske so sine le pobaro dugo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 7:43">I o Isus phengja leske: “Oja, šukar phengjan.”<verse eid="LUK 7:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 7:44" />Togaš irangja pe ki džuvli hem phengja e Simoneske: “Dikheja li akale džuvla? Khugjum ko to kher, tu pani na dengjan man me prenge, a oj sapankergja me pre pe asvencar hem kosla len pe balencar. <verse eid="LUK 7:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 7:45" />Tu na pozdravingjan man čumibaja, a oj sar khugjum na čhinagja te čuminel me pre. <verse eid="LUK 7:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 7:46" />Tu na makhla mo šero ujleja, a oj makhla me pre mirizlivo ujleja. <verse eid="LUK 7:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 7:47" />Adaleske phenava tuke, oj sikavgja but mangipe, adaleske soj oprostime lake but grevija. Ama kaske soj oprostimo hari, hari mangela.”<verse eid="LUK 7:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 7:48" />Togaš o Isus phengja adale džuvlake: “Oprostime tane te grevija.”<verse eid="LUK 7:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 7:49" />A okola manuša so sine uza ko astali počminge te vakeren maškar peste: “Koj akava so šaj o grevija da te oprostinel?”<verse eid="LUK 7:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 7:50" />Togaš o Isus vakergja adale džuvlake: “Ti vera spasingja tut. Dža tuke mireja.”<verse eid="LUK 7:50" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="LUK 8" />
  <para style="s1">O romnja so džana palo Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 8:1" />Palo adava, o Isus počmingja te džal ko gradija hem ko gava hem te propovedinel o evangelije bašo o carstvo e Devleskoro. A leja gele o dešuduj učenikija <verse eid="LUK 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 8:2" />hem nesave romnja so sine sasljarde taro lošna duhija hem taro nasvalipa: I Marija taro Magdala so latar ikalgja efta demojna, <verse eid="LUK 8:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 8:3" />i Joana, i romni e Huzaeskiri, so sine upravniko ko Irod, i Suzana hem but javera. Akala romnja pomožinena sine pumare parencar le hem leskere učenikon.<verse eid="LUK 8:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo sejači</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 8:4" />Koga khedinge pe uza ko Isus bari gužva taro but gradija, ov vakergja lenge jekh parabola: <verse eid="LUK 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 8:5" />“Iklilo jekh sejači te sejnel. Dži kote sejnela sine o seme, nesavo seme pelo lestar ko drumo, sine gazimo hem o čirikla sa hale o seme. <verse eid="LUK 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 8:6" />Nesavo seme pelo ko than kote so sine hari phuv a poviše bara, i koga barilo, šukilo adaleske so na sine le pani. <verse eid="LUK 8:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 8:7" />I nesavo seme pelo maškar o kare, i koga barile, o kare zagušinge le. <verse eid="LUK 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 8:8" />A nesavo seme pelo ki šukar phuv, barilo hem angja šel puti poviše taro adava so sine sejmo.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:8">I vakergja lenge: “Kas isi kana neka šunel!”<verse eid="LUK 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Soske o Isus vakerela ko parabole</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 8:9" />Togaš leskere učenikija pučle le te objasninel lenge i parabola.<verse eid="LUK 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 8:10" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Tumenge i dendo te džanen o tajne taro carstvo e Devleskoro, a javerenge vakerava ko parabole, te šaj:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 8:10" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 8:10">‘Jakhencar te dikhen, a te na pendžaren,</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 8:10">hem kanencar te šunen ama te na svatinen<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">8:10 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">svatinen </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 6:9">Isa 6:9</ref>.</char></note>.’ <verse eid="LUK 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 8:11" />A akaja parabola značinela: o seme tano o lafi e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 8:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 8:12" />Okova seme soj ko drumo tane adala so šunena o lafi e Devleskoro, i togaš avela o Beng hem čorola adava soj tano ko lengoro srce, te šaj te na verujnen hem te na oven spasime. <verse eid="LUK 8:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 8:13" />A okova seme soj sejmo ko poviše bara a pohari phuv tane adala, so koga šunena o lafi e Devleskoro odma priminena le so radost, ama nane len koreno. Ola nesavo vreme verujnena, ama koga avela o iskušenie perena tari vera. <verse eid="LUK 8:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 8:14" />A okova seme so pelo ko kare tane okola manuša so šunge o lafi e Devleskoro, ama dži kote džana ko pumaro drumo, zagušinena pe taro sekiracije akale životoskere, taro barvalipe hem taro zadovolstvo, i na dena šukar plodi. <verse eid="LUK 8:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 8:15" />A okova seme so pelo ki šukar phuv tane okola manuša so šunena o lafi e Devleskoro hem ikerena le ko šukar hem čisto srce sa dži kote na anena šukar plodi.”<verse eid="LUK 8:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola baši svetlina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 8:16" />“Nikoj na tharela momoli te učharel la čareja, ili te čhivel la telo kreveti, nego čhivela la ko lakoro than te šaj te dikhen i svetlina adala so khuvena. <verse eid="LUK 8:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 8:17" />Adaleske, sa soj garavdo, ka dikhol; sa soj tajno, ka šungjol. <verse eid="LUK 8:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 8:18" />Adaleske pazinen sar šunena. Soske, kas so isi le, leske ka del pe panda poviše; a kas nane, lestar ka lel pe adava da so isi le!”<verse eid="LUK 8:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj tani e Isuseskiri familija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 8:19" />A e Isuseskiri daj hem leskere phrajla ale te dikhen le, ama tari bari gužva našti sine avena dži leste.<verse eid="LUK 8:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 8:20" />Togaš nekoj phengja e Isuseske: “Ti daj hem te phrajla tergjona avrijal hem mangena te dikhen tut.”<verse eid="LUK 8:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 8:21" />A o Isus vakergja: “Mi daj hem me phrajla tane okola so šunena hem kerena o lafi e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 8:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus smirinela i bura</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 8:22" />Jekh dive o Isus phengja pe učenikonge: “Te nakha tari okoja strana taro ezero!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:22">I uklinge ko čamco hem cidinge. <verse eid="LUK 8:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 8:23" />Dži kote plovinena sine, o Isus zasukja. I astargja jekh silno bura upro ezero. Adaleja so o čamco počmingja te phergjol pani hem ola sine ki bari opasnost.<verse eid="LUK 8:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 8:24" />O učenikija gele ko Isus hem vazdinge le vakerindor: “Učitele, učitele ka tasavgjova!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:24">O Isus uštilo hem zapovedingja e bavlalake hem e ezeroske te ačhon, a i bura ačhili hem sine tišina.<verse eid="LUK 8:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 8:25" />Togaš ov pučlja e učenikon: “Kaj tani tumari vera?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:25">A ola darandile hem čudinge pe, i pučle pe maškar peste: “Koj tano akava, so i bavlal da hem o talasija da šunena le?”<verse eid="LUK 8:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela demonen taro manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 8:26" />O Isus hem leskere učenikija resle ki Gadarinsko phuv, soj tano tari okoja strana taro Galilejsko ezero. <verse eid="LUK 8:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 8:27" />A koga o Isus iklilo ko kopno, alo angli leste jekh manuš taro gradi so sine opsednimo demonencar. But vreme akava manuš na phiravela sine šeja hem na živinela sine ko kher, nego živinela sine ko grobija.<verse eid="LUK 8:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 8:28" />I koga dikhla e Isuse, pelo anglo leskere pre hem vikingja sa pe glasoja: “So mangeja mandar, Isuse, Čhavo e Najbare Devleskoro? Molinava tut, ma mučin man!”<verse eid="LUK 8:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 8:29" />(Adaleske so o Isus više naredingja e lošno duhoske te iklol taro manuš. But puti sine napadimo taro lošno duho, hem ako sine phandle leskere vasta hem leskere pre lanconcar hem sine arakhlo taro čuvajra, o manuš čhinela sine o lancija hem o demoni legarela le sine ko čuče thana.)<verse eid="LUK 8:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 8:30" />A o Isus pučlja le: “Sar vikineja tut?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:30">Ov vakergja leske: “Legija”, soske but demojna khuge ki leste.<verse eid="LUK 8:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 8:31" />I but molinge e Isuse te na zapovedinel lenge te džan ki Bezdna. <verse eid="LUK 8:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 8:32" />A adathe ko rido sine but bale so hana sine, i o demojna molinge e Isuse te mukhel len te khuven ko bale. I ov mukhla len.<verse eid="LUK 8:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 8:33" />Togaš o demojna iklile taro manuš hem khuge ko bale. I o bale prastandile taro brego ko ezero hem adathe taslile.<verse eid="LUK 8:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 8:34" />Koga okola so arakhena sine e balen dikhle so ulo, našle hem vakerge ko celo gradi hem ko gava. <verse eid="LUK 8:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 8:35" />Togaš o manuša iklile te dikhen so ulo. Koga ale ko Isus dikhle e manuše so sine le legija demojna, sar bešela uravdo hem sasto vesto e Isuseja, hem ola darandile. <verse eid="LUK 8:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 8:36" />A adala manuša so dikhle adava so ulo, vakerge javerenge sar o Isus sasljargja e manuše so sine opsednimo demonencar. <verse eid="LUK 8:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 8:37" />I sa o manuša tari Gadarinsko phuv molinge le te džal peske lendar, soske uklingja len dar. Togaš o Isus khugja ko čamco hem irangja pe palal.<verse eid="LUK 8:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 8:38" />A o manuš so o Isus ikalgja lestar o demojna, molingja le te džal leja, ama o Isus bičhalgja le vakerindor:<verse eid="LUK 8:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 8:39" />“Iran tut khere hem vaker sa so kergja tuke o Devel.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:39">I o manuš gelo peske hem vakergja sarinenge ko gradi so kergja leske o Isus.<verse eid="LUK 8:39" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vazdela e čhaja taro mule hem sasljarela e nasvale romna</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 8:40" />Koga o Isus irangja pe ki okoja strana taro ezero, but manuša sine radosno so dikhle so avela, soske sarinen adžikerena le sine. <verse eid="LUK 8:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 8:41" />Togaš alo ko Isus jekh manuš so vikinela pe sine Jair, so sine vodači ki sinagoga. Ov pelo anglo pre e Isuseskere hem molinela le sine te avel leste ko kher. <verse eid="LUK 8:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 8:42" />Adaleske so e Jaire sine le jekh čhaj, so sine la dešuduj berš hem sine meribaja jekh.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:42">Dži kote o Isus džala sine palo Jair, but manuša gurinena pe sine upro leste. <verse eid="LUK 8:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 8:43" />Maškar lende sine jekh nasvali romni, so dešuduj berš thavdela sine latar rat. Oj trošingja sa so sine la ko doktori, ama nikoj našti sine te sasljarel la. <verse eid="LUK 8:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 8:44" />Oj ali palo Isus hem pipingja le ko krajo taro leskere šeja, i odma ačhilo o rat te thavdel latar.<verse eid="LUK 8:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 8:45" />A o Isus pučlja: “Koj pipingja man?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:45">Sekoj lendar phenge: “Na sijum me.” A o Petar phengja leske: “Učitele, sar te džana koga but džene khedinge pe hem gurinena pe upro tute.”<verse eid="LUK 8:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 8:46" />A o Isus vakergja leske: “Nekoj pipingja man. Osetingjum deka iklili mandar sila.”<verse eid="LUK 8:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 8:47" />Togaš i romni dikhla deka našti garavela pe, tresindor tari dar ali hem peli mujeja anglo leskere pre hem vakergja anglo sa o manuša soske pipingja le hem sar odma saslili.<verse eid="LUK 8:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 8:48" />A o Isus phengja lake: “Mi čhaj, ti vera sasljargja tut! Dža tuke mireja.”<verse eid="LUK 8:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 8:49" />Dži kote kerela sine lafi o Isus, alo nesavo manuš taro kher e Jaireskoro, o vodači e sinagogakoro hem vakergja leske: “Ti čhaj muli; ma dosadin više e učitele.”<verse eid="LUK 8:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 8:50" />Koga šungja akava o Isus vakergja e Jaireske: “Ma dara! Samo verujn hem oj ka ovel sasti.”<verse eid="LUK 8:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 8:51" />I koga resla o Isus ko kher e Jaireskoro, nikas na mukhla te khuven leja, osven e Petare, e Jovane e Jakove hem e čhajakere dade hem e daja. <verse eid="LUK 8:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 8:52" />A sarinen so sine ko kher, rovena sine hem tugujnena palo late.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 8:52">A o Isus phengja: “Ma roven! Oj nane muli, nego sovela.”<verse eid="LUK 8:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 8:53" />I ola asandile leske soske džange deka tani muli.<verse eid="LUK 8:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 8:54" />A o Isus gelo hem astargja la taro vas hem vakergja: “Čhaje, ušti!” <verse eid="LUK 8:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 8:55" />I lakoro duho irangja pe ki late hem oj odma uštili. Togaš o Isus vakergja te den la te hal. <verse eid="LUK 8:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 8:56" />Lakoro dad hem lakiri daj sine but čudime, ama o Isus zapovedingja lenge ma te vakeren nikaske so ulo.<verse eid="LUK 8:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="LUK 9" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela pe dešuduje učenikon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 9:1" />Togaš o Isus vikingja pe dešuduje učenikon hem dengja len sila hem avtoriteti te ikalen sa e demonen hem te sasljaren nasvalipe. <verse eid="LUK 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 9:2" />I bičhalgja len te propovedinen bašo carstvo e Devleskoro hem te sasljaren e nasvalen.<verse eid="LUK 9:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 9:3" />I phengja lenge: “Ma len tumencar ništo ko drumo: ni kaš phiribaske, ni torba, ni maro, ni pare, ni javer gad. <verse eid="LUK 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 9:4" />Ako khugjen ko jekh kher hem ola priminge tumen, ačhoven adathe sa dži kote na džana tumenge taro adava gradi. <verse eid="LUK 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 9:5" />Ako na priminge tumen, ikloven taro adava gradi hem tresinen i prašina taro tumare pre sar znako deka nane tumen ništo lencar.”<verse eid="LUK 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 9:6" />I ola gele taro gav ko gav, propovedindor o evangelije hem sasljarindor e nasvalen ko sa o thana.<verse eid="LUK 9:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Irod bunimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 9:7" />A o Irod, o vladiteli e Galilejakoro, šungja sa so ulo hem sine bunimo adaleske so nesave manuša vakerge deka o Jovan Krstitel uštilo taro mule. <verse eid="LUK 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 9:8" />A javera vakerge deka o prorok Ilija pojavisalilo, a nesave javera vakerge deka uštilo taro mule nesavo proroko taro purano vreme.<verse eid="LUK 9:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 9:9" />Ama o Irod phengja: “Me čhingjum e Jovaneskoro šero. A koj tano akava so šunava baši leske asavke bukja?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:9">I mangla te dikhel e Isuse.<verse eid="LUK 9:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus parvarela poviše taro pandž ilade manuša</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 9:10" />Koga o apostojla irange pe ko Isus, vakerge leske sa so kerge. I o Isus lela len peja hem cidinge pe ko gradi Vitsaida te šaj te oven korkori. <verse eid="LUK 9:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 9:11" />Ama o narodo šungja bašo adava i gelo palo lende. A o Isus primingja len hem vakerela sine lenge bašo carstvo e Devleskoro hem sasljargja adalen kaske so trebingja sastipe.<verse eid="LUK 9:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 9:12" />I koga počmingja te perel o kham, o dešuduj apostojla ale ko Isus hem phenge leske: “Mukh e manušen te džan ko najpaše gava hem thana te šaj arakhena nešto hajbaske hem than sojbaske. Adaleske so amen sijem akate ko čučo than kote so nane ništo.”<verse eid="LUK 9:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 9:13" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Den len tumen nešto hajbaske!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:13">Ola phenge: “Amen isi amen samo pandž mare hem duj mačhe, osven ako gelem te kina maro bašo sa akava narodo.” <verse eid="LUK 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 9:14" />A adathe sine pandž ilade murša.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:14">Togaš o Isus phengja pe učenikonge: “Neka bešen ko grupe po pinda.”<verse eid="LUK 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 9:15" />I ola kerge agjar, hem čhige sarinen te bešen. <verse eid="LUK 9:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 9:16" />O Isus lela o pandž mare hem o duj mačhe, dikhla upre ko nebo, hem blagodaringja bašo hajbe. Phagla len hem dengja pe učenikonge te delinen e manušencar. <verse eid="LUK 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 9:17" />I sarinen hale hem čalile, a taro adava so ačhilo o učenikija khedinge dešuduj korpe hajbe.<verse eid="LUK 9:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar phenela deka o Isus tano o Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 9:18" />Jekh dive o Isus molingja pe korkori, a leja sine leskere učenikija. I ov pučlja len: “So phenena o manuša, koj sijum me?”<verse eid="LUK 9:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 9:19" />Ola odgovoringe leske: “Nekoj phenela o Jovan Krstitel, a javera phenena deka sijan o prorok Ilija, a nesave javera phenena deka tu sijan jekh taro prorokija taro purano vreme so uštilo taro mule.”<verse eid="LUK 9:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 9:20" />Togaš o Isus pučlja len: “A tumen? So phenena, koj sijum me?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:20">O Petar odgovoringja leske: “Tu sijan o Hristos e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 9:21" />A o Isus zapovedingja pe učenikonge te na vakeren nikaske deka ov tano o Hristos, <verse eid="LUK 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 9:22" />hem vakergja: “O Čhavo Manušeskoro mora but te cidel, hem nane te ovel prifatimo taro starešine, taro prvosveštenikija hem taro učitejla e Zakoneskere, hem ka ovel mudardo. Ama o trito dive ka uštel taro mule.”<verse eid="LUK 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Sar te ove e Isuseskoro učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 9:23" />Togaš o Isus phengja sarinenge: “Koj mangela te ovel mo učeniko, neka otkažinel pe pestar hem neka lel po krsto sekova dive hem neka phirel pala mande. <verse eid="LUK 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 9:24" />Soske koj mangela te spasinel po životo, ka našavel le, a koj mangela te našavel po životo baši mange, ka spasinel le. <verse eid="LUK 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 9:25" />So džabe e manušeske celo sveto te lel, ako našavela ili upropastinela korkori pes? <verse eid="LUK 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 9:26" />Soske koj ladžala mandar hem me lafendar, o Čhavo Manušeskoro da ka ladžal lestar, koga ka avel ki pi slava hem ki slava pe Dadeske hem e sveto angelengiri. <verse eid="LUK 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 9:27" />Čače vakerava tumenge, isi nesave maškar tumende so nane te meren, dži kote na dikhena o carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela pi slava pe trine učenikonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 9:28" />Koga nakhle ofto dive palo adava, o Isus lela peja e Petare, e Jovane hem e Jakove hem uklile ki gora te molinel pe. <verse eid="LUK 9:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 9:29" />I dži kote molinela pe sine, leskoro muj promenisalilo, a o šeja leskere ule parne sar e gromeskiri svetlina. <verse eid="LUK 9:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 9:30" />I taro jekh puti adathe pojavisalile duj manuša hem počminge te keren e Isuseja lafi. Adala sine o Mojsej hem o Ilija. <verse eid="LUK 9:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 9:31" />Lengoro izgled sine ki bari svetlina hem kerge leja lafi bašo meribe so adžikerela le ko Erusalim.<verse eid="LUK 9:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 9:32" />A o Petar hem okola so sine leja, zasuke. Koga uštile, dikhle e Isuse ki bari svetlina hem e duje manušen so tergjona sine leja.<verse eid="LUK 9:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 9:33" />Koga o Mojsej hem o Ilija počminge te ciden pe e Isusestar, o Petar phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, šukar amenge so sijem akate. Te kera trin šatojra – jekh tuke, jekh e Mojsijaske, hem jekh e Ilijaske.” Ov na džanela sine so vakerela.<verse eid="LUK 9:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 9:34" />Dži kote o Petar kerela sine lafi, pojavingja pe jekh oblako hem učhargja len. A koga učhargja len o oblako, ola darandile.<verse eid="LUK 9:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 9:35" />I šundilo glaso taro oblako: “Akava tano mo birimo Čhavo. Le šunen!”<verse eid="LUK 9:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 9:36" />Koga šundilo adava glaso, o učenikija dikhle samo e Isuse korkori. A o učenikija arakhena sine adava ki peste hem nikaske na vakerge so dikhle ko adava momenti.<verse eid="LUK 9:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ikalela e čhavestar o lošno duho</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 9:37" />Tajsutno dive, koga o Isus hem o trin učenikija hulile tari gora, bari gužva ale te dikhen e Isuse.<verse eid="LUK 9:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 9:38" />I akje, jekh manuš tari gužva vikingja: “Učitele, molinava tut te pomožine me čhave, adaleske soj tano mange jekh čhavo! <verse eid="LUK 9:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 9:39" />O lošno duho but puti astarela le hem taro jekh puti vikinela; peravela le ki phuv hem o čhavo ikalela pena taro muj; edvaj mukhela le hem uništinela le. <verse eid="LUK 9:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 9:40" />I rodingjem te učenikondar te ikalen le, ama ola našti sine te keren adava.”<verse eid="LUK 9:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 9:41" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “O, bez verno hem rumimi generacijo, dži koga ka ovav tumencar hem ka trpinav tumen? Ana te čhave akate!”<verse eid="LUK 9:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 9:42" />Dži kote o čhavo avela sine ko Isus, o demoni frdingja le tele ki phuv. A o Isus zapovedingja e lošno duhoske te cidel pe e čhavestar, sasljargja e čhave hem dengja le palal ko dad. <verse eid="LUK 9:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 9:43" />Togaš sarinen sine začudime so dikhle e Devleskiri bari sila.</para>
  <para style="s1" vid="LUK 9:43">O Isus dujto puti vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:43">Dži kote sarinen čudinena pe sine bašo adava so kergja o Isus, ov phengja pe učenikonge: <verse eid="LUK 9:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 9:44" />“Šunen šukar akala lafija: o Čhavo Manušeskoro, ka ovel predajmo ko vasta e manušenge.”<verse eid="LUK 9:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 9:45" />Ama o učenikija na svatinge e Isuse so mangla te vakerel adaleja. Adava sine garavdo lendar i adaleske našti svatinge le, a darana sine te pučen le bašo adava.<verse eid="LUK 9:45" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj tano najbaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 9:46" />O učenikija počminge maškar peste te akošen pe koj lendar tano najbaro. <verse eid="LUK 9:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 9:47" />A o Isus džangja lengere misle, i lela jekhe tikne čhave, čhigja le uza peste, <verse eid="LUK 9:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 9:48" />hem phengja lenge: “Koj priminela akale tikne čhave ko mo anav, priminela man. A koj priminela man, priminela okole so bičhalgja man. Adaleske so, koj tano najtikno maškar tumende, ov tano najbaro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj nane protiv tumende, ov tano tumencar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 9:49" />O Jovan phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, dikhlem nesave manuše sar ikalela demonen ko to anav hem amen na mukhlem le te kerel adava, soske ov na džala amencar pala tute.”<verse eid="LUK 9:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 9:50" />A o Isus phengja leske: “Mukhen le te kerel adava, soske okova so nane protiv tumende, ov tano tumencar.”<verse eid="LUK 9:50" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Samarijajna na priminena e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 9:51" />A koga sine paše o dive o Isus te ovel voznesimo ko nebo, ov odlučingja te džal ko Erusalim. <verse eid="LUK 9:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 9:52" />I bičhalgja nesave glasnikon angla leste. Ola gele hem khuge ko nesavo Samarijansko gav te spreminen leske sa. <verse eid="LUK 9:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 9:53" />Ama o manuša na priminge e Isuse soske džanena sine deka džala ko Erusalim.<verse eid="LUK 9:53" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 9:54" />Koga o učenikija o Jakov hem o Jovan dikhle adava, pučle e Isuse: “Gospode, mangeja li te vakera te hulel taro nebo jag hem te tharel len sa?”<verse eid="LUK 9:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 9:55" />Ama o Isus irangja pe hem zaptingja len. <verse eid="LUK 9:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 9:56" />Palo adava ov hem leskere učenikija gele ko javer gav.<verse eid="LUK 9:56" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Nane lokho te ovel e Isuseskoro učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 9:57" />Dži kote džana sine ko drumo, nesavo manuš alo hem phengja e Isuseske: “Ka avav pala tute kaj i te dža.”<verse eid="LUK 9:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 9:58" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “E lisicen isi len pe thana kaj te soven hem e čiriklen gnezdija, ama o Čhavo Manušeskoro nane kaj te čhivel po šero.”<verse eid="LUK 9:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 9:59" />A javere manušeske phengja: “Ava pala mande!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 9:59">Ama ov odgovoringja: “Gospode ač te parunav prvo me dade.”<verse eid="LUK 9:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 9:60" />I o Isus phengja leske: “Mukh e mulen, te parunen pe mulen, a tu dža hem propovedin bašo carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 9:61" />Togaš javer manuš phengja: “Ka avav pala tute Gospode, ama ač prvo te džav hem te pozdravinav man me familijaja.”<verse eid="LUK 9:61" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 9:62" />Ama o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Koj čhivela pe vasta ko plugo te randel hem dikhela palal, nane dostojno bašo carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 9:62" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="LUK 10" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela e eftavardešu dujen učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 10:1" />Palo adava, o Gospodari o Isus biringja javere eftavardešu dujen učenikon hem bičhalgja len duj po duj angla peste ko sa o gradija hem o thana kote so ov mangla te džal, <verse eid="LUK 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 10:2" />vakerindor: “I žetva tani bari ama rabotnikija isi hari. Adaleske, molinen tumare Gospodare e žetvakoro te bičhavel rabotnikija ki pi niva baši žetva. <verse eid="LUK 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 10:3" />Džan! Akje, bičhavav tumen sar bakhre maškar o ruva. <verse eid="LUK 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 10:4" />Ma len tumencar kesa parencar, ni torba, ni javera sandale. I ma našaven tumaro vreme agjar so ka tergjoven te pozdravinen tumen nekasaja ko drumo.<verse eid="LUK 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 10:5" />Koga ka khuven ko nesavo kher, prvo vakeren: ‘Mir akale khereste.’ <verse eid="LUK 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 10:6" />Ako isi nekoj so mangela mir, tumaro mir neka ačhol leja, a te na mangla mir, tumaro mir ka iranel pe tumende. <verse eid="LUK 10:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 10:7" />Koga ka oven adale khereste, ačhoven leste hem ma džan taro adava kher ko javer, nego han hem pijen adava so ka ikalen tumenge, soske o rabotniko zaslužinela pi plata.<verse eid="LUK 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 10:8" />Koga ka khuven ko nesavo gradi hem ka priminen tumen, han adava so ka ikalen angli tumende. <verse eid="LUK 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 10:9" />Sasljaren e nasvalen adathe hem vakeren lenge: ‘Alo tumenge paše o carstvo e Devleskoro!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 10:10" />Ama, ako khugjen ko nesavo gradi, a na priminge tumen, ikloven ko leskere ulice hem vakeren: <verse eid="LUK 10:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 10:11" />‘I prašina taro tumaro gradi so pipinge la amare pre, amen kosaja la sar znako deka nane amen ništo tumencar. Ama, džanen akava: alo paše o carstvo e Devleskoro!’ <verse eid="LUK 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 10:12" />Vakerava tumenge polokhe ka ovel e Sodomeske ko sudno dive, nego akale gradeske.”<verse eid="LUK 10:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ukorinela o grešna gradija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 10:13" />“Pharo tuke, Horazin! Pharo tuke, Vitsaida! Soske, o čudija so ule tumende te oven sine kerde ko Tir hem Sidon, ola angleder ka pokajnen pe sine hem ka uraven pe ko vreke hem ka čhiven pravo upro pumare šere. <verse eid="LUK 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 10:14" />Ama e Tireske hem e Sidoneske ka ovel polokhe ko sudno dive nego tumenge. <verse eid="LUK 10:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 10:15" />A tu, Kapernaume, ka ove li vazdimo dži ko nebo? Na, tu ka hule dži ko than e mulengoro.”<verse eid="LUK 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 10:16" />Togaš phengja pe učenikonge: “Koj šunela tumen, šunela man. A koj odbinela tumen, odbinela man. A koj odbinela man, odbinela okole so bičhalgja man.”<verse eid="LUK 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O eftavardešu duj učenikija iranena pe ko Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 10:17" />Koga o eftavardešu duj učenikija irange pe taro drumo radosna, phenge e Isuseske: “Gospode, ko to anav o demojna da pokorinena pe amenge!”<verse eid="LUK 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 10:18" />A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Dikhlum e Benge sar perela taro nebo sar gromi. <verse eid="LUK 10:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 10:19" />Akje, dengjum tumen avtoriteti te gazinen e sapen hem e škorpijen hem te vladinen upri celo sila e dušmaneskiri hem ništo nane te ovel tumenge lošno. <verse eid="LUK 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 10:20" />Ama ma radujnen tumen so o lošna duhija pokorinena pe tumenge, nego radujnen tumen so tumare anava tane pišime ko nebo.”<verse eid="LUK 10:20" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus radujnela pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 10:21" />Togaš o Isus radujngja pe preku o Sveti Duh hem phengja: “Slavinava tut, Dade, Gospode e neboskoro hem e phuvijakoro, soske garagjan akava taro mudra hem taro učime, hem sikavgjan le okolenge soj tane sar tikne čhave. Oja, Dade, džanava deka kergjan adava adaleske so agjar manglan.<verse eid="LUK 10:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 10:22" />Sa i mange dendo taro mo Dad. Nikoj na džanela e Čhave, osven o Dad, hem nikoj na džanela e Dade, osven o Čhavo hem okolenge so o Čhavo birinela te sikavel le.”<verse eid="LUK 10:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 10:23" />Togaš irangja pe ko pe učenikija hem phengja lenge: “Blagoslovime tane o jakha so dikhena adava so tumen dikhena. <verse eid="LUK 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 10:24" />Adaleske so vakerava tumenge deka but prorokija hem cajra mangle te dikhen adava so tumen dikhena, ama na dikhle, hem te šunen adava so tumen šunena, ama na šunge.”<verse eid="LUK 10:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo šukar Samarijanco</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 10:25" />Jekh dive, jekh učiteli e Zakoneskoro uštilo te iskušinel e Isus, pučindor: “Učitele, so trebela te kerav te šaj te nasledinav o večno životo?”<verse eid="LUK 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 10:26" />I o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Soj pišimo ko Zakoni? So čitineja adathe?”<verse eid="LUK 10:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 10:27" />A ov odgovoringja: “Mang e Gospodare te Devle sa te srceja, sa te dušaja, sa te silaja hem sa te gogjaja<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="DEU 6:5">PZ 6:5</ref>.</char></note> hem mang te pašutne sar tut so mangeja.”<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">10:27 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19:18</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 10:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 10:28" />O Isus phengja leske: “Šukar vakergjan. Ker agjar hem ka živine.”<verse eid="LUK 10:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 10:29" />Ama o učiteli e Zakoneskoro mangla te opravdinel pe i pučlja e Isuse: “A koj tano mo pašutno?”<verse eid="LUK 10:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 10:30" />A ko adava o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Jekh manuš, dži kote hulela sine taro Erusalim ko Erihon, sine napadimo taro čora. Ola marge le silno hem hulage leskere šeja hem gele peske, a e manuše mukhle le ko drumo ekvaš mulo.<verse eid="LUK 10:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 10:31" />Ko adava momenti nakhla nesavo svešteniko so hulela sine taro adava drumo, i koga dikhla adale manuše nakhla tari javer strana. <verse eid="LUK 10:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 10:32" />Isto agjar da nesavo leviti koga alo ko adava than hem dikhla e manuše pašlo, nakhla tari javer strana e drumoskiri.<verse eid="LUK 10:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 10:33" />Ama sine jekh Samarijanco so nakhela sine taro adava drumo. Koga resla ko adava than kote so pašlola sine o manuš, dikhla le, i pelo leske žal baši leske. <verse eid="LUK 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 10:34" />A koga alo uza leste, makhla leskere rane ujleja hem mojlaja hem pakjargja len. Palo adava uklargja le upro leskoro her hem legargja le ki jekh gostilnica, i adathe grižingja pe leske. <verse eid="LUK 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 10:35" />Tajsutno dive ikalgja duj srebrena pare hem dengja len e manušeske tari gostilnica hem vakergja leske: ‘Arakh akale manuše, hem sa so ka trošine poviše, ka platinav tuke koga ka iranav man taro drumo.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 10:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 10:36" />Palo akava o Isus pučlja e učitele taro Zakoni: “So mislineja? Koj taro akala trin sine o pašutno adaleskoro so sine napadimo taro čora?”<verse eid="LUK 10:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 10:37" />Ov odgovoringja: “Okova so žalingja le.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 10:37">Togaš o Isus phengja leske: “Oja, tu da dža hem ker agjar.”<verse eid="LUK 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus ko kher e Martakoro hem e Marijakoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 10:38" />Dži kote o Isus hem leskere učenikija džana sine ko Erusalim, khuge ko nesavo gav, kote so živinela sine nesavi džuvli so lakoro anav sine Marta. Oj primingja len ko po kher. <verse eid="LUK 10:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 10:39" />La sine la phen so lakoro anav sine Marija, so bešela sine uza e Gospodareskere e Isuseskere pre hem šunela sine o lafija leskere.<verse eid="LUK 10:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 10:40" />Ama i Marta sine zafatimi ko sa o strane so trebela sine te spreminel pe, i ali uza ko Isus hem pučlja le: “Gospode, nane li tuke gajle so mi phen mukhla man korkori te kerav buti? Vaker lake te pomožinel man!”<verse eid="LUK 10:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 10:41" />A o Gospodari odgovoringja lake: “Marto, Marto! Tu but sekirineja tu hem voznemirineja tut bašo but bukja, <verse eid="LUK 10:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 10:42" />ama samo jekh buti trebela. I Marija biringja adava soj pošukar, i adava nane te lel pe latar.”<verse eid="LUK 10:42" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="LUK 11" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela e učenikon sar te molinen pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 11:1" />Jekh dive o Isus molingja pe ko jekh than. Koga završingja e molitvaja, jekh taro leskere učenikija phengja leske: “Gospode sikav amen te molina amen sar so o Jovan Krstitel sikavgja pe učenikon!”<verse eid="LUK 11:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 11:2" />Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “Koga molinena tumen vakeren:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 11:2" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">‘Dade, neka ovel sveto to anav,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:2">te avel to carstvo,<verse eid="LUK 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 11:3" />amaro šuko maro de amen sekova dive,<verse eid="LUK 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 11:4" />hem oprostin amare grevija,</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">sar so amen oprostinaja sarinenge so grešinena amenge.</para>
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 11:4">Hem cide amen taro iskušenie.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 11:5" />Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “Zamislinen deka ki ekvaš i rat džana ko tumaro amal hem vakerena leske: ‘Amala, te de man trin mare, i ka iranav len tuke. <verse eid="LUK 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 11:6" />Mo amal alo taro drumo ki mande, a man nane man so te ikavav anglo leste.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 11:7" />A ov andral te phenel: ‘Ma dosadin man! O udar tano phandlo, a me čhave više pašlile mancar hem sovena. Našti akana te uštav hem te dav tut!’ <verse eid="LUK 11:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 11:8" />Vakerava tumenge: nane te uštel hem nane te del le maro adaleske soj leskoro amal, nego ka uštel hem ka del le sa so trebela adaleske so leskere amale nane le ladž te ovel dosadno.<verse eid="LUK 11:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 11:9" />Adaleske vakerava tumenge: Pučen hem ka del pe tumenge; roden hem ka arakhen; khuven hem ka phravel pe tumenge. <verse eid="LUK 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 11:10" />Soske sekoj so pučela, dobinela; hem koj rodela, arakhela; a koj khuvela, ka phravel pe leske.<verse eid="LUK 11:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 11:11" />A kova dad tumendar: Ako rodela leskoro čhavo mačho, ka del le sap? <verse eid="LUK 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 11:12" />Ili ako rodela lestar jaro, ka del le škorpija? <verse eid="LUK 11:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 11:13" />Togaš, tumen so sijen lošna, džanena te den šukar poklojna tumare čhavenge, a kozom poviše tumaro Dad soj ko nebo ka del o Sveti Duh okolenge so rodena lestar.”<verse eid="LUK 11:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Veelzevul</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 11:14" />Jekh dive o Isus ikalgja e demone so na mukhela sine jekhe manuše te kerel lafi. Koga iklilo o demoni, o manuš počmingja te kerel lafi. I o narodo sine začudime.<verse eid="LUK 11:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 11:15" />Ama nesave lendar phenge: “Akava ikalela e demonen e Veelzevuleskere silaja, o gospodari e demonengoro.”<verse eid="LUK 11:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 11:16" />A javera iskušinge e Isuse adaleja so rodinge lestar znako taro nebo.<verse eid="LUK 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 11:17" />Ama o Isus džanela sine lengere misle hem phengja lenge: “Sekova carstvo soj maškar peste delimo ka perel, hem kher kote so nane sloga ka perel. <verse eid="LUK 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 11:18" />Ako e Bengeskoro carstvo maškar peste delisalilo, sar šaj togaš ačhola leskoro carstvo? Akava vakerava adaleske so tumen phenena deka me ikalava e demonen e Veelzevuleskere silaja. <verse eid="LUK 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 11:19" />Ako me ikavava e demonen e Veelzevuleskere silaja, tumare učenikija kaskere silaja ikavena len? Adaleske ola ka oven tumare sudije. <verse eid="LUK 11:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 11:20" />Ama ako e Devleskere silaja ikalava e demonen, togaš e Devleskoro carstvo alo upra tumende.”<verse eid="LUK 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 11:21" />O Isus phengja akava da: “Koga zoralo manuš hem voružimo arakhela po kher, leskoro barvalipe tano arakhlo. <verse eid="LUK 11:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 11:22" />Ama koga avela nekoj soj pozoralo lestar, ka pobedinel le hem ka lel lestar o oružje ko savo nadingja pe o manuš hem ka delinel le pe manušencar adava so lela.<verse eid="LUK 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 11:23" />Koj nane mancar, ov tano protiv mande, a koj na khedela mancar, ov rasturinela.”<verse eid="LUK 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koga o lošno duho iranela pe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 11:24" />“Koga o lošno duho iklola taro manuš, ov nakhela taro šuke thana rodindor odmor. Koga na arakhela vakerela: ‘Ka iranav man ko kher kotar so iklilum.’ <verse eid="LUK 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 11:25" />I koga ka resel arakhela o kher čistimo hem namestimo. <verse eid="LUK 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 11:26" />Togaš džala hem lela peja efta javera duhija soj pološna lestar, hem ola khuvena hem živinena adathe. I ko krajo adava manuš ovela pološno nego angleder.”<verse eid="LUK 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Blagoslovime tane okola so šunena e Devle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 11:27" />Dži kote o Isus kerela sine lafi adalestar, jekh džuvli tari gužva vikingja: “Blagoslovimi tani i daj so bijangja tut hem so dengja tut thud!”<verse eid="LUK 11:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 11:28" />A o Isus phengja: “Poblagoslovime tane okola so šunena o lafi e Devleskoro hem kerena le!”<verse eid="LUK 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O znako taro Jona</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 11:29" />Dži kote khedela pe sine i gužva, o Isus počmingja te vakerel: “Akaja generacija tani lošno. Rodela mandar znako, ama nisavo znako nane te del pe, osven o znako so ulo e prorokoja e Jonaja. <verse eid="LUK 11:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 11:30" />Soske, sar o Jona so sine znako e manušenge so živinena sine ki Ninevija, agjar o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel znako akale generacijake.<verse eid="LUK 11:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 11:31" />Ko sudno dive, i kralica taro jug ka uštel protiv akaja generacija hem ka sudinel la, soske oj ali taro krajo e svetoskoro te šunel e Solomoneskiri mudrost, a akate tano nekoj pobaro taro Solomon. <verse eid="LUK 11:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 11:32" />Ko sudno dive, o manuša taro gradi Ninevija ka ušten protiv akaja generacija hem ka sudinen la, soske ola pokajnge pe koga o Jona propovedingja, a akate tano nekoj pobaro taro Jona.”<verse eid="LUK 11:32" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I svetlina e teloskiri</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 11:33" />“Nikoj na tharela i momoli te čhivel la ko garavdo than ili te učharel la čareja, nego čhivela la ko lakoro than te šaj te dikhen i svetlina adala so khuvena. <verse eid="LUK 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 11:34" />Ti jakh tani svetlina te teloske. Koga te jakha tane saste, celo to telo tano pherdo svetlinaja. Ama koga ti jakh tani lošno, celo to telo tano pherdo temninaja. <verse eid="LUK 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 11:35" />Adaleske pazin i svetlina soj tute te na ovel temnina. <verse eid="LUK 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 11:36" />Adaleske, ako celo to telo tano pherdo svetlinaja, hem nijekh delo lestar nane temno, togaš celo to životo ka ovel osvetlimo sar koga i momoli svetinela tut pe svetloja.”<verse eid="LUK 11:36" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharo e farisejenge hem e učitelenge e Zakoneskere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 11:37" />Koga o Isus vakergja adava, jekh farisejco vikingja le te hal maro ki leste. I o Isus khugja leske ko kher hem alo uza ko astali. <verse eid="LUK 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 11:38" />A o farisejco čudingja pe koga dikhla deka o Isus, palo adeti, na thogja pe vasta angleder o hajbe.<verse eid="LUK 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 11:39" />Togaš o Gospodari o Isus phengja leske: “Oja, tumen o fariseja thovena avrijaldan i čaša hem i činija, a andral tumen sijen pherde so alčnost hem lošnipe. <verse eid="LUK 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 11:40" />Glupavonalen! Nane li o Devel okova so kergja e manuše, so džanela le hem avrijaldan hem andral? <verse eid="LUK 11:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 11:41" />Ama adava so isi tumen, den e čorolen hem sa ka ovel tumenge čisto.<verse eid="LUK 11:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 11:42" />Pharo tumenge e farisejenge, soske dena e Devleske desetok taro nane, ruta, hem taro sa o zelenčuk, a mukhlen te keren javerenge adava soj pravedno hem te mangen e Devle. Trebela te den o desetok, ama na trebela te bistren te keren adava soj najvažno.<verse eid="LUK 11:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 11:43" />Pharo tumenge e farisejenge, soske mangena te bešen ko prvo thana ko sinagoge hem so mangena o manuša te poštojnen tumen ko pazajra. <verse eid="LUK 11:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 11:44" />Pharo tumenge soske sijen sar bi označime grobija upro save o manuša phirena, a na džanena.”<verse eid="LUK 11:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 11:45" />Togaš jekh taro učitejla e Zakoneskere phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, tu akale lafencar amen da uvredžineja.”<verse eid="LUK 11:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 11:46" />A o Isus odgovoringja: “Pharo tumenge da, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere! Čhivena upro manuša pharipe so edvaj šaj phiravena, a tumen ni najeja na mangena te mrdinen te pomožinen lenge.<verse eid="LUK 11:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 11:47" />Pharo tumenge, adaleske so kerena spomenikija e prorokonge so tumare parapapija mudarge len. <verse eid="LUK 11:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 11:48" />Adaleja vakerena deka soglasinena tumen ko adava so kerge tumare parapapija: ola mudarge e prorokon, a tumen kerena lenge spomenikija. <verse eid="LUK 11:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 11:49" />Adaleske o Devel mudro vakergja tumendar: ‘Ka bičhavav lenge prorokija hem apostojla. Nekas lendar ka mudaren, a nekas ka progoninen.’<verse eid="LUK 11:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 11:50" />Adaleske akale generacijatar ka rodel pe o rat sa e prorokongoro so thavdingja panda taro početok e svetoskoro, <verse eid="LUK 11:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 11:51" />panda taro rat e Aveleskoro sa dži ko rat e Zaharijaskoro, so sine mudardo maškar o žrtveniko hem o Sveto Than e Hrameskoro. Oja, vakerava tumenge, akaja generacija ka ovel osudimi bašo sa o rat so thavdingja!<verse eid="LUK 11:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 11:52" />Pharo tumenge, e učitelenge e Zakoneskere! Adaleske so lelen e manušendar o klučo bašo džandipe. Tumen korkori na khuvena ki leste, ni na mukhena okolen so mangena te khuven.”<verse eid="LUK 11:52" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 11:53" />I koga o Isus iklilo adathar, o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere počminge inateja te protivinen pe hem te pučen le taro but bukja, <verse eid="LUK 11:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 11:54" />adžikerindor te astaren le ko nesavo lafi sar te šaj te tužinen le.<verse eid="LUK 11:54" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="LUK 12" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus opomeninela bašo dujmujalipe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 12:1" />I koga khedisalile nekozom ilade manuša, doborom bari gužva sine so jekh jekhe gazinena sine, a o Isus prvo počmingja te vakerel pe učenikonge: “Arakhen tumen taro kvasaci e farisejengoro, soj tano dujmujalipe. <verse eid="LUK 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 12:2" />Nane ništo garavdo so nane te dikhol javno, ni tajno so nane te ovel šundo. <verse eid="LUK 12:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 12:3" />Adava so phengjen ki temnina, ka vakerel pe ki svetlina, a adava so vakergjen le pohari ko kan ko sobe, ka vakerel pe taro krovi sarinen te šunen.”<verse eid="LUK 12:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma daran</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 12:4" />“Ama phenava tumenge, amalalen: ma daran okolendar so šaj mudarena o telo, a palo adava našti te keren tumenge ništo poviše. <verse eid="LUK 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 12:5" />Ama ka phenav tumenge kastar trebela te daran: daran taro okova so palo tumaro meribe, isi le vlast te frdel tumen ko pekol. Oja, vakerava tumenge, lestar daran!<verse eid="LUK 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 12:6" />Na bikinela pe li pandž čirikla duje dinarenge? Ama nijekh lendar nane bisterdi anglo Devel. <verse eid="LUK 12:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 12:7" />A tumenge ko šero sekoja bal tani gejmi. Adaleske, ma daran! Tumen sijen povredna taro but čirikla.”<verse eid="LUK 12:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ma ladžan taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 12:8" />“Vakerava tumenge: Koj ka priznajnel deka tano mlo anglo manuša, o Čhavo Manušeskoro da ka priznajnel le deka tano leskoro anglo angejla e Devleskere. <verse eid="LUK 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 12:9" />Ama koj ka otkažinel pe mandar anglo manuša, me da ka otkažinav man lestar anglo angejla e Devleskere. <verse eid="LUK 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 12:10" />Hem sekoj so ka vakerel lafi protiv o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka ovel leske oprostimo, ama sekoj so ka hulinel upro Sveti Duh nane te ovel leske oprostimo.<verse eid="LUK 12:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 12:11" />A koga ka anen tumen anglo sudo ki sinagoga, anglo vlastija hem vladitejla, ma sekirinen tumen sar ka braninen tumen ili so ka vakeren, <verse eid="LUK 12:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 12:12" />soske o Sveti Duh ka sikavel tumen ko adava vreme so te vakeren.”<verse eid="LUK 12:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo barvalo glupavo manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 12:13" />Togaš nekoj tari gužva phengja e Isuseske: “Učitele, vaker me phraleske te delinel o nasledstvo mancar.”<verse eid="LUK 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 12:14" />O Isus odgovoringja: “Manušeja, koj čhigja man te ovav sudija ili te delinav tumenge?” <verse eid="LUK 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 12:15" />Togaš vakergja okolenge so šunena le: “Pazinen hem arakhen tumen tari alčnost, soske o životo nane taro baro barvalipe.”<verse eid="LUK 12:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 12:16" />O Isus vakergja lenge akaja parabola: “Nesave barvale manušeskiri niva dengja but bari žetva. <verse eid="LUK 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 12:17" />A ov mislingja ki peste: ‘So te kerav? Nane man doborom than kote te khedav mi žetva.’ <verse eid="LUK 12:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 12:18" />I phengja: ‘Akava ka kerav: ka rušinav me purane šupe hem ka kerav pobare, i adathe ka čhivav sa o giv hem sa so isi man. <verse eid="LUK 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 12:19" />Togaš ka vakerav me dušake: “Isi tut khedimo baro barvalipe bute beršenge. Odmorin, ha, pi hem uživin!”’<verse eid="LUK 12:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 12:20" />Ama o Devel phengja leske: ‘Glupavo manušeja, akaja rat ka lav ti duša. A sa adava so khedingjan, kaske ka ačhol?’<verse eid="LUK 12:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 12:21" />Agjar ka ovel okoleja so khedela peske barvalipe, a čorolo tano anglo Devel.”<verse eid="LUK 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo sekiracije</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 12:22" />Togaš o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: “Adaleske vakerava tumenge: ma sekirinen tumen bašo tumaro životo, so ka han, ili so ka phiravel tumaro telo. <verse eid="LUK 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 12:23" />Soske o životo tano považno taro hajbe, a o telo považno taro šeja. <verse eid="LUK 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 12:24" />Dikhen e čavken! Ola ni sejnena, ni na khedena, ni nane len šupa kaj te čhiven o hajbe, a palem parvarela len o Devel. A kozom tumen sijen poskupa taro čirikla! <verse eid="LUK 12:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 12:25" />A šaj li nekoj tumendar sekirindor te prodolžinel hari po životo? <verse eid="LUK 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 12:26" />Hem agjar, koga našti ni adava o najtikno te kere, soske sekirinen tumen bašo sa javer?<verse eid="LUK 12:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 12:27" />Dikhen sar bajrona o diva lulugja. Ni mučinena pe, ni na sivena peske šeja, ama vakerava tumenge ni o car Solomon, so sine but barvalo, na sine uravdo agjar, sar jekh lendar. <verse eid="LUK 12:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 12:28" />Ako o Devel agjar uravela o pole e lulugjencar, so avdive tani adathe, a tajsa frdena pe ki jag, kozom poviše šeja ka del pe tumenge, tikne verakere! <verse eid="LUK 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 12:29" />Ma sekirinen tumen bašo adava so ka han ili so ka pijen. <verse eid="LUK 12:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 12:30" />Soske sa akava rodena okola so na džanena e Devle. A tumaro Dad džanela sa adava so trebela tumen. <verse eid="LUK 12:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 12:31" />Nego, roden o carstvo e Devleskoro, i sa akava ka del pe tumenge.<verse eid="LUK 12:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 12:32" />Ma daran, mo tikno stado! Adaleske so tumare Dadeskiri vojla tani te del tumen o carstvo.<verse eid="LUK 12:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 12:33" />Bikinen so isi tumen hem den le e čorolenge! Keren tumenge kesa so našti te pharavgjovel hem barvalipe ko nebo so nikat nane te našavgjovel, kote so o čor našti te khuvel hem o insektija našti nikat te uništinel le. <verse eid="LUK 12:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 12:34" />Soske kaj tano to barvalipe, adathe ka ovel tumaro srce da.”<verse eid="LUK 12:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O spremno hem o nespremno sluga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 12:35" />O Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: “Oven spremna baši služba hem ikeren tumare momojla thare, <verse eid="LUK 12:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 12:36" />sar so o sluge adžikerena pe gospodaren te iranel pe taro bijav. Koga ka iranel pe o gospodari hem ka khuvel ko udar, o sluge tane spremna odma te phraven leske. <verse eid="LUK 12:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 12:37" />Blago adale slugenge, koga lengoro gospodari ka avel hem ka arakhel len džangavde. Čače vakerava tumenge, ov o gospodari ka phandel pe i kecela, ka bešlarel len ki sofra hem ka služinel lenge. <verse eid="LUK 12:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 12:38" />Blago adale slugenge koga lengoro gospodari ka avel hem arakhel len džangavde, i te alo da ki ekvaš i rat ili pred te phravgjol o sabaj.<verse eid="LUK 12:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 12:39" />Ama džanen akava: te džanel sine o domakini e khereskoro ko kova sati tari rat ka avel o čor, nane sine te mukhel le te khuvel ko kher. <verse eid="LUK 12:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 12:40" />Adaleske tumen oven spremna, soske o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel togaš koga nane te adžikeren le!”<verse eid="LUK 12:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 12:41" />Togaš o Petar pučlja e Isuse: “Gospode, amenge li vakereja akaja parabola ili sarinenge?”<verse eid="LUK 12:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 12:42" />O Gospodari o Isus odgovoringja: “Koj tano verno hem mudro upraviteli, kas o gospodari ka čhivel le upreder pe sluge te del len o hajbe ko vreme? <verse eid="LUK 12:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 12:43" />Blago adale slugaske, koga leskoro gospodari ka avel hem ka arakhel le sar kerel adava. <verse eid="LUK 12:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 12:44" />Čače vakerava tumenge, ka čhivel le upravniko upro sa leskoro barvalipe. <verse eid="LUK 12:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 12:45" />Ama, ako adava sluga phenela ki peste: ‘Nane te avel panda mo gospodari’, i počminela te marel javeren slugjen hem slugjinken, hem te hal hem te pijel hem te makjol, <verse eid="LUK 12:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 12:46" />o gospodari adale slugaskoro ka avel ko adava dive koga nane te adžikerel le hem ko adava sati savo ov nane te džanel, ka čhinel le ko kotora hem ka čhivel le maškar o nevernikija.<verse eid="LUK 12:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 12:47" />A adava sluga so džanela i vojla pe gospodareskiri, a na spremingja pe ili na kergja adava so mangla leskoro gospodari, ka hal but mariba. <verse eid="LUK 12:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 12:48" />A okova so na džanela i vojla pe gospodareskiri, a kerela bukja so zaslužinela kazna, hari maribe ka hal. Kaske i dendo but, poviše ka rodel pe lestar, hem kaske i doverimo but, poviše ka rodel pe lestar.”<verse eid="LUK 12:48" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Na mir nego deliba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 12:49" />Togaš o Isus phengja: “Alum te frdav i jag e sudoskiri ki phuv hem kozom manglum sine te ovel thari! <verse eid="LUK 12:49" /><verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 12:50" />Ama trebela te nakhav taro mukengoro krstiba. But mange pharo dži kote adava na završinela pe! <verse eid="LUK 12:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 12:51" />Mislinena deka alum te anav mir ki phuv? Na. Alum te odvinav e manušen jekh jekhestar. <verse eid="LUK 12:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 12:52" />Adaleske taro akava dive, taro pandž džene ko kher, ka oven odvime: trin protiv duj hem duj protiv trin. <verse eid="LUK 12:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 12:53" />Ka uštel o dad protiv po čhavo, o čhavo protiv po dad, i daj protiv pi čhaj hem i čhaj protiv pi daj, i sasuj protiv pi bori hem i bori protiv pi sasuj.”<verse eid="LUK 12:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Trebela te pendžaren o znakija e vremeske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 12:54" />Togaš o Isus vakergja e manušenge: “Koga dikhena o oblakija sar avena taro zapad, odma vakerena: ‘Ka del peske bršim’, i čače dela peske. <verse eid="LUK 12:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 12:55" />A koga phudela i bavlal taro jug, vakerena: ‘Ka ovel but tato’, i ovela. <verse eid="LUK 12:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 12:56" />Dujemujengere manušalen! Džanena te pendžaren o izgled e neboskoro hem e phuvjakoro, a sar šaj te na džanen te pendžaren o znakija akale vremeskere?<verse eid="LUK 12:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 12:57" />Soske korkori tumen na sudinena soj ispravno? <verse eid="LUK 12:57" /><verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 12:58" />Koga džaja te dušmaneja ko sudo, de sa tutar tut te smirine tut leja dži kote sijan ko drumo, te na vlečinel tut to dušmani ko sudija, a o sudija te del tut e čuvareske so ka čhivel tut ko zatvor. <verse eid="LUK 12:58" /><verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 12:59" />Čače vakerava tuke, nane te iklove adathar sa dži kote na deja te posledna pare.”<verse eid="LUK 12:59" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="LUK 13" />
  <para style="s1">Sarinen trebela te pokajnen pe bašo pumare grevija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 13:1" />Ko adava vreme nesave manuša vakerge e Isuseske deka o Pilat, o upravniko e Rimeskoro, naredingja nesave Galilejcija te oven mudarde sar anena žrtva ko Hrami.<verse eid="LUK 13:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 13:2" />A o Isus phengja lenge: “Tumen mislinena deka adala Galilejcija sine pobare grešnikija taro sa okola Galilejcija, i adaleske agjar mudarge len? <verse eid="LUK 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 13:3" />Vakerava tumenge na! Ama te na pokajngjen tumen, tumen da ka meren! <verse eid="LUK 13:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 13:4" />Ili okola dešuofto so mule koga i kula peli upra lende ko Siloam, tumen mislinena deka ola sine pobare grešnikija sa e manušendar so živinena ko Erusalim? <verse eid="LUK 13:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 13:5" />Vakerava tumenge na! Ama te na pokajngjen tumen, tumen da ka meren!”<verse eid="LUK 13:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola baši smokva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 13:6" />Togaš o Isus vakergja lenge akaja parabola: “Jekh manuš sine le smokva so sine sadimi ki niva e drakhencar, i alo te rodel lakoro plodi, ama ništo na arakhla.<verse eid="LUK 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 13:7" />Togaš phengja e manušeske so arakhela sine i drakh: ‘Akje, trin berš sar avava te rodav plodi tari akaja smokva, ama na arakhava. Čhin la! Soske te šukjarel i phuv?’<verse eid="LUK 13:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 13:8" />A ov phengja: ‘Gospodare, mukh la panda akava berš. A me ka randav uza late hem ka frdav lake gjubrivo. <verse eid="LUK 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 13:9" />Ako dengja plodi dži berše, šukar i. A te na dengja plodi, togaš čhin la.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e grbalika</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 13:10" />Jekh sabota o Isus sikavela sine ki jekh sinagoga. <verse eid="LUK 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 13:11" />A adathe sine jekh romni, so o lošno duho kerela la sine te ovel nasvali. Oj sine grbalika dešuofto berš hem našti sine nisar te ispravinel pe.<verse eid="LUK 13:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 13:12" />Koga o Isus dikhla la, vikingja la ki peste hem phengja lake: “Manušnije, oslobodimi sijan taro to nasvalipe!”<verse eid="LUK 13:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 13:13" />I o Isus čhigja pe vasta upro late, i oj odma ispravingja pe hem počmingja te slavinel e Devle.<verse eid="LUK 13:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 13:14" />Togaš e sinagogakoro vodači holangja so o Isus sasljargja ki sabota i vakergja e manušenge: “Isi šov dive ko kurko kote so šaj kerela pe buti! Ko adala dive aven hem oven sasljarde, a na ki sabota!”<verse eid="LUK 13:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 13:15" />A o Gospodari o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Dujmujale sijen! Tumen ki sabota na phravena li tumare guruve ili tumare here tari štala te legaren le te pijel pani? <verse eid="LUK 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 13:16" />A akaja manušni tani taro seme e Avraameskoro so o Beng ikergja la phandli dešuofto berš. Oj na trebela li te ovel ki sabota oslobodimi taro akava nasvalipe?”<verse eid="LUK 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 13:17" />Koga phengja adava, sa adala so sine protiv leste ladžandile, a sa okola manuša radujnge pe bašo sa o šukar dejla so kerela len sine o Isus.<verse eid="LUK 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo sinapovo zrno</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 13:18" />Togaš o Isus phengja: “Soleja tano slično o carstvo e Devleskoro? Soleja te sporedinav le? <verse eid="LUK 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 13:19" />O carstvo nebesno tano sar o sinapovo zrno, so manuš lela le hem sadingja le ki pi bavča. Ov barilo hem ulo kaš hem o čirikla kerge gnezdija upro leskere granke.”<verse eid="LUK 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo kvasaci</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 13:20" />I palem phengja lenge: “Soleja te sporedinav o carstvo e Devleskoro? <verse eid="LUK 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 13:21" />Ov tano sar o kvasaci, so jekh džuvli lela le hem mešingja le ko biš kile varo sa dži kote na ušlilo.”<verse eid="LUK 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O tesno udar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 13:22" />Dži kote džala sine o Isus ko Erusalim, nakhela sine ko gradija hem ko gava hem sikavela sine e narodo.<verse eid="LUK 13:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 13:23" />I nekoj pučlja le: “Gospode, samo hari li manuša ka oven spasime?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:23">A o Isus phengja lenge: <verse eid="LUK 13:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 13:24" />“Den sa tumendar te khuven taro tesno udar, soske vakerava tumenge but džene ka roden te khuven, ama ka našti te khuven. <verse eid="LUK 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 13:25" />Koga o domakini ka uštel hem ka phandel o udar, ka ovel kasno. Togaš ka tergjoven avrijal hem ka khuven ko udar vikindor: ‘Gospode, phrav amenge!’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 13:25">Ama ov ka vakerel tumenge: ‘Na džanava kotar sijen.’<verse eid="LUK 13:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 13:26" />Togaš ka vakeren: ‘Halem hem pilem tuja, hem tu sikaveja amen sine ko amare ulice.’<verse eid="LUK 13:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 13:27" />A ov ka odgovorinel: ‘Na džanava kotar sijen. Ciden tumen mandar, sarinen tumen so kerena lošnipe!’<verse eid="LUK 13:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 13:28" />Adathe ka ovel baro rojba hem krckjiba dandencar, koga ka dikhen e Avraame, e Isako, e Jakove hem sa o prorokon ko carstvo e Devleskoro, a tumen frdime avrijal. <verse eid="LUK 13:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 13:29" />Ka aven manuša taro istok hem taro zapad, taro sever hem taro jug hem ka oven ko astali ko hajbe hem ko pijbe ko carstvo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 13:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 13:30" />Čače isi posledna so ka oven prva hem prva so ka oven posledna.”<verse eid="LUK 13:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus rovela bašo Erusalim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 13:31" />Ko adava vreme ko Isus ale nesave fariseja hem phenge leske: “Iklov taro akava than hem dža ko javer than, soske o car Irod mangela te mudarel tut.”<verse eid="LUK 13:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 13:32" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Džan hem vakeren adale lisicake: ‘Ka ikalav demonen hem ka sasljarav manušen avdive hem tajsa, a ko trito dive ka završinav mi buti.’ <verse eid="LUK 13:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 13:33" />Ama avdive, tajsa hem pretajsa mora te džav me drumoja, soske sigurno nijekh proroko našti merela avrijal taro Erusalim.<verse eid="LUK 13:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 13:34" />Erusalime, Erusalime, tu so mudareja e prorokon hem frdeja bara upro okola soj tuke bičhavde, but puti manglum te khedav te čhaven, sar so i khani khedela pe piličken telo pe paka, ama tumen na manglen. <verse eid="LUK 13:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 13:35" />Akje, to kher ka ovel napuštimo, i vakerava tumenge nane te dikhen man dži kote na phenena: ‘Blagoslovimo tano okova so avela ko anav e Gospodareskoro!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 13:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 13" />
  <chapter number="14" style="c" sid="LUK 14" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e manuše ki sabota</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 14:1" />Jekh sabota, o Isus gelo ko kher ko nesavo farisejsko vodači te hal. Sarinen so sine adathe, šukar pratinena le sine, <verse eid="LUK 14:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 14:2" />adaleske so adathe anglo leste sine jekh nasvalo manuš, so leskere vasta hem leskere pre sine pherde pani.<verse eid="LUK 14:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 14:3" />O Isus pučlja e farisejen hem e učitelen e Zakoneskere: “Dozvolimo li te sasljarel pe ki sabota ili na?” <verse eid="LUK 14:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 14:4" />Ama ola kjutinena sine. Togaš o Isus čhigja po vas upro nasvalo manuš, sasljargja le hem mukhla le te džal. <verse eid="LUK 14:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 14:5" />I pučlja len: “Koj tumendar ako leskoro čhavo ili guruv pelo ko bunari ki sabota, nane li odma te ikalel le adathar?”<verse eid="LUK 14:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 14:6" />Ama ola na sine len so te odgovorinen ko adava.<verse eid="LUK 14:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo gostija hem o gazda</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 14:7" />Koga dikhla o Isus sar o gostija birinena o najšukar thana ko astali, vakergja lenge akaja parabola: <verse eid="LUK 14:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 14:8" />“Koga nekoj ka kaninel tut ko bijav, ma beš ko najšukar than, soske šaj tano kanimo nesavo manuš soj tano popoštojmo tutar. <verse eid="LUK 14:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 14:9" />Togaš o gazda so kaningja hem tut hem le ka vakerel tuke: ‘Ušti taro leskoro than.’ Togaš ka ove ladžardo, i ka dža te beše ko posledno than. <verse eid="LUK 14:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 14:10" />Ama, koga sijan kanimo, dža hem beš ko posledno than. I koga ka dikhel adava o gazda ka vakerel tuke: ‘Amala, ava beš ko pošukar than!’ Togaš ka ove poštojmo anglo sa o gostija. <verse eid="LUK 14:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 14:11" />Soske sekoj so vazdela pe ka ovel ponižimo, a okova so ponižinela pe ka ovel vazdimo.”<verse eid="LUK 14:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 14:12" />Togaš o Isus phengja adaleske so kaningja le: “Koga vikineja gostija ko ručko ili ki večera, ma vikin te amalen, ni te phralen, ni te familija ili te barvale komšijen. Te vikineja len, ola da ka vikinen tut ki pumende hem agjar ka iranen tuke. <verse eid="LUK 14:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 14:13" />Ama, koga vikineja ko hajbe pijbe, vikin e čorolen, e sakaten, e bangen hem e korolen. <verse eid="LUK 14:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 14:14" />Togaš ka ove blagoslovimo, adaleske so ola našti te iranen tuke, ama o Devel ka iranel tuke, koga ka vazdel taro mule e pravednikon.”<verse eid="LUK 14:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo baro hajbe pijbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 14:15" />Koga šungja akava jekh lendar so bešela sine ko astali, phengja e Isuseske: “Blago okoleske so ka hal maro ko carstvo e Devleskoro!”<verse eid="LUK 14:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 14:16" />O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Nesavo manuš kergja baro hajbe pijbe hem kaningja but gostija. <verse eid="LUK 14:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 14:17" />I koga sa sine spremno o hajbaske, bičhalgja pe sluga te phenel e kanimenge: ‘Aven sa i više spremno!’<verse eid="LUK 14:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 14:18" />Ama sarine jekh palo jekh počminge te vakeren deka našti te aven. O prvo phengja: ‘Kingjum niva i trebela te džav te dikhav la. Molinava tut, vaker e gospodareske deka našti te avav.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 14:19" />O dujto phengja: ‘Samo so kingjum deš guruva i džava te proverinav sar randena ki niva. Molinava tut, vaker e gospodareske deka našti te avav.’<verse eid="LUK 14:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 14:20" />O trito phengja: ‘Samo so ženingjum man i adaleske našti te avav.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 14:21" />I o sluga irangja pe hem vakergja sa adava pe gospodareske. Togaš o gospodari holangja hem phengja pe slugaske: ‘Iklov odma ko ulice e gradeskere hem ko ploštadija, i ana sa e čorolen, e sakaten, e korolen hem e bangen.’<verse eid="LUK 14:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 14:22" />Koga o sluga kergja adava, vakergja: ‘Gospodare, kergjum agjar sa so phengjan mange, ama panda isi thana.’<verse eid="LUK 14:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 14:23" />I o gospodari vakergja leske: ‘Iklov avrijal taro gradi ko drumija hem ko ulice e gavengere hem čhiv e manušen te aven, te phergjol mo kher.’ <verse eid="LUK 14:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 14:24" />Vakerava tumenge nijekh taro kanime nane te tatinel taro mo hajbe. ”<verse eid="LUK 14:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Pharo te ove e Isuseskoro učeniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 14:25" />I but manuša džana sine e Isuseja. Ov irangja pe ki lende hem phengja: <verse eid="LUK 14:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 14:26" />“Ako nekoj mangela te ovel mo učeniko, trebela te mangel man but poviše taro po dad, tari pi daj, tari pi romni, taro pe čhave, taro pe phrajla, taro pe phenja hem taro po životo. Ako ov na kergja agjar, našti te ovel mo učeniko. <verse eid="LUK 14:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 14:27" />Koj na phiravela po krsto hem na džala pala mande, našti te ovel mo učeniko.<verse eid="LUK 14:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 14:28" />Ako nekoj tumendar mangela te zidinel kula, nane li prvo angleder te bešel hem te računinel hem te dikhel kozom ka astarel le, hem dali isi le dovolno pare te završinel la? <verse eid="LUK 14:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 14:29" />Soske ako čhigja o temejla a na ačhola le pare te završinel dži ko krajo, sarinen so ka dikhen adava ka asan leske, <verse eid="LUK 14:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 14:30" />vakerindor: ‘Akava manuš počmingja te zidinel, a našti te završinel la!’<verse eid="LUK 14:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 14:31" />Ili te vakerav deka jekh caro spreminela pe ko mariba javere caroja, nane li prvo angleder te bešel hem te razmislinel dali šaj deše iljadencar te marel pe adaleja so avela protiv leste biše iljadencar? <verse eid="LUK 14:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 14:32" />Ako našti, ka bičhavel pe manušen ko adava caro, panda duraldan sar na alo po paše, te rodel mir. <verse eid="LUK 14:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 14:33" />Isto agjar, nijekh tumendar so na mukhela sa so isi le, našti te ovel mo učeniko.”<verse eid="LUK 14:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O bi londalo lon</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 14:34" />Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “O lon tano šukar, ama ako o lon našagja po vkus, soleja ka iranel pe leskoro vkus? <verse eid="LUK 14:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 14:35" />Više ništoske nane šukar, ni baši phuv ni bašo gjubre, nego ka frdel pe.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 14:35">Kas isi kana, neka šunel.”<verse eid="LUK 14:35" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 14" />
  <chapter number="15" style="c" sid="LUK 15" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo našavdo bakhro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 15:1" />But danočnikija hem javera grešnikija khedinge pe uza ko Isus te šunen le. <verse eid="LUK 15:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 15:2" />A o fariseja hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere počminge te brborinen maškar peste: “Akava priminela ki peste e grešnikon hem hala lencar.”<verse eid="LUK 15:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 15:3" />I adaleske o Isus vakergja lenge akaja parabola: <verse eid="LUK 15:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 15:4" />“Ako nekas tumendar isi le šel bakhre i jekh lendar našavdilo, nane li te mukhel e enjavardešu enjen ki niva hem te džal te rodel adale bakhre sa dži kote na arakhela le. <verse eid="LUK 15:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 15:5" />Koga ka arakhel le, ka radujnel pe, ka čhivel le ko pike <verse eid="LUK 15:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 15:6" />hem ka legarel le khere. I ka vikinel pe amalen hem pe komšijen ki peste hem ka vakerel lenge: ‘Radujnen tumen mancar! Arakhlum me našavde bakhre.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 15:7" />Vakerava tumenge deka agjar pobari radost ko nebo ka ovel bašo jekh grešniko koga ka pokajnel pe, nego bašo enjavardešu enja pravednikija so na trebela lenge pokajanie.”<verse eid="LUK 15:7" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola baši srebreno para</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 15:8" />O Isus phengja lenge akava da: “Ili ako nesavi romni isi la deš srebrena pare i jekh lendar našavela, nane li te tharel o svetlo hem te šulavel o kher hem šukar te rodel i srebreno para sa dži kote na arakhela la. <verse eid="LUK 15:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 15:9" />I koga ka arakhel la, ka vikinel pe amalinkjen hem pe komšikjen ki peste hem ka phenel lenge: ‘Radujnen tumen mancar! Arakhlum i srebreno para so našagjum.’ <verse eid="LUK 15:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 15:10" />Isto agjar, vakerava tumenge, asavki radost isi maškar o angejla e Devleskere bašo jekh grešniko so pokajnela pe.”<verse eid="LUK 15:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo našavdo čhavo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 15:11" />O Isus phengja: “Jekh manuš sine le duj čhave. <verse eid="LUK 15:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 15:12" />O potikno čhavo phengja pe dadeske: ‘Mo dad, de man više mo delo taro to barvalipe so pripadinela mange.’ I o dad delingja lenge po barvalipe.<verse eid="LUK 15:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 15:13" />Palo nekozom dive o potikno čhavo khedingja sa so sine le, gelo ko duripe hem adathe trošingja sa po barvalipe živindor rumimo životo. <verse eid="LUK 15:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 15:14" />Koga trošingja sa pe pare, ulo baro bokhalipe ki adaja phuv i togaš le na sine le so te hal. <verse eid="LUK 15:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 15:15" />I gelo te kerel buti ko jekh manuš so živinela sine adathe. Adava manuš bičhalgja le ko pe nive te arakhel e balen. <verse eid="LUK 15:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 15:16" />O čhavo doborom sine bokhalo so mangela sine te hal adava so hana o bale, ama nikoj na dengja le ni adava da.<verse eid="LUK 15:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 15:17" />Koga osvestingja pe, vakergja ki peste: ‘Me dadeskere rabotnikija isi len poviše hajbaske, a me akate merava bokhatar! <verse eid="LUK 15:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 15:18" />Ka uštav hem ka iranav man ko mo dad hem ka phenav leske: “Mo dad, grešingjum anglo Devel hem angla tute! <verse eid="LUK 15:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 15:19" />Na zaslužinava te vakerav deka sijum to čhavo. Primin man sar jekh rabotniko te kerav buti ki tute.”’<verse eid="LUK 15:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 15:20" />I uštilo hem gelo ko po dad. Ama panda duraldan leskoro dad dikhla le sar avela, pelo leske žal, prastandilo ko po čhavo, gušingja le hem čumingja le. <verse eid="LUK 15:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 15:21" />Togaš o čhavo vakergja: ‘Mo dad, grešingjum anglo Devel hem angla tute! Na zaslužinava te vakerav deka sijum to čhavo.’<verse eid="LUK 15:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 15:22" />Ama o dad vakergja pe slugenge: ‘Sigate! Anen leske o najšužo šej hem uraven le! Čhiven leske i angrustik ko naj hem o sandale ko pre! <verse eid="LUK 15:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 15:23" />Anen o najšužo telco hem čhinen le, te ha hem te veselina amen, <verse eid="LUK 15:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 15:24" />soske akava mo čhavo sine mulo, a akana tano dživdo, našavdo sine, a akana tano arakhlo.’ I počminge te veselinen pe.<verse eid="LUK 15:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 15:25" />A ko adava momenti leskoro pobaro čhavo sine ki niva. I ko iranibe, koga alo paše uzo kher, šungja bašalibe hem khelibe. <verse eid="LUK 15:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 15:26" />Togaš vikingja jekhe sluga hem pučlja le soj adava.<verse eid="LUK 15:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 15:27" />O sluga phengja leske: ‘To phral irangja pe khere hem to dad čhingja e najšuže telco, adaleske so dikhla le dživdo hem sasto.’<verse eid="LUK 15:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 15:28" />I o pobaro čhavo holangja hem na mangla te khuvel ko kher. Togaš iklilo leskoro dad hem molingja le te khuvel. <verse eid="LUK 15:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 15:29" />Ama ov odgovoringja pe dadeske: ‘Akje sa doborom berša sar robo poštojnava tut hem nikat na phagljum to lafi, a tu nikat na dengjan man ni tikni buzni te šaj me amalencar te veselina man. <verse eid="LUK 15:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 15:30" />Ama koga alo akava to čhavo so hala to barvalipe rumime džuvlencar, tu čhingjan leske e najšuže telco.’<verse eid="LUK 15:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 15:31" />A leskoro dad phengja leske: ‘Mo čhavo, tu sekat sijan mancar. I sa so isi man tano tlo. <verse eid="LUK 15:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 15:32" />Ama, amen mora sine te veselina amen hem te radujna amen soske akava, to phral, sine mulo, a akana tano dživdo; našavdo sine, a akana tano arakhlo!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 15:32" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 15" />
  <chapter number="16" style="c" sid="LUK 16" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo nepošteno upravniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 16:1" />O Isus phengja pe učenikonge: “Sine jekh barvalo manuš so sine le upravniko, so o barvalo manuš čhigja leske iftira deka hala leskoro barvalipe.<verse eid="LUK 16:1" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 16:2" />I o barvalo vikingja le hem pučlja le: ‘Soj akava so šunava baši tuke? Ane mange o spisako te dikhav sa so trošingjan. Tu našti više te kere buti sar upraviteli ki mande!’<verse eid="LUK 16:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 16:3" />A o upraviteli vakergja ki peste: ‘So te kerav akana koga mo gospodari ka brkinel man tari buti? Na sijum doborom zoralo te randav, a ladžava te mangav mange. <verse eid="LUK 16:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 16:4" />Džanava so te kerav te šaj priminena man o manuša pe kherende, koga ka ovav brkimo tari akaja buti.’<verse eid="LUK 16:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 16:5" />I vikingja sa e manušen so dužinena sine leskere gospodareskere, i pučlja e prvone: ‘Kozom dužineja me gospodareske?’<verse eid="LUK 16:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 16:6" />Ov odgovoringja: ‘Šel bure ujleja.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:6">Togaš o upravniko phengja: ‘Sigate le to lil kaj so pišineja hem pišin pinda deka dužineja.’<verse eid="LUK 16:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 16:7" />Palo adava pučlja e dujtone: ‘Kozom dužineja me gospodareske?’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Ov odgovoringja: ‘Šel bure giv.’</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 16:7">Leske da phengja: ‘Le to lil kaj so pišineja hem pišin oftovardeš deka dužineja.’<verse eid="LUK 16:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 16:8" />I o Gospodari falingja pe nepošteno upravniko so sine agjar džando. Adaleske so o manuša akale svetoskere tane podžande ko pe dejla taro okola soj tane sar lende, nego o manuša e svetlinakere. <verse eid="LUK 16:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 16:9" />Vakerava tumenge: keren tumenge amala adaleja so ka pomožinen len tumare barvalipaja, te šaj koga ka nakhel adava barvalipe, te oven primime ko večna khera.<verse eid="LUK 16:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 16:10" />Koj tano verno ko but hari, ov tano verno ko but, a koj nane pošteno ko but hari, nane pošteno ko but da. <verse eid="LUK 16:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 16:11" />Ako na sijen sine verno ko barvalipe e svetoskoro, koj ka mukhel tumenge ko vasta o čačutno barvalipe? <verse eid="LUK 16:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 16:12" />Ako na sijen sine verna ko tugjo barvalipe, koj ka del tumen tumaro barvalipe?<verse eid="LUK 16:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 16:13" />Nijekh sluga našti te služinel duje gospodarenge. Ili jekhe ka mrzinel, a okole ka mangel, ili jekheske ka ovel poslušno, a e dujtone nane te podnesinel. Našti služinena hem e Devleske hem e parenge.”<verse eid="LUK 16:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 16:14" />Togaš o fariseja so mangena sine o pare, šunge sa akava so phengja o Isus hem asandile leske.<verse eid="LUK 16:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 16:15" />A o Isus vakergja lenge: “Tumen sijen adala so kerena tumen pravedna anglo o manuša, ama o Devel džanela tumare vile. Okova soj but vredno e manušenge, adavaj gadno anglo Devel.”<verse eid="LUK 16:15" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Sveta Lila hem o carstvo e Devleskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 16:16" />Togaš o Isus vakergja: “O Zakoni hem o Lila e Prorokongere sikavena sine e manušen dži ko ajbe e Jovaneskoro, a taro adava dive propovedinela pe o evangelije bašo carstvo e Devleskoro hem sekoj silaja khuvela ki leste. <verse eid="LUK 16:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 16:17" />Polokhe o nebo hem i phuv te našavgjoven, nego jekh tikni bukva taro Zakoni te preperel.<verse eid="LUK 16:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 16:18" />Koj ka mukhel pe romna hem ka lel javera romnake, ov kerela preljuba upro late. Hem koj ka lel mukhle romna taro rom, ov da kerela preljuba.”<verse eid="LUK 16:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo barvalo manuš hem o Lazar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 16:19" />O Isus vakergja: “Sine jekh barvalo manuš so uravela pe sine ko najšuže šeja hem sekova dive živinela sine ko luksuz. <verse eid="LUK 16:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 16:20" />Angli leskiri porta pašlola sine jekh čorolo manuš so celo leskoro telo sine ko rane, so leskoro anav sine Lazar. <verse eid="LUK 16:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 16:21" />Ov but mangela sine te hal adava so perela sine tari sofra e barvaleskiri. Dži o džukela avena sine hem ližinena sine leskere rane.<verse eid="LUK 16:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 16:22" />Koga mulo o čorolo, o angejla legarge le e Avraameske ki angali. I o barvalo da mulo hem sine parumo. <verse eid="LUK 16:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 16:23" />Ko than e mulengoro, ko bare muke, o barvalo dikhla upre hem duraldan dikhla e Avraame hem e Lazare leske ki angali. <verse eid="LUK 16:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 16:24" />Togaš vikingja: ‘Dade Avraame, žalin man hem bičhal e Lazare te sapankerel samo hari po naj ko pani hem te šudrarel mi čhib, soske but mučinava man ki akaja jag.’<verse eid="LUK 16:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 16:25" />Ama o Avraam odgovoringja: ‘Mo čhavo, setin tut deka primingjan to šukaripe dži kote sijan sine dživdo, a o Lazar po lošnipe. A akana o Lazar utešinela pe, a tu mučineja tut. <verse eid="LUK 16:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 16:26" />Uza ko sa adava, isi maškar amende hem tumende hor dupka, i te mangla nekoj te nakhel akatar tumende ili adathar akate, našti te nakhel.’<verse eid="LUK 16:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 16:27" />A o barvalo manuš phengja: ‘Togaš molinava tut, dade Avraam, bičhal e Lazare me dadeske ko kher. <verse eid="LUK 16:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 16:28" />Adaleske so adathe isi man pandž phrajla. Neka opomeninel len o Lazar te na aven ola da ko akava than e mukjengoro.’<verse eid="LUK 16:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 16:29" />O Avraam odgovoringja: ‘Len isi len o Zakoni e Mojsijaskoro hem o Lil e Prorokongoro. Neka šunen len.’<verse eid="LUK 16:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 16:30" />A o barvalo vakergja: ‘Nane adava dovolno, dade Avraam! Nego ako nekoj taro mule gelo ki lende, ola ka pokajnen pe.’<verse eid="LUK 16:30" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 16:31" />O Avraam phengja leske: ‘Ako na šunge adava so pišingja o Mojsej hem o prorokija, nane ni te šunen ako nekoj uštilo taro mule.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 16:31" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 16" />
  <chapter number="17" style="c" sid="LUK 17" />
  <para style="s1">Bašo grevo hem baši vera</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 17:1" />O Isus phengja pe učenikonge: “O iskušenie mora te avel, ama pharo okoleske so preku leste avela. <verse eid="LUK 17:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 17:2" />Pošukar ka ovel leske te phanden le ki men baro bar hem te ovel frdimo ko more, nego te čhivel jekh akale tikne čhavendar te perel ko grevo. <verse eid="LUK 17:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 17:3" />Arakhen tumen! Ako to phral grešinela tuke, opomenin le, i te pokajngja pe, oprostin leske. <verse eid="LUK 17:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 17:4" />Ako grešingja tuke efta puti ko dive hem efta puti avela ki tute hem vakerela tuke: ‘Kajnava man,’ oprostin leske.”<verse eid="LUK 17:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 17:5" />O apostojla vakerge e Gospodareske e Isuseske: “Bajlar amari vera!”<verse eid="LUK 17:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 17:6" />A o Gospodari odgovoringja: “Ako isi tumen vera sar o tikno sinapovo zrno, ka phenen sine akale kašteske: ‘Ikal tut taro koreno hem sadin tut ko more!’ I ov ka šunel tumen.<verse eid="LUK 17:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 17:7" />Ako nekas tumendar isi le sluga so randela hem arakhela e bakhren, koga ov ka iranela pe tari niva koj tumendar ka vakerel leske: ‘Sigjar ava akate hem beš te ha maro’? <verse eid="LUK 17:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 17:8" />Nane li prvo te phene leske: ‘Ker mange te hav, spremin tut hem služin mange dži kote hava hem pijava, a palo adava tu šaj te ha hem te pije’? <verse eid="LUK 17:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 17:9" />Trebela li o gospodari te blagodarinel e slugaske so kergja sa adava so sine leske naredimo? Na. <verse eid="LUK 17:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 17:10" />Agjar tumen da, koga kerena sa so naredinela tumenge o Devel, vakeren: ‘Amen sijem sluge so na trebela te blagodarinel pe! Amen samo keraja amari buti!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 17:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela deše leprozno manušen</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 17:11" />Koga o Isus gelo ko Erusalim, nakhla maškar i granica tari Samarija hem tari Galileja. <verse eid="LUK 17:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 17:12" />Dži kote khuvela sine ko jekh gav, ki leste ale deš leprozna manuša so terdile podur lestar <verse eid="LUK 17:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 17:13" />hem vikinge sa pe glasoja: “Isuse, Učitele, ov milostlivo upra amende!”<verse eid="LUK 17:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 17:14" />Koga dikhla len o Isus, vakergja lenge: “Džan hem sikaven tumen e sveštenikonge!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:14">I dži kote džana sine ko drumo, sine sasljarde tari lepra.<verse eid="LUK 17:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 17:15" />I jekh lendar koga dikhla deka saslilo, irangja pe ko Isus slavindor e Devle sa pe glasoja. <verse eid="LUK 17:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 17:16" />Pelo anglo leskere pre mujeja dži ki phuv hem blagodaringja leske. A ov sine Samarijanco.<verse eid="LUK 17:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 17:17" />Togaš o Isus pučlja le: “Na saslilen li so deš džene? Kaj tane okola enja? <verse eid="LUK 17:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 17:18" />Nijekh li lendar na irangja pe te slavinel e Devle, osven akava manuš so nane Evrejco?”<verse eid="LUK 17:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 17:19" />I vakergja e manušeske: “Ušti hem dža! Ti vera sasljargja tut!”<verse eid="LUK 17:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O ajbe taro carstvo e Devleskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 17:20" />Jekh dive o fariseja pučle e Isuse koga ka avel o carstvo e Devleskoro. A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “O carstvo e Devleskoro nane nešto so šaj te dikhen le. <verse eid="LUK 17:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 17:21" />Ni nane sar te phenel pe: ‘Akje akate tano!’ ili ‘Akje okote tano!’ Adaleske so o carstvo e Devleskoro tano maškar tumende!”<verse eid="LUK 17:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 17:22" />Togaš phengja pe učenikonge: “Avela o vreme koga ka mangen te dikhen samo jekh dive taro o Čhavo Manušeskoro, ama nane te dikhen le. <verse eid="LUK 17:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 17:23" />O manuša ka vakeren tumenge: ‘Akje akate tano!’ ili ‘Akje okote tano!’ Ama ma džan adathe hem ma prastan pali lende! <verse eid="LUK 17:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 17:24" />Adaleske so o ajbe taro o Čhavo Manušeskoro ko leskoro dive ka ovel sar koga o gromi so khuvela hem svetinela o nebo taro jekh krajo dži ko javer. <verse eid="LUK 17:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 17:25" />Ama prvo mora but te cidel hem te ovel otfrlimo tari akaja generacija.<verse eid="LUK 17:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 17:26" />Sar so sine ko vreme e Noeskoro, agjar ka ovel hem koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel. <verse eid="LUK 17:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 17:27" />O manuša hana sine hem pijena, lena pe sine maškar peste, sa dži ko adava dive koga o Noe khugja ko brodi. Togaš ali i poplava hem uništingja sarinen.<verse eid="LUK 17:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 17:28" />Isto agjar sine ko vreme e Loteskoro. O manuša hana sine hem pijena, kinena sine hem biknena, sadinena sine hem kerena khera. <verse eid="LUK 17:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 17:29" />Ama ko dive koga o Lot iklilo taro Sodom, taro nebo peli jag hem sulfur hem uništingja sarinen.<verse eid="LUK 17:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 17:30" />Agjar ka ovel ko dive koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka pojavinel pe. <verse eid="LUK 17:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 17:31" />Ko adava dive koj ka ovel ko krovi, a leskere bukja tane ko kher, ma te hulel te lel len. Isto agjar, koj ka ovel ki niva, ma te iranel pe khere palo pe bukja. <verse eid="LUK 17:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 17:32" />Setinen tumen so ulo e Loteskere romnaja! <verse eid="LUK 17:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 17:33" />Soske koj mangela te spasinel po životo, ka našavel le, a koj mangela te našavel po životo, ka spasinel le. <verse eid="LUK 17:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 17:34" />Vakerava tumenge: ki adaja rat duj džene ka pašlon ko jekh kreveti; jekh ka ovel lelo, a o dujto ka ovel mukhlo. <verse eid="LUK 17:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 17:35" />Duj džuvla ka melinen giv; jekh ka ovel leli, a i dujto ka ovel mukhli. <verse eid="LUK 17:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 17:36" />[Duj manuša ka oven ki niva; jekh ka ovel lelo, a o dujto ka ovel mukhlo.]”<verse eid="LUK 17:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 17:37" />I ola pučle e Isuse: “Kaj, Gospode?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 17:37">A ov odgovoringja lenge: “Kaj soj isi mulo telo, adathe khedena pe o mršojadcija.”<verse eid="LUK 17:37" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 17" />
  <chapter number="18" style="c" sid="LUK 18" />
  <para style="s1">I parabola baši udovica hem o sudija</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 18:1" />Togaš o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge jekh parabola deka sekat trebela te molinen pe hem te na otkažinen pe. <verse eid="LUK 18:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 18:2" />I ov vakergja: “Ko jekh gradi sine jekh sudija so na darala sine e Devlestar, ni na sekirinela pe sine so mislinena o manuša. <verse eid="LUK 18:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 18:3" />A ko adava gradi sine jekh udovica so sekat avela sine ki leste hem molinela le sine: ‘Ana pravda anglo okova so tužinela man.’ <verse eid="LUK 18:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 18:4" />Ov nesavo vreme na mangela sine te pomožinel la. Ama palo nesavo vreme vakergja ki peste: ‘Iako na darava taro Devel, ni na sekirinava man so mislinena o manuša, <verse eid="LUK 18:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 18:5" />ka anav lake pravda, te na avel više te dosadinel man, adaleske so sekat akaja udovica na mukhela man rahati!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 18:6" />Togaš o Gospodari o Isus phengja: “Šunen šukar so vakergja o nepravedno sudija! <verse eid="LUK 18:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 18:7" />Nane li o Devel te anel pravda pe birimenge, so molinena pe ki leste dive rat? Ov ka mukhel li len te adžikeren? <verse eid="LUK 18:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 18:8" />Vakerava tumenge, ov ka dikhel sigate te anel lenge i pravda. Ama koga o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka avel, dali ka arakhel vera maškar o manuša ki phuv?”<verse eid="LUK 18:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo o farisejco hem o danočniko</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 18:9" />Togaš o Isus vakergja akaja parabola okolenge so mislinena sine deka tane pravedna, a javeren dikhena sine sar potele pumendar: <verse eid="LUK 18:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 18:10" />“Duj manuša khuge ko Hrami te molinen pe, jekh farisejco, a o dujto danočniko. <verse eid="LUK 18:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 18:11" />O farisejco terdilo hem molingja pe ki peste agjar: ‘Devla, ov sasto so na sijum sar javera manuša: čora, nepravednikija, preljubnikija ili sar akava danočniko. <verse eid="LUK 18:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 18:12" />Postinava duj puti ko kurko hem dava desetok taro sa so isi man.’<verse eid="LUK 18:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 18:13" />A o danočniko tergjola sine duraldan hem na mangela sine ni te dikhel ko nebo, nego khuvela pe sine ko kolin hem vakerela sine: ‘Devla, ov milostlivo prema mande, e grešnikoske!’<verse eid="LUK 18:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 18:14" />Vakerava tumenge deka akava danočniko džala peske khere opravdimo anglo Devel, a na o farisejco! Soske sekoj so vazdela pe ka ovel ponižimo, a okova so ponižinela pe ka ovel vazdimo.”<verse eid="LUK 18:14" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus blagoslovinela e tikne čhaven</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 18:15" />O manuša anena sine pe tikne čhaven anglo Isus te čhivel pe vasta upro lende hem te blagoslovinel len. I koga o učenikija dikhle adava, zaptinge len.<verse eid="LUK 18:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 18:16" />Ama o Isus vikingja len ki peste hem phengja: “Mukhen e tikne čhaven te aven ki mande hem ma zaptinen len, soske asavkjenge pripadinela o carstvo e Devleskoro! <verse eid="LUK 18:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 18:17" />Čače phenava tumenge, koj na priminela o carstvo e Devleskoro sar tikno čhavo, nane te khuvel ki leste.”<verse eid="LUK 18:17" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o barvalo manuš</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 18:18" />Jekh upravniko, pučlja e Isuse: “Šukar učitele, so mora te kerav te šaj te dobinav o večno životo?”<verse eid="LUK 18:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 18:19" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Soske vakereja mange deka sijum šukar? Nikoj nane šukar osven jekh Devel. <verse eid="LUK 18:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 18:20" />O zapovedija džaneja: ‘Ma ker preljuba, ma mudar, ma čor, ma svedočin hovajbe, poštojn te dade hem te daja.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 18:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 18:21" />Togaš o upravniko phengja leske: “Sa adava pazingjum taro mo tiknipe.”<verse eid="LUK 18:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 18:22" />Koga šungja akava o Isus phengja leske: “Panda jekh falinela tuke. Dža bikin sa so isi tut hem delin o pare e čorolenge, i ka ovel tut barvalipe upre ko nebo. Togaš ava hem phir pala mande.”<verse eid="LUK 18:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 18:23" />Koga šungja adava o upravniko, but razočaringja pe, soske sine le baro barvalipe.<verse eid="LUK 18:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 18:24" />O Isus dikhla deka razočarisalilo i phengja: “Kozom tano pharo e barvalenge te khuven ko carstvo e Devleskoro! <verse eid="LUK 18:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 18:25" />Čače, polokhe ka ovel e kamilake te nakhel maškar o kan e suvijakoro, nego e barvaleske te khuvel ko carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 18:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 18:26" />A o manuša so šunge akava pučle: “Togaš, koj šaj te spasinel pe?”<verse eid="LUK 18:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 18:27" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Akavaj nešto so o manuša našti te keren, ama o Devel šaj kerela sa.”<verse eid="LUK 18:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 18:28" />O Petar vakergja leske: “Akje, amen mukhlem sa hem alem pala tute.”<verse eid="LUK 18:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 18:29" />A o Isus phengja: “Čače phenava tumenge, sekoj so ka mukhel po kher, ili pe romna, ili pe phralen, ili pe dade hem pe daja ili pe čhaven bašo carstvo e Devleskoro, <verse eid="LUK 18:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 18:30" />ka dobinel poviše adalestar so mukhla ko akava sveto hem ka dobinel o večno životo ko sveto so avela.”<verse eid="LUK 18:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus trito puti vakerela bašo po meribe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 18:31" />O Isus cidingja ki strana e dešuduje učenikon hem phengja lenge: “Akje, džaja ko Erusalim. Adathe ka phergjol sa soj pišimo taro prorokija bašo o Čhavo Manušeskoro. <verse eid="LUK 18:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 18:32" />Ka ovel predajmo e manušenge so nane Evreja. Ola ka asan leske, ka uvredžinen le hem ka čhungaren le, <verse eid="LUK 18:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 18:33" />ka kamšikujnen le hem ka mudaren le, ama ko trito dive ka uštel taro mule!”<verse eid="LUK 18:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 18:34" />O učenikija ništo na svatinge adalestar so o Isus vakergja lenge. O značenje adale lafengoro sine garavdo lendar, a ola na svatinge baši so kerela pe lafi.<verse eid="LUK 18:34" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sasljarela e korole manuše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 18:35" />Koga o Isus alo paše uza ko Erihon, ko drumo bešela sine jekh korolo manuš so mangela peske sine. <verse eid="LUK 18:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 18:36" />Koga šungja sar o narodo nakhena, pučlja soj adava. <verse eid="LUK 18:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 18:37" />I vakerge leske: “O Isus taro Nazaret nakhela.”<verse eid="LUK 18:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 18:38" />Togaš o korolo manuš vikingja: “Isuse, Čhavo e Davideskoro, ov milostlivo prema mande!”<verse eid="LUK 18:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 18:39" />A okola so phirena sine anglo Isus zaptinena le sine te na vikinel, ama ov poviše vikinela sine: “Čhavo e Davideskoro, ov milostlivo prema mande!”<verse eid="LUK 18:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 18:40" />O Isus ačhilo hem zapovedingja te anen le ki leste e korole manuše. Koga ange le uza leste, o Isus pučlja le: <verse eid="LUK 18:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 18:41" />“So mangeja te kerav tuke?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 18:41">O korolo manuš odgovoringja: “Gospode, mangava te dikhav.”<verse eid="LUK 18:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 18:42" />I o Isus vakergja leske: “Dikh! Ti vera sasljargja tut.”<verse eid="LUK 18:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 18:43" />O manuš odma dikhla hem gelo palo Isus, slavindor e Devle. Koga sa o manuša dikhle adava, slavinge e Devle.<verse eid="LUK 18:43" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 18" />
  <chapter number="19" style="c" sid="LUK 19" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus hem o Zahej</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 19:1" />O Isus khugja ko gradi Erihon. I dži kote nakhela sine maškar o gradi, <verse eid="LUK 19:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 19:2" />alo jekh manuš so vikinela pe Zahej so sine jekh taro glavna danočnikija hem sine but barvalo. <verse eid="LUK 19:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 19:3" />Ov mangela sine te dikhel koj tano Isus, ama našti sine te dikhel le tari gužva, soske ov sine harno. <verse eid="LUK 19:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 19:4" />Adaleske prastandilo anglal hem uklingja ko kaš e smokvakoro te šaj te dikhel e Isuse, adaleske so džangja deka trebela te nakhel adathar.<verse eid="LUK 19:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 19:5" />A koga o Isus resla adathe, dikhla upre hem phengja leske: “Zahej, huli odma tele! Avdive mora te ovav ko to kher.”<verse eid="LUK 19:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 19:6" />I o Zahej odma hulilo tele hem radosno primingja le ko po kher.<verse eid="LUK 19:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 19:7" />Sa o manuša dikhle adava i počminge te brborinen maškar peste: “Gelo gosti ko grešniko te bešel.”<verse eid="LUK 19:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 19:8" />Ama o Zahej uštilo hem phengja e Gospodareske e Isuseske: “Akje, Gospode, ekvaš taro mo barvalipe ka dav le e čorolenge hem ako čorgjum nekastar nešto, ka iranav leske štar puti poviše.”<verse eid="LUK 19:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 19:9" />A o Isus vakergja leske: “Avdive alo o spasenije ko akava kher! Adaleske so akava da manuš tano taro seme e Avraameskoro. <verse eid="LUK 19:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 19:10" />Soske o Čhavo Manušeskoro alo te rodel hem te spasinel adale soj tano našavdo!”<verse eid="LUK 19:10" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo doverimo srebro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 19:11" />Dži kote o manuša šunena sine e Isuse, ov vakergja lenge akaja da parabola, soske sine paše uza ko Erusalim, a o manuša mislinge deka o carstvo e Devleskoro ka pojavinel pe taro jekh puti.<verse eid="LUK 19:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 19:12" />I o Isus vakergja: “Jekh manuš tari prešundi familija angleder te džal ko duripe te čhiven le bašo caro hem palo adava te iranel pe khere, <verse eid="LUK 19:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 19:13" />vikingja pe deše slugjen, dengja len po ekvaš kilo srebro hem vakergja lenge: ‘Keren buti akalencar sa dži kote na iranava man.’ I gelo ko drumo.<verse eid="LUK 19:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 19:14" />A o manuša tari leskiri phuv mrzinena le sine, i bičhalge pumare manušen adathe kaj so ov gelo te phenen: ‘Na mangaja akale manuše te ovel amenge caro.’<verse eid="LUK 19:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 19:15" />Koga adava manuš ulo caro, irangja pe khere hem vikingja pe slugjen kaske so dengja o pare te dikhel kozom zarabotinge lencar.<verse eid="LUK 19:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 19:16" />O prvo sluga alo hem phengja: ‘Gospodare, taro adava so dengjan man, kergjum deš puti poviše.’<verse eid="LUK 19:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 19:17" />Leskoro gospodari odgovoringja: ‘But šukar! Tu sijan šukar sluga. Adaleske so sijan sine verno ko hari, ka čhivav tut te upravine upro deš gradija.’<verse eid="LUK 19:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 19:18" />O dujto sluga alo hem phengja: ‘Gospodare, taro adava so dengjan man, kergjum pandž puti poviše.’<verse eid="LUK 19:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 19:19" />Leskoro gospodari odgovoringja: ‘Ka čhivav tut te upravine upro pandž gradija.’<verse eid="LUK 19:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 19:20" />A o trito sluga alo hem phengja: ‘Gospodare, akje to srebro so dengjan man. Pakjargjum le ko mendili hem garagjum le. <verse eid="LUK 19:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 19:21" />Kergjum agjar soske darandilum tutar, adaleske so sijan strogo manuš. Leja okova so nane tlo hem khedeja kaj so na sadingjan.’<verse eid="LUK 19:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 19:22" />Leskoro gospodari odgovoringja: ‘Tu sijan lošno sluga! Palo te lafija ka sudinav tut. Tu džangjan deka sijum strogo manuš hem lava okova so nane mlo hem khedava kaj so na sadingjum, <verse eid="LUK 19:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 19:23" />soske togaš na čhigjan me pare ki banka, te šaj koga ka iranav man te lav me pare duplo?’<verse eid="LUK 19:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 19:24" />Togaš phengja okolenge so tergjona sine uza leste: ‘Len akale slugastar o srebro hem den le okoleske kas so isi deš puti poviše!’<verse eid="LUK 19:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 19:25" />A ola phenge leske: ‘Ama gospodare, le više isi le pandž kile srebro.’<verse eid="LUK 19:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 19:26" />I o gospodari odgovoringja: ‘Vakerava tumenge deka kas isi ka del pe leske panda poviše, a okole kas nane ka lel pe lestar adava da so isi le. <verse eid="LUK 19:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 19:27" />Ama okola me dušmajna so na mangle te ovav lengoro caro, anen len akate hem čhinen len angla mande!’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:27" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus khuvela ko Erusalim sar caro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 19:28" />Koga o Isus vakergja lenge adava, prodolžingja pe drumoja ko Erusalim.<verse eid="LUK 19:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 19:29" />Togaš alo paše uza ko gava Vitfagija hem Vitanija uza ko rido so vikinela pe Maslinova Gora i bičhalgja duje učenikon <verse eid="LUK 19:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 19:30" />vakerindor: “Džan ko akava gav, soj angli tumende. I samo so ka khuven ki leste, ka arakhen terno her soj phandlo, so panda nijekh manuš na uklilo ki leste. Phraven le hem anen le akate. <verse eid="LUK 19:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 19:31" />I te pučlja tumen nekoj: ‘Soske phravena le?’, vakeren leske: ‘E Gospodareske trebela.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 19:32" />Ola gele hem arakhle agjar sar so phengja lenge o Isus.<verse eid="LUK 19:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 19:33" />I dži kote phravena sine e terne here, o manuša kaskoro sine o terno her, pučle len: “Soske phravena le?”<verse eid="LUK 19:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 19:34" />A ola odgovoringe: “E Gospodareske trebela.” <verse eid="LUK 19:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 19:35" />Togaš ange le anglo Isus, i čhige pe šeja upro terno her hem uklargje e Isuse upro leste. <verse eid="LUK 19:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 19:36" />Dži kote džala sine o Isus e hereja, o manuša bujlarena sine pumare šeja ko drumo.<verse eid="LUK 19:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 19:37" />A koga alo paše uza ko than kote so hulela pe sine tari Maslinovo Gora, sa o učenikija so sine adathe počminge radosno hem sa pe glasoja te slavinen e Devle bašo sa o čudija so dikhle, <verse eid="LUK 19:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 19:38" />vakerindor:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">“Blagoslovimo tano o Caro</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">so avela ko anav e Gospodareskoro!<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">19:38 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:26">Ps 118:26</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 19:38" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 19:38">Neka ovel mir ko nebo</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 19:38">hem slava e Devleske ko učipe!”<verse eid="LUK 19:38" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 19:39" />Togaš nesave fariseja, so sine maškar lende, vakerge e Isuseske: “Učitele, zaptin te učenikon te na vakeren adava.”<verse eid="LUK 19:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 19:40" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Vakerava tumenge, te kjutinge ola, o bara ka vikinen.”<verse eid="LUK 19:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus rovela bašo Erusalim</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 19:41" />Koga o Isus alo paše ko Erusalim hem dikhla o gradi, počmingja te rovel leske, <verse eid="LUK 19:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 19:42" />vakerindor: “Ah, te džane sine tu da avdive so anela tuke mir! Ama akana adava tano garavdo te jakhendar. <verse eid="LUK 19:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 19:43" />Ka aven dive koga o dušmajna ka uklen ko te zidija, ka opkolinen tut hem taro sa o strane ka steginen tut. <verse eid="LUK 19:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 19:44" />Ka uništinen hem tut hem te manušen so živinena adathe. Nane te mukhen bar upro bar, soske na pendžargjan o vreme koga o Devel alo te dikhel tut.”<verse eid="LUK 19:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus na mukhela te bikinel pe ko Hrami.</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 19:45" />Koga o Isus alo ko Erusalim, khugja ko dvoro e Hrameskoro hem počmingja te brkinel sa adalen so bikinena sine, <verse eid="LUK 19:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 19:46" />vakerindor: “Pišimo i: ‘Mo kher ka vikinel pe kher baši molitva’ a tumen kerge le than ‘kote so khedena pe o čora.’ ”<verse eid="LUK 19:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 19:47" />I sekova dive, o Isus sikavela sine e manušen ko dvoro e Hrameskoro. A o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere zaedno e Evrejengere starešinencar rodena sine sar te ovel mudardo o Isus, <verse eid="LUK 19:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 19:48" />ama na arakhle sar te keren adava, adaleske so sa o manuša šukar šunena sine leskoro učibe.<verse eid="LUK 19:48" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 19" />
  <chapter number="20" style="c" sid="LUK 20" />
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskiri vlast</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 20:1" />Jekh dive, dži kote o Isus sikavela sine e manušen ko dvoro e Hrameskoro hem propovedinela sine o evangelije, ale ki leste o prvosveštenikija, o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o starešine <verse eid="LUK 20:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 20:2" />hem pučle le: “Vaker amenge kotar tuke akava avtoriteti te kere akala bukja? Koj dengja tut pravo te kere akava?”<verse eid="LUK 20:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 20:3" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Ka pučav tumen me da nešto, hem odgovorinen mange: <verse eid="LUK 20:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 20:4" />Kotar e Jovaneske o avtoriteti te krstinel – taro Devel ili taro manuš?”<verse eid="LUK 20:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 20:5" />A ola počminge te pučen pe hem te keren lafi maškar peste: “Ako vakergjem: ‘Taro Devel,’ ka vakerel, ‘Soske na verujngjen le?’ <verse eid="LUK 20:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 20:6" />Ama ako vakergjem: ‘Taro manuš’, sa o manuša ka mudaren amen barencar, soske sarine tane sigurna deka o Jovan sine proroko.”<verse eid="LUK 20:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 20:7" />I odgovoringe e Isuseske: “Na džanaja koj dengja le avtoriteti.”<verse eid="LUK 20:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 20:8" />A o Isus phengja lenge: “Ni me da na phenava tumenge kotar mange pravo te kerav sa akava.”<verse eid="LUK 20:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I parabola bašo lošna lozajra</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 20:9" />Togaš o Isus vakergja e narodoske akaja parabola: “Jekh manuš sadingja drakha, dengja le ki kirija nesave lozarenge hem gelo ko drumo ko but vreme. <verse eid="LUK 20:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 20:10" />I koga alo vreme te kheden o drakha, bičhalgja e sluga ko lozajra te den le taro plodija e drakhakoro. Ama o lozajra marge le hem bičhalge le palal čuče vastencar. <verse eid="LUK 20:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 20:11" />Ov bičhalgja javere sluga, ama ola le da marge, ladžakerge le hem bičhalge le palal čuče vastencar. <verse eid="LUK 20:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 20:12" />Ov bičhalgja e trito da sluga ki lende, ola le da raninge le hem frdinge le avrik taro adava than.<verse eid="LUK 20:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 20:13" />Togaš o gazda e drakhengoro phengja: ‘So te kerav? Ka bičhavav me mangle čhave ki lende. Šaj ola ka poštojnen me čhave.’<verse eid="LUK 20:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 20:14" />Ama o lozajra koga dikhle leskere čhave, dogovoringe pe maškar peste: ‘Akavaj o nasledniko. Ajde te mudara le hem leskoro nasledstvo ka ačhol amenge.’ <verse eid="LUK 20:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 20:15" />I frdinge le avrik taro adava than hem mudarge le.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:15">So ka kerel o gazda e drakhengoro adale lozarenge? <verse eid="LUK 20:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 20:16" />Ka avel hem ka mudarel adale lozaren, a o drakha ka del len javerenge.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:16">Adala so šunge akaja parabola, vakerge: “Ma te del o Devel adava te ovel!”<verse eid="LUK 20:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 20:17" />O Isus dikhla ki lende hem phengja: “A so značinela adava soj pišimo ko Sveto Lil:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:17" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:17">‘O bar so sine frdimo taro zidajra</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:17">adava bar ulo najvažno bar e khereskoro’? <note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:17 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">khereskoro </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 118:22">Ps 118:22</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:17" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 20:18" />Sekoj so ka perel ko akava bar ka ovel phago ko kotora, a upra kaste ka perel adava bar ka ovel mečimo.”<verse eid="LUK 20:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 20:19" />A o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o prvosveštenikija rodena sine odma te astaren e Isuse, adaleske so džanena sine deka akaja parabola vakergja lenge, ama darana sine taro narodo.<verse eid="LUK 20:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O platibe danok e Cezareske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 20:20" />A o učitejla e Zakoneskere hem o prvosveštenikija pratinena sine e Isuse. Bičhalge ki leste špijonen, so kerena pe sine iskrena, sar te astaren e Isuse ko lafi, te šaj te predajnen le ko upravniko e Rimeskoro te sudinel le.<verse eid="LUK 20:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 20:21" />I o špijojna pučle e Isuse: “Učitele, džanaja deka vakereja o čačipe hem na ikereja nikaskiri strana, soske na dikheja koj tano koj, nego čače sikaveja o drumo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 20:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 20:22" />Trebela li te da e Cezareske o danok ili na?”<verse eid="LUK 20:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 20:23" />A o Isus džangja deka tane hovavne, i phengja lenge: <verse eid="LUK 20:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 20:24" />“Sikav mange o dinari soleja platinena o danok. Kaskiri slika hem kaskoro anav tano ko dinari?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 20:24">A ola phenge: “E Cezareskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 20:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 20:25" />Togaš o Isus vakergja lenge: “Adava soj e Cezareskoro, den le e Cezareske, a adava soj e Devleskoro, den le e Devleske.”<verse eid="LUK 20:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 20:26" />Hem našti sine o špijojna te astaren e Isuse ko adava lafi so vakergja anglo narodo, i kjutinge adaleske so sine čudime taro leskoro odgovor.<verse eid="LUK 20:26" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo uštibe taro mule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 20:27" />I ale nesave taro sadukeja, so vakerena sine deka nane uštibe taro mule, i pučle e Isuse: <verse eid="LUK 20:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 20:28" />“Učitele, o Mojsej pišingja amenge, ako mulo jekh manuš hem mukhla pala peste romni bizo čhave, leskoro phral trebela te le pe bojra romnake, te šaj oj te bijanel čhave so ka ovel nasledniko e muleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 20:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 20:29" />Agjar sine efta phrajla. O prvo lela romni hem mulo, a pala peste na mukhla čhaven. <verse eid="LUK 20:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 20:30" />O dujto phral lela pe phraleskere romna, hem ov da mulo, a pala peste na mukhla čhaven. <verse eid="LUK 20:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 20:31" />Togaš o trito phral lela pe phraleskere romna, i agjar kerge sa o efta phrajla. I ki krajka nijekh taro efta phrajla na mukhle pala peste čhaven. <verse eid="LUK 20:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 20:32" />Ki krajka muli i romni da. <verse eid="LUK 20:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 20:33" />Kaskiri romni ka ovel oj, koga ka uštel pe taro mule, a sa o phrajla ikerge la?”<verse eid="LUK 20:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 20:34" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “O manuša taro akava sveto lena pe hem ženinena pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 20:35" />Ama okola so ka oven dostojna te dobinen okova sveto hem so ka oven vazdime taro mule, nane te len pe. <verse eid="LUK 20:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 20:36" />Adaleske so našti više te meren: soske ka oven sar angejla. Ola tane e Devleskere čhave, soske o Devel ka vazdel len taro mule. <verse eid="LUK 20:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 20:37" />A deka o mule uštena, sikavgja o Mojsej ko Sveto Lil so pišinela sine baši grmuška so thablola sine. Adathe bašo Gospodari phenela deka tano ‘Devel e Avraameskoro, e Isakoskoro hem e Jakoveskoro’ iako ola togaš sine mule.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:37 </char><char style="xq" closed="false">Jakoveskoro </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 3:6">Iz 3:6</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 20:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 20:38" />Ov nane Devel e mulengoro, nego e dživdengoro. Adaleske so ki leste sarine tane dživde.”<verse eid="LUK 20:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 20:39" />Nesave učitejla e Zakoneskere vakerge e Isuseske: “Učitele šukar vakergjan!”<verse eid="LUK 20:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 20:40" />Palo adava nikoj više na alo te pučel le.<verse eid="LUK 20:40" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O pučibe bašo Hristos</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 20:41" />Togaš o Isus pučlja okolen so šunena le sine: “Soske vakerena deka o Hristos tano čhavo e Davideskoro? <verse eid="LUK 20:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 20:42" />Koga korkori o David phenela ko lil taro Psalmija:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 20:42" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 20:42">‘O Gospodari phengja me Gospodareske:</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:42">Beš tari mi desno strana,<verse eid="LUK 20:42" /></para>
  <para style="q1">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 20:43" />sa dži kote na čhivava te dušmanen</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 20:43">telo te pre.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">20:43 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="PSA 110:1">Ps 110:1</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 20:43" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 20:44" />Ako o David vikingja le ‘Gospode’ sar šaj togaš o Hristos te ovel leskoro čhavo?”<verse eid="LUK 20:44" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Bašo učitejla e Zakoneskere</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 20:45" />Togaš anglo sa o manuša, o Isus vakergja pe učenikonge: <verse eid="LUK 20:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 20:46" />“Pazinen tumen taro učitejla e Zakoneskere! Ola mangena te phiren uravde ko skupa šeja, hem te pozdravinen len o manuša ko pazari. Mangena te bešen ko prva thana ko sinagoge hem ko najšukar thana ko hajbe pijbe. <verse eid="LUK 20:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 20:47" />Hana o barvalipe e udovicengoro hem molinena pe bare molitve te sikaven pe deka tane pobožna. Akala manuša ka oven but posilno kaznime.”<verse eid="LUK 20:47" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 20" />
  <chapter number="21" style="c" sid="LUK 21" />
  <para style="s1">I čoroli udovica dengja najviše</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 21:1" />Koga o Isus sine ko Hrami, vazdingja po šero hem dikhla e barvalen sar mukhena pare ki kasa e Hrameskiri. <verse eid="LUK 21:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 21:2" />I dikhla jekhe čorole udovica sar mukhela duj tikne bakarna pare. <verse eid="LUK 21:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 21:3" />Togaš o Isus vakergja: “Čače vakerava tumenge, akaja čoroli udovica mukhla sarinendar najviše. <verse eid="LUK 21:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 21:4" />Soske sarinen denge taro adava so isi len poviše, ama oj, koja tani čoroli, dengja sa so sine la.”<verse eid="LUK 21:4" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O rušimo Hrami hem o znakija taro bare nevojle</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 21:5" />I dži kote nesave učenikija kerena sine lafi bašo Hrami, soj šukar ukrasimo šuže barencar hem poklonencar soj tane posvetime e Devleske, o Isus vakergja: <verse eid="LUK 21:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 21:6" />“Ka avel dive koga taro sa akava so dikhena nane te ačhol bar upro bar. Sa ka ovel rušimo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 21:7" />Togaš o učenikija pučle e Isuse: “Učitele, koga ka ovel akava? Hem savo ka ovel o znako deka ka ovel adava?”<verse eid="LUK 21:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 21:8" />A o Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Pazinen te na oven hovavde. Soske but džene ka aven ko mo anav, hem ka vakeren: ‘Me sijum o Hristos,’ hem: ‘Alo paše o krajo akale vremeskoro.’ Ma džan pala lende! <verse eid="LUK 21:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 21:9" />Koga ka šunen deka isi vojne hem buniba, ma daran. Soske sa adava mora prvo te ovel, ama panda nane o krajo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 21:10" />Togaš vakergja lenge: “Ka ušten nacija protiv nacija, hem carstvo protiv carstvo. <verse eid="LUK 21:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 21:11" />Ko but thana ka oven zemijotresija, bokhalipe hem zarazno nasvalipe. Ka oven strašna bukja hem bare znakija taro nebo.<verse eid="LUK 21:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 21:12" />Ama angleder sa akava te ovel, ka astaren tumen hem ka progoninen tumen, ka legaren tumen ko sudo ko sinagoge hem ka frden tumen ko zatvor, ka legaren tumen anglo cajra hem vlastija, i sa adava ka ovel baši mange. <verse eid="LUK 21:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 21:13" />Adava ka ovel tumenge te šaj svedočinena mandar. <verse eid="LUK 21:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 21:14" />Adaleske pamtinen akava: ma sekirinen tumen angleder save lafencar ka braninen tumen. <verse eid="LUK 21:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 21:15" />Soske me ka dav tumen lafija hem mudrost so nijekh taro tumare protivnikija ka našti te iranel tumenge lafi. <verse eid="LUK 21:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 21:16" />A ka oven predajme taro tumare dada hem daja, tumare phrajla, tumari familija hem amala; a nesave tumendar ka oven mudarde. <verse eid="LUK 21:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 21:17" />I sarinen ka mrzinen tumen baši mange, <verse eid="LUK 21:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 21:18" />ama ni jekh bal taro tumaro šero nane te perel. <verse eid="LUK 21:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 21:19" />Ačhoven verna hem ka dobinen o večno životo.”<verse eid="LUK 21:19" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus vakerela bašo Erusalim deka ka ovel uništimo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 21:20" />“Koga ka dikhen o Erusalim opkolimo taro vojske, džanen deka leskoro uništiba tano paše. <verse eid="LUK 21:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 21:21" />Togaš okola soj ki Judeja neka našen ko planine, a okola soj tane ko Erusalim neka iklon avrijal, a okola soj tane ko gava ma te khuven ko gradi. <verse eid="LUK 21:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 21:22" />Adaleske so adava ka ovel vreme tari e Devleskiri kazna te phergjol sa adava soj tano pišimo. <verse eid="LUK 21:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 21:23" />Ama but pharo ka ovel ko adala dive e khamne romnenge hem adalenge so dena thud! Soske bari muka ka ovel ki phuv hem e Devleskiri holi ka perel upro akava narodo. <verse eid="LUK 21:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 21:24" />Nekoj lendar ka oven mudarde čhurikaja, a javera ka oven legarde sar zatvorenikija maškar sa o nacije. A o Erusalim ka ovel gazimo taro manuša so nane Evreja, sa dži kote na phergjola lengoro vreme.”<verse eid="LUK 21:24" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O ajbe e Isuseskoro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 21:25" />“I ka oven znakija ko kham, ki mesečina, hem ko čerenja, a ki phuv o manuša ka oven ki muka hem ka oven bunime tari bari galama hem taro bare talasija e moreskere. <verse eid="LUK 21:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 21:26" />O manuša ka meren tari dar hem taro adava so adžikerela pe so ka ovel e svetoja. Adaleske so o nebesna sile ka oven potresime. <verse eid="LUK 21:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 21:27" />Hem togaš o manuša ka dikhen o Čhavo Manušeskoro, sar avela upro oblakija bare silaja hem bare slavaja. <verse eid="LUK 21:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 21:28" />A koga ka počminel te ovel sa adava, ušten ko pre bizi dar hem vazden tumare šere, soske paše tano tumaro spasenije.”<verse eid="LUK 21:28" /></para>
  <para style="s1">I sporedba tari smokva</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 21:29" />Togaš o Isus vakergja lenge akaja parabola: “Dikhen i smokva hem sa o kašta. <verse eid="LUK 21:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 21:30" />Koga ka iklon o listija, korkori džanen deka o nilaj tano paše. <verse eid="LUK 21:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 21:31" />Hem agjar tumen, koga ka dikhen deka sa adava ovela, džanen deka paše tano o carstvo e Devleskoro. <verse eid="LUK 21:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 21:32" />Čače vakerava tumenge: akaja generacija nane te nakhel dži kote sa akava na ovela. <verse eid="LUK 21:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 21:33" />O nebo hem i phuv ka nakhen, ama me lafija nikat nane te nakhen.”<verse eid="LUK 21:33" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Oven spremna bašo e Isuseskoro ajbe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 21:34" />I o Isus vakergja lenge: “Pazinen tumen te na oven tumare srcija preukopirime hajbaja pijbaja, makjojbaja hem akale životoskere sekiribaja, i te resel tumen adava dive iznenadeno. <verse eid="LUK 21:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 21:35" />Soske adava dive ka avel sar zamka upro sa o manuša so živinena ki celo phuv. <verse eid="LUK 21:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 21:36" />Adaleske sekat oven džangavde hem molinen tumen te šaj te nakhaven sa adava so trebela te ovel hem te šaj te tergjoven anglo o Čhavo Manušeskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 21:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 21:37" />Sekova dive o Isus sikavela sine ko Hrami, a sekoja rat iklola sine taro gradi hem džala sine te nakhavel i rat ki Maslinovo Gora. <verse eid="LUK 21:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 21:38" />I sa o manuša džana sine rano sabajleja ko Hrami te šunen le.<verse eid="LUK 21:38" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 21" />
  <chapter number="22" style="c" sid="LUK 22" />
  <para style="s1">Jekh taro dešuduj ka predajnel e Isuse</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 22:1" />Avela sine paše o prazniko e Beskvasno Mareskoro so vikinela pe sine Pasha. <verse eid="LUK 22:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 22:2" />O prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere rodena sine sar te mudaren e Isuse, ama darana sine taro narodo.<verse eid="LUK 22:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 22:3" />Togaš o Beng khugja ko Juda, so vikinela pe Iskariot, so sine jekh taro dešuduj apostojla. <verse eid="LUK 22:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 22:4" />Ov gelo ko prvosveštenikija hem ko čuvajra e Hrameskere hem dogovoringja pe lencar sar te predajnel e Isuse. <verse eid="LUK 22:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 22:5" />Koga ola šunge adava, radujnge pe hem vakerge leske deka ka den le pare. <verse eid="LUK 22:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 22:6" />Ov soglasingja pe hem rodela sine šužo momenti te predajnel e Isuse koga nane te ovel i gužva uza leste.<verse eid="LUK 22:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus bičhavela pe dujen učeniko te spreminen i Pasha</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 22:7" />Koga alo o prvo dive taro prazniko e Beskvasno Mareske, ko savo trebela sine te čhinen e bakhre baši Pasha, <verse eid="LUK 22:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 22:8" />o Isus bičhalgja e Petare hem e Jovane vakerindor: “Džan hem spreminen amenge te ha o hajbe e Pashakoro!”<verse eid="LUK 22:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 22:9" />Ola pučle le: “Kaj mangeja te kera o hajbe?”<verse eid="LUK 22:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 22:10" />O Isus odgovoringja lenge: “Koga ka khuven ko gradi, ka arakhen jekh manuš so phiravela pani ko bukali. Džan pala leste hem ko kova kher ka khuvel, <verse eid="LUK 22:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 22:11" />vakeren e gazdaske: ‘O učiteli pučela ki savi soba ka hal pe učenikoncar o hajbe baši Pasha?’ <verse eid="LUK 22:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 22:12" />Ov ka sikavel tumenge i bari upruni soba soj više spremimi. Adathe keren amenge o hajbe.”<verse eid="LUK 22:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 22:13" />I ola gele hem arakhle agjar sar so phengja lenge o Isus hem adathe kerge o hajbe e Pashakoro.<verse eid="LUK 22:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus hala i posledno večera e učenikoncar</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 22:14" />Koga alo o vreme, o Isus alo uza ko astali pe apostolencar.<verse eid="LUK 22:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 22:15" />I phengja lenge: “Kozom manglum te hav akaja Pasha tumencar angleder te cidav sa o pharipe. <verse eid="LUK 22:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 22:16" />Adaleske so vakerava tumenge, nane te hav više i Pasha sa dži kote na phergjola ko carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 22:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 22:17" />Togaš lela i čaša, blagodaringja hem vakergja e apostolenge: “Len akaja mol hem delinen la maškar tumende. <verse eid="LUK 22:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 22:18" />Adaleske so vakerava tumenge, nane te pijav više mol, sa dži kote na avela o carstvo e Devleskoro.”<verse eid="LUK 22:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 22:19" />I lela o maro o Isus, blagodaringja, phagla le hem dengja e apostolenge vakerindor: “Akavaj mo telo so dela pe baši tumenge. Keren akava te setinen tumen ki mande.”<verse eid="LUK 22:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 22:20" />Isto agjar, pali večera lela i čaša e mojlaja hem phengja: “Akaja čaša e mojlaja tano o Nevo Zavet ko mo rat, so čhorgjola tumenge.<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:20 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 24:8">Iz 24:8</ref>; <ref loc="JER 31:31-34">Ere 31:31-34</ref>.</char></note> <verse eid="LUK 22:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 22:21" />Ama akje, o manuš so predajngja man tano mancar ki sofra. <verse eid="LUK 22:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 22:22" />Adaleske so o Čhavo Manušeskoro mora te merel sar soj vakerdo, ama pharo adale manušeske so ka predajnel le!” <verse eid="LUK 22:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 22:23" />I o učenikija počminge te pučen pe maškar peste, koj tano adava lendar so ka kerel akava.<verse eid="LUK 22:23" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Koj tano najbaro</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 22:24" />I o učenikija počminge te akošen pe koj tano lendar najbaro.<verse eid="LUK 22:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 22:25" />A o Isus phengja lenge: “Javere nacijengere cajra so na džanena e Devle vladinena upro lende hem o upravnikija da lengere vladinena silaja upro lende hem vikinena len ‘manuša so kerena šukaripe’. <verse eid="LUK 22:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 22:26" />Ama tumen ma oven asavke! Nego, o najbaro maškar tumende, neka ovel najtikno, a o vodači neka ovel sar sluga. <verse eid="LUK 22:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 22:27" />Koj tano pobaro? Adava soj ki sofra ili okova so služinela? Nane li adava soj tano uza ki sofra? Ama me sijum maškar tumende sar okova so služinela. <verse eid="LUK 22:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 22:28" />A tumen sijen sine adala so tergjona sine mancar ko me iskušenia. <verse eid="LUK 22:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 22:29" />I me dava tumen o carstvo, sar so mo Dad dengja man, <verse eid="LUK 22:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 22:30" />te šaj te han hem te pijen ko mo astali ko mo carstvo hem te bešen ko tronija te sudinen upro dešuduj plemija e Izraeleskere.”<verse eid="LUK 22:30" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar ka otkažinel pe taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 22:31" />O Isus phengja: “Simone, Simone, akje, o Beng rodingja te iskušinel tumen sar koga sejnela pe o giv ki sita. <verse eid="LUK 22:31" /><verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 22:32" />Ama me molingjum man tuke te na našave ti vera. A tu, koga ka pokajne tut hem ka irane tut ki mande, ohrabrin te phralen.”<verse eid="LUK 22:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 22:33" />Ama o Petar odgovoringja leske: “Gospode, me sijum spremno te džav tuja hem ko zatvor hem ko meriba.”<verse eid="LUK 22:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 22:34" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Vakerava tuke, Petar, avdive angleder o bašno te gilavel tu trin puti ka phene deka na pendžareja man.”<verse eid="LUK 22:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 22:35" />I o Isus pučlja e apostolen: “Koga bičhalgjum tumen ko drumo bizo kesa parencar, bizo torba hem bizo javera sandale, falingja li nešto tumenge?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:35">Ola odgovoringe: “Ništo.”<verse eid="LUK 22:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 22:36" />Togaš o Isus vakergja lenge: “Ama akana kas isi kesa parencar, neka lel la! Isto agjar i torba da! A kas nane čhurik, neka bikinel po mantili hem neka kinel peske jekh čhurik. <verse eid="LUK 22:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 22:37" />Soske vakerava tumenge, mora te phergjol adava soj mandar pišimo ko Sveto Lil:</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 22:37" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 22:37">‘Dikhle le sar jekh kriminalco.’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">22:37 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ISA 53:12">Isa 53:12</ref>.</char></note></para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 22:37" />
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:37">Čače adava soj pišimo baši mange phergjola.”<verse eid="LUK 22:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 22:38" />A ola vakerge: “Gospode, akje isi amen duj čhurika!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:38">I ov odgovoringja: “Dovolno i.”<verse eid="LUK 22:38" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskiri molitva ki Maslinova Gora</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 22:39" />I o Isus iklilo adathar hem sar stalno gelo ki Maslinovo Gora. A leja gele leskere učenikija. <verse eid="LUK 22:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 22:40" />Koga resla adathe, vakergja lenge: “Molinen tumen te na peren ko iskušenie!”<verse eid="LUK 22:40" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 22:41" />I cidingja pe lendar, doborom kozom so šaj te frdel pe o bar, pelo ko kočaka hem molingja pe <verse eid="LUK 22:41" /><verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 22:42" />vakerindor: “Dade, te manglan cide mandar akaja čaša e pharipaja, ama neka ovel ti vojla, a na mli.” <verse eid="LUK 22:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 22:43" />Togaš pojavisalilo angeli taro nebo hem ohrabringja le. <verse eid="LUK 22:43" /><verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 22:44" />A koga sine leske po pharo, molingja pe po silno, a leskoro poti sine sar kapke rat so perena sine ki phuv.<verse eid="LUK 22:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 22:45" />Koga uštilo tari molitva, irangja pe ko pe učenikija hem arakhla len sar sovena, adaleske so sine umorna tari žal. <verse eid="LUK 22:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 22:46" />I pučlja len: “Soske sovena? Ušten hem molinen tumen te na peren ko iskušenie!”<verse eid="LUK 22:46" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro astariba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 22:47" />Dži kote o Isus panda kerela sine lafi, ale ki leste but manuša, so angja len o Juda, jekh taro dešuduj apostojla. Ov alo uza ko Isus te čuminel le ki čham. <verse eid="LUK 22:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 22:48" />A o Isus pučlja le: “Juda, čumindor li ka predajne e Čhave Manušeskere?”<verse eid="LUK 22:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 22:49" />Koga o učenikija e Isuseskere dikhle so ka ovel, pučle le: “Gospode, te khuva li len čhurikencar?”<verse eid="LUK 22:49" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 22:50" />I jekh lendar khugja e bare sveštenikoskere sluga hem čhingja leskoro desno kan.<verse eid="LUK 22:50" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 22:51" />A o Isus odgovoringja pe učenikonge: “Ačhoven, mukhen više akava!” I čhigja po vas upro leskoro kan hem sasljargja le.<verse eid="LUK 22:51" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 22:52" />Togaš o Isus phengja okolenge so ale te astaren le, e prvosveštenikonge, e čuvarenge taro Hrami hem e starešinenge: “Sar buntovnikoske ko than alen čhurikencar hem kaštencar te astaren man. <verse eid="LUK 22:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 22:53" />Sekova dive sijum sine tumencar ko Hrami hem tumen na astargjen man. Ama akavaj tumaro vreme hem i sila e temninakiri vladinela.”<verse eid="LUK 22:53" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Petar otkažinela pe taro Isus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 22:54" />I astarge e Isuse hem adathar legarge le ko kher e bare sveštenikoske. Ama o Petar duraldan džala sine pala lende. <verse eid="LUK 22:54" /><verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 22:55" />Koga nekoj tharge jag maškar ko dvoro hem bešle uza late, o Petar da bešla uza ki jag lencar.<verse eid="LUK 22:55" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 22:56" />I nesavi slugjinka dikhla e Petare sar bešela uza ki jag, dikhla le šukar hem phengja: “Akava da manuš sine e Isuseja!”<verse eid="LUK 22:56" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="57" style="v" sid="LUK 22:57" />Ama ov otkažisalilo vakerindor: “Manušnije, na pendžarava le.”<verse eid="LUK 22:57" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="58" style="v" sid="LUK 22:58" />Na nakhla but palo adava, nesavo javer manuš dikhla le hem phengja leske: “Tu da sijan jekh lendar!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:58">A o Petar odgovoringja: “Manušeja, na sijum!”<verse eid="LUK 22:58" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="59" style="v" sid="LUK 22:59" />Koga nakhla paše jekh sati, nesavo javer počmingja te tvrdinel vakerindor: “Čače akava da manuš sine e Isuseja, soske ov da tano Galilejco.”<verse eid="LUK 22:59" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="60" style="v" sid="LUK 22:60" />A o Petar odgovoringja: “Manušeja, na džanava bašo so pheneja!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:60">I dži kote vakerela sine adava, odma o bašno gilagja.<verse eid="LUK 22:60" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="61" style="v" sid="LUK 22:61" />Togaš o Gospodari o Isus irangja pe hem dikhla e Petare. A ov setingja pe ko lafija e Isuseskere so phengja leske: “Avdive angleder o bašno te gilavel, tu trin puti ka phene deka na pendžareja man.” <verse eid="LUK 22:61" /><verse number="62" style="v" sid="LUK 22:62" />I iklilo avrik hem silno rungja.<verse eid="LUK 22:62" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O čuvajra asan e Isuseske</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="63" style="v" sid="LUK 22:63" />O čuvajra so arakhena sine e Isus, počminge te asan leske hem te maren le. <verse eid="LUK 22:63" /><verse number="64" style="v" sid="LUK 22:64" />Phandle leskere jakha hem phenge: “Prorokujn! Koj khugja tut?” <verse eid="LUK 22:64" /><verse number="65" style="v" sid="LUK 22:65" />I bute javere lafencar uvredžinena sine e Isuse.<verse eid="LUK 22:65" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo Evrejsko Sovet</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="66" style="v" sid="LUK 22:66" />Koga phravdilo o sabaj, khedisalile o starešine e narodoskere; o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere, ange e Isus anglo Evrejsko Sovet, <verse eid="LUK 22:66" /><verse number="67" style="v" sid="LUK 22:67" />hem phenge leske: “Ako tu sijan o Hristos, vaker amenge!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:67">A ov odgovoringja: “Ako phengjum tumenge, nane te verujnen, <verse eid="LUK 22:67" /><verse number="68" style="v" sid="LUK 22:68" />i te pučljum tumen, nane te odgovorinen. <verse eid="LUK 22:68" /><verse number="69" style="v" sid="LUK 22:69" />Ama taro akava dive, o Čhavo Manušeskoro ka bešela tari desno strana e Najsilno Devleskiri.”<verse eid="LUK 22:69" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="70" style="v" sid="LUK 22:70" />I sarine pučle le: “Znači tu sijan o Čhavo e Devleskoro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 22:70">A ov odgovoringja: “Agjar i sar so vakerena: Me sijum.”<verse eid="LUK 22:70" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="71" style="v" sid="LUK 22:71" />Togaš ola vakerge: “Na trebela amen više svedokija. Sarine amen šungjem so ov korkori vakergja!”<verse eid="LUK 22:71" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 22" />
  <chapter number="23" style="c" sid="LUK 23" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo Pilat</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 23:1" />Togaš celo Evrejsko Sovet uštilo hem legargja e Isuse ko Pilat, o upravniko e Rimeskoro, <verse eid="LUK 23:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 23:2" />i počmingja te vakeren protiv leste: “Arakhlem akale manuše sar pherela amare narodo hem vakerela lenge te na platinen o danok e caroske, a peske vakerela deka tano o Hristos, o caro.”<verse eid="LUK 23:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 23:3" />Togaš o Pilat pučlja e Isuse: “Tu li sijan o caro e Evrejengoro?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:3">O Isus odgovoringja leske: “Adava tu pheneja.”<verse eid="LUK 23:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 23:4" />Togaš o Pilat vakergja e prvosveštenikonge hem e narodoske: “Na arakhava nisavi krivica upro akava manuš!”<verse eid="LUK 23:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 23:5" />Ama ola panda poviše phenena sine: “Ov pe učibaja buninela sa e manušen ki celo phuv e Evrejengiri. Počmingja tari Galileja hem akana resla dži akate ko Erusalim!”<verse eid="LUK 23:5" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus anglo Irod</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 23:6" />Koga šungja adava o Pilat, pučlja len dali o Isus Galilejco. <verse eid="LUK 23:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 23:7" />I koga phenge leske deka o Isus Galilejco, o Pilat bičhalgja le ko Irod, so vladinela sine ki Galileja. A ko adava dive isto o Irod sine ko Erusalim.<verse eid="LUK 23:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 23:8" />Koga o Irod dikhla e Isuse, but radujngja pe, soske but vreme adžikerela sine te dikhel le, adaleske so but šungja baši leske hem nadinela pe sine deka o Isus ka kerel nesavo čudo anglo leste. <verse eid="LUK 23:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 23:9" />Ov pučlja le but pučiba, ama o Isus na dela le sine nisavo odgovor. <verse eid="LUK 23:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 23:10" />A o prvosveštenikija hem o učitejla e Zakoneskere tergjona sine hem silno vakerena sine protiv o Isus. <verse eid="LUK 23:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 23:11" />Togaš o Irod hem leskere vojnikija ponižinge hem asandile e Isuseske. Urage le carska šeja hem o Irod bičhalgja le palal ko Pilat. <verse eid="LUK 23:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 23:12" />Ko adava dive o Irod hem o Pilat ule amala, a angleder adava ola sine dušmajna.<verse eid="LUK 23:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Pilat osudinela e Isuse ko meriba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 23:13" />O Pilat vikingja ki peste e prvosveštenikon, e vodačen hem e narodo, <verse eid="LUK 23:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 23:14" />i vakergja lenge: “Angjen ki mande akale manuše vakerindor deka kerela buna maškar o narodo. Akje, angla tumende pučljum le adalestar, ama na arakhlum nisavi krivica baši so tumen tužinena le. <verse eid="LUK 23:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 23:15" />A ni o Irod na arakhla upra leste krivica, i adaleske bičhalgja le palal ki amende. Akava manuš na kergja ništo so zaslužinela meriba. <verse eid="LUK 23:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 23:16" />Adaleske samo ka naredinav te kamšikujnen le hem ka mukhav le.” <verse eid="LUK 23:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 23:17" />[A trebingja bašo prazniko, palo adeti, te oslobodinel lenge jekhe zatvoreniko.]<verse eid="LUK 23:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 23:18" />Ama sa o manuša vikinge: “Mudar akale manuše, a mukh amenge e Varava!” <verse eid="LUK 23:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 23:19" />(O Varava sine phandlo ko zatvor, soske sine ki nesavi buna ko Erusalim hem so mudargja nekas.)<verse eid="LUK 23:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 23:20" />A o Pilat palem kergja lencar lafi, adaleske so mangla te mukhel e Isuse.<verse eid="LUK 23:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 23:21" />Ama ola vikinge: “Čhiv le ko krsto! Čhiv le ko krsto!”<verse eid="LUK 23:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 23:22" />A o Pilat trito puti phengja lenge: “Soske? Savo lošnipe kergja? Me na arakhlum ništo ki leste so zaslužinela te merel. Ka naredinav te kamšikujnen le hem ka mukhav le.”<verse eid="LUK 23:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 23:23" />Ama ola na čhinage hem sa pe glasoja vikinge rodindor te čhivel e Isuse ko krsto. A lengiri vika sine sa posilno. <verse eid="LUK 23:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 23:24" />I adaleske o Pilat odlučingja te del len adava so mangena. <verse eid="LUK 23:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 23:25" />Mukhla lenge okole manuše so mangena, so sine ko zatvor baši buna hem bašo mudariba, a e Isuse dengja ko vojnikija te keren leja adava so o manuša mangle.<verse eid="LUK 23:25" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuse čhivena ko krsto</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 23:26" />Dži kote o vojnikija legarena sine e Isuse, astarge nesave Simone tari Kirineea sar avela sine tari niva. Čhige o krsto upro leste hem čhige le te phiravel le palo Isus. <verse eid="LUK 23:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 23:27" />But manuša džana sine palo Isus, a maškar lende sine o džuvla da so rovena sine hem žalinena le.<verse eid="LUK 23:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 23:28" />Ama o Isus irangja pe ki lende hem phengja lenge: “Čhajalen taro Erusalim, ma roven baši mange, nego roven tumenge hem tumare čhavenge. <verse eid="LUK 23:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 23:29" />Soske ka avel o dive koga ka vakeren: ‘Blagoslovime tane o romnja soj bizo čhave, so na bijange hem so na denge thud.’ <verse eid="LUK 23:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 23:30" />Togaš</para>
  <para style="b" vid="LUK 23:30" />
  <para style="q1" vid="LUK 23:30">‘ka vakeren e planinenge: “Peren upra amende!”</para>
  <para style="q2" vid="LUK 23:30">hem e ridonge: “Učharen amen!”’<note caller="-" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">23:30 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="HOS 10:8">Os 10:8</ref>.</char></note><verse eid="LUK 23:30" /></para>
  <para style="b" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 23:31" />Soske ako o manuša kerena akala bukja koga o kaš tano zeleno, so ka ovel koga o kaš ka ovel šuko?”<verse eid="LUK 23:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 23:32" />E Isuseja sine legarde panda duje buntovnikon te oven mudarde. <verse eid="LUK 23:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 23:33" />I koga resle ko than so vikinela pe sine Čerep, adathe o vojnikija čhige e Isuse ko krsto hem leja čhige adale buntovnikon, jekh tari desno strana, hem jekh tari levo strana.<verse eid="LUK 23:33" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 23:34" />O Isus phengja: “Mo dad, oprostin lenge, soske na džanena so kerena.”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 23:34">Togaš o vojnikija frdinge ždrepka hem agjar delinge maškar peste e Isuseskere šeja.<verse eid="LUK 23:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 23:35" />O narodo tergjola sine hem dikhela, a o vodačija e Evrejengere asana sine e Isuseske vakerindor: “Javeren spasingja, a akana neka spasinel korkori pes ako tano čače ov o Hristos e Devleskoro, o Birimo!”<verse eid="LUK 23:35" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 23:36" />Hem o vojnikija asana sine e Isuseske. Ale uza leste hem ponudinge le šut, <verse eid="LUK 23:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 23:37" />vakerindor: “Ako sijan o caro e Evrejengoro, spasin tut!”<verse eid="LUK 23:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 23:38" />A upreder leskoro šero sine natpis kote so pišinela sine:</para>
  <para style="pc" vid="LUK 23:38">“AKAVAJ O CARO E EVREJENGORO.”<verse eid="LUK 23:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 23:39" />Jekh taro buntovnikija so sine čhivdo ko krsto uvredžingja e Isuse vakerindor: “Ako sijan o Hristos, soske na spasineja tut hem amen?”<verse eid="LUK 23:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 23:40" />A o dujto buntovniko opomeningja adale so uvredžingja e Isuse: “Na daraja li e Devlestar? Soske tu da sijan agjar osudimo sar soj ov. <verse eid="LUK 23:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 23:41" />Amen pravedno sijem kaznime baši amare lošna dejla, ama akava manuš na kergja ništo lošnipe.”<verse eid="LUK 23:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 23:42" />Togaš vakergja: “Isuse, setin tut ki mande koga ka ave ko to carstvo.”<verse eid="LUK 23:42" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 23:43" />A o Isus odgovoringja leske: “Čače vakerava tuke, avdive ka ove mancar ko raj.”<verse eid="LUK 23:43" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro meriba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 23:44" />A ko dešuduj o sati, temnisalilo ki celo phuv hem agjar sine trin satija, <verse eid="LUK 23:44" /><verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 23:45" />soske o kham kalilo. A e Hrameskiri zavesa pharavdili ko ekvaš.<verse eid="LUK 23:45" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 23:46" />A o Isus vikingja sa pe glasoja: “Mo dad, tuke ko vasta mukhava mo duho!” Koga phengja adava, mukhla pi duša.<verse eid="LUK 23:46" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 23:47" />A koga o Rimsko kapetani dikhla so ulo, počmingja te slavinel e Devle vakerindor: “Čače akava manuš sine pravedno!”<verse eid="LUK 23:47" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 23:48" />Koga sa o narodo khedinge pe te dikhen adava, dikhle so ulo hem iranindor khere khuvena pe sine ko kolin adaleske so sine lenge žal. <verse eid="LUK 23:48" /><verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 23:49" />A sarinen so džanena sine e Isuse, dži o romnja so džana sine palo leste panda tari Galileja, duraldan tergjona sine hem dikhena sine adava.<verse eid="LUK 23:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">E Isuseskoro parujba</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50-51" style="v" sid="LUK 23:50-51" />A adathe sine jekh manuš so vikinela pe sine Josif tari Arimateja, gradi ki Judeja. Ov sine šukar hem pravedno manuš so adžikerela sine o carstvo e Devleskoro. Iako sine členi taro Sovet e Evrejengoro, na soglasingja pe adaleja so sine odlučimo te roden e Isuse te ovel mudardo. <verse eid="LUK 23:50-51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 23:52" />Ov gelo ko Pilat hem rodingja o telo e Isuseskoro. <verse eid="LUK 23:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 23:53" />Togaš hujlargja o telo e Isuseskoro taro krsto, pakjargja le laneno čaršafeja hem čhigja le ko grobo savo sine kerdo ki karpa, ko savo panda nikoj na sine čhivdo. <verse eid="LUK 23:53" /><verse number="54" style="v" sid="LUK 23:54" />Sine dive bašo spremiba, a i sabota avela sine.<verse eid="LUK 23:54" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="55" style="v" sid="LUK 23:55" />A o romnja so ale e Isuseja tari Galileja, gele e Josifeja hem dikhle sar e Isuseskoro telo sine čhivdo ko grobo. <verse eid="LUK 23:55" /><verse number="56" style="v" sid="LUK 23:56" />I irange pe khere hem spreminge mirisija hem mastija te makhen o telo e Isuseskoro. Ama ki sabota odmoringe pe, poštojndor i naredba taro Zakoni e Mojsijaskoro.<verse eid="LUK 23:56" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 23" />
  <chapter number="24" style="c" sid="LUK 24" />
  <para style="s1">O Isus uštilo taro mule</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="LUK 24:1" />Rano sabajle, ko prvo dive taro kurko, o džuvla lele o mirisija so spreminge len hem ale ko grobo. <verse eid="LUK 24:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="LUK 24:2" />I arakhle o bar cidimo taro udara e groboskoro. <verse eid="LUK 24:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="LUK 24:3" />Koga khuge andre, na arakhle o telo e Gospodareskoro e Isuseskoro. <verse eid="LUK 24:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="LUK 24:4" />I dži kote tergjona sine adathe bunime, taro jekh puti pojavisalile anglo lende duj murša ko parne šeja so svetinena. <verse eid="LUK 24:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="LUK 24:5" />O džuvla but darandile hem telarge po šero, a ola vakerge lenge: “Soske rodena e dživde maškar o mule? <verse eid="LUK 24:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="LUK 24:6" />Ov nane akate. Uštilo taro mule! Setinen tumen so vakergja tumenge dži kote sine tumencar ki Galileja: <verse eid="LUK 24:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="LUK 24:7" />‘O Čhavo Manušeskoro mora te ovel predajmo ko vasta e grešnikonge hem te ovel čhivdo ko krsto, a o trito dive te uštel taro mule.’” <verse eid="LUK 24:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="LUK 24:8" />Togaš setinge pe ko lafija e Isuseskere.<verse eid="LUK 24:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="LUK 24:9" />Koga irange pe taro grobo palal ko gradi, vakerge sa adava leskere dešujekhe apostolenge hem sarinenge so sine adathe. <verse eid="LUK 24:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="LUK 24:10" />Adala džuvla so vakerge e apostolenge sine i Marija tari Magdala, i Joana, i Marija e Jakoveskiri daj, hem nesave javera. <verse eid="LUK 24:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="LUK 24:11" />Ama ola na verujnge e romnen, soske mislinge deka sa adava ola izmislinge. <verse eid="LUK 24:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="LUK 24:12" />A o Petar uštilo hem prastandilo dži ko grobo. Telilo hem dikhla samo o čaršafi so sine leste pakjardo e Isuseskoro telo. I irangja pe palal pučindor pes so sine adava.<verse eid="LUK 24:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela pe duje učenikonge ko drumo bašo Emaus</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="LUK 24:13" />Ko adava dive duj taro e Isuseskere sledbenikija džana sine ko nesavo gav so vikinela pe Emaus, dur taro Erusalim dešujekh kilometre. <verse eid="LUK 24:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="LUK 24:14" />Drumaldan kerena sine lafi maškar peste baši sa so ulo akala dive. <verse eid="LUK 24:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="LUK 24:15" />Dži kote kerena sine lafi maškar peste bašo akala bukja, korkori o Isus alo uza lende hem lela te phirel lencar. <verse eid="LUK 24:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="LUK 24:16" />Ama lenge na sine dendo te pendžaren le.<verse eid="LUK 24:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="LUK 24:17" />I o Isus pučlja len: “Baši so kerena lafi dži kote phirena?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:17">Ola ačhile, a ko lengoro muj dikhlili žalost.<verse eid="LUK 24:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="LUK 24:18" />Jekh lendar, so vikinela pe sine Kleopa, pučlja le: “Tu sijan jedino jabandžija so na džanela so ulo ko Erusalim akala dive?”<verse eid="LUK 24:18" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="LUK 24:19" />O Isus pučlja: “So ulo?”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:19">Ola odgovoringe: “Adava so ulo e Isuseja taro Nazaret. Ov sine proroko zoralo ko pe lafija hem ko pe dejla anglo Devel hem anglo sa o narodo. <verse eid="LUK 24:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="LUK 24:20" />Ama o prvosveštenikija hem amare vodačija predajnge le te ovel osudimo ko meriba hem čhige le ko krsto. <verse eid="LUK 24:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="LUK 24:21" />A amen nadingjem amen deka ov tano adava so ka otkupinel e Izraeleskere narodo. A akje više trito dive sar ulo sa adava. <verse eid="LUK 24:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="LUK 24:22" />Uza ko adava buninge amen nesave taro amare džuvla. Ola gele rano sabajleja ko grobo, <verse eid="LUK 24:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="LUK 24:23" />ama na arakhle e Isuseskoro telo adathe. I ale hem vakerge amenge deka pojavinge pe lenge angejla so vakerge lenge deka o Isus tano dživdo. <verse eid="LUK 24:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="LUK 24:24" />Palo adava nesave taro amare gele ko grobo hem arakhle agjar sar so vakerge lenge o džuvla. Ama na dikhle e Isuse.”<verse eid="LUK 24:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="LUK 24:25" />Togaš o Isus phengja lenge: “O sar na svatinena? Soske tumenge pharo te verujnen ko sa adava so o prorokija vakerge? <verse eid="LUK 24:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="LUK 24:26" />Na trebela li sine o Hristos te nakhavel sa akava pharipe, a palo adava te khuvel ki pi slava?”<verse eid="LUK 24:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="LUK 24:27" />Togaš počmingja o Isus te objasninel lenge sa soj pišimo e Hristoske ko Sveta Lila, počmindor taro lila e Mojseskoro sa dži ko lila e Prorokongere.<verse eid="LUK 24:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="LUK 24:28" />Sar avena sine paše uza ko gav Emaus, o Isus kergja pe deka mangela po dur te džal. <verse eid="LUK 24:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="LUK 24:29" />Ama ola ačhage le vakerindor: “Ačhov amencar, soske počmingja te perel o kham, a i rat više avela!”</para>
  <para style="p" vid="LUK 24:29">I o Isus khugja ko kher hem ačhilo lencar.<verse eid="LUK 24:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="LUK 24:30" />Koga alo uza ko astali, lela maro, blagodaringja, phagla le hem dengja lenge. <verse eid="LUK 24:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="LUK 24:31" />Togaš phravdile lengere jakha hem pendžarge e Isuse, a ov taro jekh puti našavdilo anglo lengere jakha.<verse eid="LUK 24:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="LUK 24:32" />I ola počminge te pučen pe maškar peste: “Na sine li amen jag ko amaro srce dži kote vakerela sine amenge ko drumo hem objasninela sine amenge o Sveta lila?”<verse eid="LUK 24:32" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="33" style="v" sid="LUK 24:33" />I odma uštile hem irange pe ko Erusalim. A adathe arakhle e dešujekhe apostolen hem okolen so sine khedime lencar, <verse eid="LUK 24:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="LUK 24:34" />sar vakerena: “O Gospodari čače uštilo taro mule hem sikavgja pe e Simoneske!”<verse eid="LUK 24:34" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="35" style="v" sid="LUK 24:35" />Togaš o duj manuša vakerge lenge sa so ulo ko drumo hem sar pendžarge e Isuse koga phagla o maro.<verse eid="LUK 24:35" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus sikavela pe e učenikonge</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="36" style="v" sid="LUK 24:36" />Dži kote panda sine kerena lafi bašo adava, o Isus taro jekh puti pojavingja pe maškar lende hem vakergja: “Mir tumencar!”<verse eid="LUK 24:36" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="37" style="v" sid="LUK 24:37" />Ola sine bunime hem darandile, mislindor deka dikhena duho.<verse eid="LUK 24:37" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="LUK 24:38" />A ov vakergja lenge: “Soske darana? Hem soske isi tumen sumna ko tumaro srce? <verse eid="LUK 24:38" /><verse number="39" style="v" sid="LUK 24:39" />Dikhen me vasta hem me pre! Me sijum isto! Pipinen man hem dikhen! E duho nane le telo hem kokala, sar so dikhena man isi man!”<verse eid="LUK 24:39" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="40" style="v" sid="LUK 24:40" />Vakerindor akava, sikavgja pe vasta hem pe pre. <verse eid="LUK 24:40" /><verse number="41" style="v" sid="LUK 24:41" />Ola doborom sine radosna hem čudime deka našti sine te verujnen. Togaš o Isus pučlja len: “Isi li tumen nešto hajbaske akate?”<verse eid="LUK 24:41" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="42" style="v" sid="LUK 24:42" />I ola denge le jekh kotor peko mačho. <verse eid="LUK 24:42" /><verse number="43" style="v" sid="LUK 24:43" />Ov lela hem hala anglo lende.<verse eid="LUK 24:43" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="44" style="v" sid="LUK 24:44" />Hem vakergja: “Akavaj adava so vakergjum tumenge dži kote sijum sine tumencar: mora te phergjol sa soj pišimo baši mange ko Zakoni e Mojseskoro, ko lila e Prorokongere hem ko Psalmija.”<verse eid="LUK 24:44" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="45" style="v" sid="LUK 24:45" />Togaš phravgja lengiri godi te šaj te svatinen o Sveta Lila, <verse eid="LUK 24:45" /><verse number="46" style="v" sid="LUK 24:46" />i phengja lenge: “Agjar tano pišimo: O Hristos ka cidel hem o trito dive ka uštel taro mule, <verse eid="LUK 24:46" /><verse number="47" style="v" sid="LUK 24:47" />hem ko leskoro anav ka propovedinel pe o pokajanie bašo oprostiba o grevija sa e narodongere, počmindor taro Erusalim. <verse eid="LUK 24:47" /><verse number="48" style="v" sid="LUK 24:48" />Tumen sijen svedokija akalestar.<verse eid="LUK 24:48" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="49" style="v" sid="LUK 24:49" />A me ka bičhavav tumenge adava so vetingja le mo Dad. Ama ačhoven ko gradi dži kote i sila e Devleskiri na hulela upra tumende.”<verse eid="LUK 24:49" /></para>
  <para style="s1">O Isus voznesinela pe ko nebo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="50" style="v" sid="LUK 24:50" />Togaš o Isus legargja pe učenikon paše uza ki Vitanija, i vazdingja pe vasta hem blagoslovingja len. <verse eid="LUK 24:50" /><verse number="51" style="v" sid="LUK 24:51" />Dži kote blagoslovinela len sine, odvisalilo lendar hem voznesisalilo ko nebo. <verse eid="LUK 24:51" /><verse number="52" style="v" sid="LUK 24:52" />Togaš ola pele ko kočaka angli leste i ki bari radost irange pe ko Erusalim. <verse eid="LUK 24:52" /><verse number="53" style="v" sid="LUK 24:53" />Hem sekat sine ko Hrami te slavinen e Devle.<verse eid="LUK 24:53" /></para>
  <chapter eid="LUK 24" />
</usx>